1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOAN TITERELL. She married JOHN CHURCH, son of JOHN CHURCH and CATHERINE SWAN. He was born ABT 1548 in Sampford, Essex, England, and died BEF 4 NOV 1593 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOAN TITERELL and JOHN CHURCH are:
2 CONT *Henry Church died BEF 15 DEC 1592 in Essex, England.
2 CONT *Ruke Church.
2 CONT *Sampson Church was christened 2 OCT 1575 in Canterbury, Kent, England.
2 CONT *Arnold Church was christened 20 SEP 1576 in Canterbury, Kent, England.
2 CONT *RICHARD CHURCH was born 9 MAY 1570 in England, was christened 6 SEP 1579 in Milton Ernest, Bedfordshire, England, and died 1623 in Braintree, Essex, England
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut, 1708-1792, and His Descendants, by Charles Washburn Church.  Mattatuck Press, Waterbury, CT 1914 [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/6/mode/2up Page 6 - 7]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Church,Â born about 1548, son of John Church of Samford, Co Essex, married Joan Titerell. The distress of the poor during this time was very great and he was appointed by the officers of the church one of "two hable persons t
2 CONC o be gatherers for the poor." He died before Nov. 4 593. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were: i, Richard; 2 Ruke; 3, Sampson; 4, Arnold; 5, Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruke married Elinor Tey. His daughter Mary married John Jarvis, rector of North Cambridge, Co. Essex
2 CONT
2 CONT Sampson was bap. Oct. 2, 1575, at Canterbury
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnold was bap. Sept. 20, 1576, at Canterbury. HeÂ had a son Richard who married May 29, 1627, Jane Dewell
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry married Alice . He died before 1592Â leaving a son Henry, who married Elizabeth Vassell, daughter of John Vassell, an alderman of London andÂ ancestor of the Vassell families in America
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
