1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Thomas Atherold, III''' was born on August 16, 1590 in Woodbridge, Suffolk, England. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-100654041 Thomas Atherold, II] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3084504 Mary Hannah Atherold (
2 CONC Vessey)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-87870914 Mary Harvey] circa 1608 in London, Greater London, England, United Kingdom. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT #[https://www.geni.com/profile-33544579 Hannah (Atherold) Ball];
2 CONT #[https://www.geni.com/profile-34702559608 Thomas Atherold, II]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 6, 1658 in Burgh, Suffolk, England. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * http://maryballwashington.com/2013monograph2.pdf
