1 NOTE A barrister-at-law, who was living at Gray's Inn during 1610-1611 . He appears to have been the son of Thomas Atherold, of Burgh, Suffol k and Mary Vessey. Hannah Harvey's father was John Harvey (Heck) See Col onel William Ball, b
2 CONC elow. 1 2 3
2 CONT Birth: 16 AUG 1590 in Burgh, Suffolk, England Note: date 1590 per Moeller [1994] 4 5 6 Death: 06 MAY 1658 in co. Stradford, England Note: date if death as "May 6" from WFT E1-0053 3 6 Note: GAV-10 Birth: 1590 in Grays Inn, England
2 CONC   He was a barrister-at-law, who was living at Gray's Inn during 1610-1611. He appears to have been the son of Thomas Atherold of Burgh, Suffolk and Mary Vesey. (Heck)
2 CONT
