1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Church married Catherine Swan b: 1526/1530 in Sanford, Essex, England 1547 in Sanford, Essex, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # John Church b: Abt 1548 in Sanford, Essex, England Married Joan Titerell
2 CONT # Thomas Church b: Abt 1550 in Sanford, Essex, England.  Married Thomazine.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut By Charles Washburn Church [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up page 4-5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Church, son of Reynold and Margaret, born about 1505, of Castle Camps, Cambridgeshire, was counsellor at law and steward of the Earl of Oxford. (Harleian manuscript, 1542.)  He had two sons, Bartholomew and John. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Church''', son of Robert Church of Castell Camps, of Sanford, Co. Essex, as appears from a Harleian manuscript, married Catherine Swan, probably in 1547, and was made freeman in that year. He had an armory. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were John and Thomas:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Thomas married Thomazine. He was warden of St. Clements, Ipswich, in 1597. They had a son Thomas who settled in London and had children baptized in St. James ; also son John, who settled at Wymingwell, Kent ; Charles, who marrie
2 CONC d June 8, 1580, Constant Sapcott ; Robert, who married March 25, 1509, Elisabeth Barnards; and Richard, who married Agnes and died Aug. 24, 1603. 
2 CONT * John Church born about 1548, son of John Church of Samford, Co. Essex, married Joan Titerell.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT * https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=sbeightler&id=P66139301
2 CONT * https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=stuntz&id=I18299&ti=%2C+
