1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary (Vessey) Atherold''' was born circa 1568 in Little Baddow, Essex , England, present United Kingdom. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191780 Thomas Vessey, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191781 Eliza
2 CONC beth (Church) Vessey]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34681361106 George Storye]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34680872864 Alice (Storye) Beard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-100654041 Thomas Atherold, II] on June 10, 1610 in Burgh, Suffolk, England. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-21544610 Thomas Atherold, III]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in March 1665 in Burgh, Suffolk , England, present United Kingdom. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
