2 CONT  Note: Some have her as the wife of John Harvey and being buried in May 1665 at Burgh, Suffolk. I doubt that she could have lived to be ABT age 103, and that this date was likely the burial for John Harvey's daughter, Mary. Mary V
2 CONC essey was said to be from Aldham, Suffolk.   Father: Thomas II * Vessey  b: ABT 1527 in Aldham, Suffolk, England  Mother: Elizabeth * Church  b: ABT 1530 in Maldon, Essex, England  Marriage 1 George Storye b: ? 
