2 CONT Vesey  Widow of William Herbert   dau of Thomas Vesey of Oldham, Gent: (widow of Wm. Herbert)  (A Geanealogy of the Glassell Family, page 52)
2 CONT   Father: *Thomas VESSEY b: 1536 in Aldham, Suffolk, England  Mother: *Elizabeth CHURCH b: 1550 in of Malden, Essex, England  Marriage 1 *Thomas ATHEROLDb: 1570 in Burgh, Suffolk, England 
