1 NOTE Name: Mary Harvey 1 Sex: F Birth: 1595 in Hadleigh, Suffolk, England 2 Death: ABT MAY 1665 in Burgh, Suffolk, England Note: Mary's marriage to Thomas, is believed to have been her second marriage. In 1585, it is reported that she 
2 CONC had been married to William Harvey.  Father: John Harvey  b: ABT 1570 in London, Middlesex, England  Mother: Mary Vessey  b: 1568 in Little Baddow, Essex  Marriage 1 Thomas Atherold b: 16 AUG 1590 in Burgh, Suffolk, England 
2 CONT Married: BET 1608 AND 1617 in Burgh, Suffolk, England 
2 CONT Note: Based on the information supplied at CHESEBRO' Genealogy@RootsWeb: Larry Chesebro, 4 July 2004 - Larry@Cheesboro.net, Mary and Thomas would be half siblings, as both are reported to have had the same mother, Mary Vessey. Thi
2 CONC s needs additional investigation.
