2 CONT *A Guide to the Ball Family Papers, 1680-1785  - Accession Number 23554  - A Collection in the Library of Virginia, 800 East Broad Street, Richmond, Virginia 23219-8000. Phone: (804) 692-3888 (Archives Reference) - Fax: (804) 692-
2 CONC 3556 (Archives Reference) - Email: archdesk@lva.virginia.gov (Archives)  - URL: http://www.lva.virginia.gov/  - Preferred Citation  Ball Family Papers, 1680-1785. Accession 23554. Personal Papers Collection, The Library of Virgini
2 CONC a, Richmond, Virginia.
