2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut By Charles Washburn Church [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up page 4-5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Church, son of Reynold and Margaret, born about 1505, of Castle Camps, Cambridgeshire, was counsellor at law and steward of the Earl of Oxford. (Harleian manuscript, 1542.)  He had two sons, Bartholomew and John. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bartholomew of Erles Colne, Co. Essex''', married Alice Ronner. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had two children, 
2 CONT * John of Erles Colne, 
2 CONT * and Robert. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Erles Colne branch also had an armory. 
