1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Evidence needed to support https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Church/6000000003858805567 as wife of  https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Vessey-I/6000000000209545782?through=6000000213298401828
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Vessey was born circa 1530 in England. He died after 1587.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dates on this family are extracted from the Parish Registers of the Church of St. Mary the Virgin, Little Baddow, Co. Essex 1559-1660.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Vessey, yeoman, was probably born in the neighborhood of 1530. He was probably still living at the time of his daughter Sible's marriage in 1587, or else she would not have been styled "the daughter of Thomas Vessey" in the
2 CONC  Parish Register. The date of his death and the name of his wife are not known at present. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Vessey of LIttle Baddow, yeoman:
2 CONT
2 CONT #     John Vessey b. 21 Dec 1560, bur. 21 Dec 1560.
2 CONT #     Sybil Vessey+ b. 30 Nov 1561, d. a 1625. Married John Porter.
2 CONT #     Thomas Vessey b. 12 Feb 1565, d. 6 Aug 1639. Married Ellen Porter.
2 CONT #     Susan Vessey b. 10 Mar 1567. Married George Semer (Seymour).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Comments===
2 CONT
2 CONT >Research in The American Genealogist, Vol. 18 and also by genealogist, Donald Linus Jacobus, shows NO SPOUSE for Thomas Vessey. Even Gary Boyd Roberts's Ancestors of American Presidents, published in cooperation with the NEHGS, B
2 CONC oston, MA in 1995 shows that it's not a definite lineage. ( Elizabeth Church as wife) . Elizabeth Church could be included as a "possibility" only in the biography. Also there were only four children for Thomas Vesey.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
