1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sybil (Vessey) Porter''' was born before November 15, 1561 in Little Baddow, Essex, England and was baptized on November 15, 1561 in Little Baddow, Essex, England, United Kingdom. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-
2 CONC 19191780 Thomas Vessey, I] and his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sybil married [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191771 John Porter, of Felsted] on September 12, 1587 in Little Baddow, Essex, England. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-53039851 Margaret (Porte
2 CONC r) Nash]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191849 Thomas Porter]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-3654051 John Porter, II, of Windsor]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191850 William Porter]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191851 Ro
2 CONC se (Porter) Wentworth]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-25171278 Francis Porter]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on November 26, 1625 in Little Baddow, Essex, England, United Kingdom. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Sybil Vessey[1] was born before 15 Nov 1561 in Little Baddow, Essex, England and died on 26 November 1625 in Felsted, Essex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  Thomas Vessey, II and Elizabeth Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT # on 12 September 1587 in Little Baddow, Essex, England to John Porter (1560-1625).  He was the son of Thomas Porter b. 1540 and Ann Porter b. 1542.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 children include:
2 CONT # Margaret Porter, b. 1587, England ,   d. 21 Apr 1648, , Essex, , England  
2 CONT # Francis Porter, b. 1588, Felstead, Essex, England ,   d. 26 May 1635, Felstead, Essex, , England  
2 CONT # Francis Porter,  b. 1588, , Essex, England, d. 26 May 1635 
2 CONT # David Porter,  b. 1589, London, London, England  
2 CONT # Thomas Porter,   b. 1590, Felstead, Essex, England, d. 20 Dec 1638, Felstead, Essex, England  
2 CONT # John Porter, b. 21 Jun 1594, Felsted, Essex, England, d. 22 Apr 1648, Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut, United States  
2 CONT #  Grace Ann Porter,   b. 1597, , Yorkshire, , England,d. 29 Sep 1659, New Haven, New Haven, Connecticut, United States  
2 CONT # Rose Porter, b. 1598, Felstead, Essex, , England, d. 1635, Felstead, Essex, , England  
2 CONT # William Porter, b. 1613, England, d. 30 Mar 1720, Henrico, Virginia, United States 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Origins
