1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richard Ball, of Lancaster, VA''' was born on August 12, 1675 in Lancaster County, Virginia, usa. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-23124425 Capt. William Ball, II of Millenbeck] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-1
2 CONC 0079856 Margaret (Williamson) Ball]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-23126779 Sarah (Young) Ball] after January 1700. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625194382 Sarah (Ball) Selden]; [https://www.geni.com/profile
2 CONC -82193947 Margaret (Ball) Ball]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695075938 Hannah (Ball) Montague]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34689642188 Esther (Ball) Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695075940 Ball]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between August 6, 1742 and September 10, 1742 in St. Mary&#39;s Whitechapel, Lancaster County, Virginia, United States and was buried in Montague Cemetery, Lancaster, Lancaster County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT 1.	Richard BALL was born 12 Aug 1675 in Lancaster County, Virginia, United States, and died Bef 8 Feb 1706/07 in St. Mary's Whitechapel, Lancaster County, Virginia, United States. He was the son of 2. William BALL and 3. Margaret 
2 CONC WILLIAMSON. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah YOUNG Aft Jan 1700/01, daughter of William YOUNG. She was born Abt 1670 in Essex County, Virginia, United States, and died Bet 6 Aug 1742 and 10 Sep 1742 in Lancaster County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children;
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. Margaret Ball; married 17 February 1722/23 William Ball Jr; died October 1783.
2 CONT * ii. Sarah Ball; married 13 October 1725 John Selden.
2 CONT * iii. Hannah Ball; married 16 October 1727 William Montague.
2 CONT * iv. Eshter Ball; married Capt. William Glasscock.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gw4.geneanet.org/cousinjeanne?lang=fr&m=N&v=BALL
2 CONT
