2 CONT
2 CONT VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 61
2 CONT Hayden gives wife of Col. William Ball Hannah Beale which I think should be Hannah Heale.  There are too many things in favor of Hannah Heale.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT Col. William Ball died March __ 1744-5; will dated Aug. 14, 1744; probated March 8, 1744-5.
2 CONT Names grandsons: Wm. Ball, son of son Wm. Ball dec'd, Benj. Ball, Richard Ball, John Ball, son of son Geo. Ball, Williamson Ball, son of son Geo. Ball, George Ball, Williamson Ball, son of son William, dec'd.
2 CONT Son: George Ball, Daughters in law, Margaret Ball, widow; Mrs. Judith Ball wife of Son George Ball.
