2 CONT COL.WILLIAM BALL (9-1) of Lancaster Co. Va. b. 1676, d 1745; eldest son of Capt. William and Margery Downman) Ball made will Aug 14, 1744; probated Mar 8, 1745; served as Surveyor of Northumbarland Co., 1724; was a staunch and lib
2 CONC eral supporter of the Established church and a Vestryman of Christ Church; m. Hannah Beale, d. prior to 1744
