2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/stream/EwellTheEwellsInAmericaAndSomeAlliedFamilies16351990/Ewell+-+The+Ewells+in+America+and+Some+Allied+Families%2C+1635-1990_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT To make the tie-in between the families even closer, CharleB and Solomon's mother, Mary Ann Bertrand Ewell, married for her third marriage, the father of her daughters-in-law, Major James Ball. This made her the step-mother to her
2 CONC  own sons. Major Ball became stepfather to his own daughters and the stepfather to his sons-in law. Both the Ball and Ewell families were big supporters of St. Mary’s White Chapel. Major Ball and Mary Ann were buried at White Chap
2 CONC el, Lancaster Co. , Virginia.
