1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2.Capt. Samuel Fox, b. 28 Feb 1672/3. Married Ann Daingerfield. Died 1712, Lancaster County, intestate. His two children are named in the will of his brother William Fox as "niece Frances Fox" and "nephew David Fox
2 CONC ." This will also names his "sister" [i.e. "sister-in-law"" Ann Fox. Some have confused the language of William's will go mean it was his blood sister and thus a daughter of David-2 Fox and Hannah Ball. This is not the case. links
