1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Church (REYNOLD CHURCH4, JOHN CHURCH3, JOHN CHYRCH2, JOHN at CHURCH1).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife is not known
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of William Church is:
2 CONT # Richard Church died 1592 in England.  Marriage 1 Margaret Wright
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut By Charles Washburn Church [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up page 4-5]
2 CONT
2 CONT William, son of Reynold and Margaret, had a son Richard who built in 1575 the well-known half-timbered house, still standing in Nantwich, styled "Church's Mansion." See Harleian manuscript in British Museum. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married Margaret, daughter of Roger Wright, and died in 1592. Their children were: i, William; 2, Randle; 3, Isabella. William married ist Elizabeth Wright ; 2d Margaret Broughton. He died in Drayton in 1632. Randle, a sta
2 CONC unch Royalist, was father of Randle or Randolph Church, who was Sargeant-at-Arms to James ist in 1624. Isabella married James McBride, a merchant in Dumfries, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
