1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ellen PORTER was born 1562 in Essex, England, and died 24 Dec 1618 in Little Baddow, Essex, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=haslam1&id=P10130 (dead link)
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Thomas VESSEY II 21 Jun 1591 in Little Baddow, Essex, England, son of Thomas VESSEY I and Elizabeth GARDINER. He was born 1570 in Aldham, Suffolk, England, and died 9 Aug 1639 in Little Baddow, Essex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ellen PORTER and Thomas VESSEY II are:
2 CONT *	2	  i.	Henry VESSEY was born 16 Jan 1592.
2 CONT * 	3	  ii.	George VESEY was born 1600 in Suffolk, England, and died 8 Nov 1665 in Lancaster, Lancaster, Virginia, United States.
2 CONT * 	4	  iii.	Elizabeth VESSEY was born 1601.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # 	Thomas Vezey III
2 CONT # Henry Vessey
2 CONT # Daniell Vessey
2 CONT # Susan Vassey
2 CONT # Edward Vassey
2 CONT # Elizabeth Robenson (born Vassey)
2 CONT # George Vesey
2 CONT
2 CONT
