1 NAME Hannah /Treneman/
2 GIVN Hannah
2 SURN Treneman
2 _MARNM Morrow
2 NICK widow of George Ivey
2 NICK Sibsey
2 NICK not Blanche
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1652
