2 CONC London, England, Church of England Baptisms, Marriages and Burials, 1538-1812 	London, England, Church of England Baptisms, Marriages and Burials, 1538-1812. < [http://www.kukkus.com/FelsingFamilies/showmedia.php?mediaID=2815 digi
