1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT * Baptism: 16 Feb 1592, St. Leonard, Warmingham, CHS 
2 CONT * Will signed:  6 May 1667, Anne Arundel Co., MD 
2 CONT * Father:  Hugh KINSEY 
2 CONT * Mother:  Margaret SMITH (Given the age difference betweeen Hugh & Margaret, it's likely he had a prior wife.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Kinsey was born in 1585 (SIC) in England. He immigrated to Virginia with his brother Robert Kinsey in 1655, then went to Maryland in about 1659, transporting his children Daniel and Sarah in 1662. In Aug 1663, he surveyed 100
2 CONC  acres called "Walnut Neck", which was on the north side of the Patapsco River. It was granted to him by Lord Baltimore on 6 Aug 1664.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hugh Kinsey with Margaret COULTON — born in England (birth order unknown, but Paul is almost certainly the eldest):
2 CONT * 1.  Paul KINSEY, b. 1630s.  Married Elizabeth. 
2 CONT * 2.  Daniel KINSEY, b. 1630s/40s; d. by 1667.  
2 CONT * 3.  Sarah KINSEY, b. 1630s/40s.  Married Abraham CLARK .
2 CONT * 4.  Christopher KINSEY, b. ?; d. by 6 Sep 1642; bur. Alford, CHS 
2 CONT * 5.  Mary KINSEY, b. 1640s.  Married 1) Thomas HUMPHREYS 2) Richard BALL 
2 CONT * 6.  Elizabeth KINSEY, b. ca. 1651.  Married 1) Thomas SPARROW 2) Richard JOHNS 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh's brother, Robert, was in Virginia by 1646, so there's a strong possibility Hugh was there by then, also.  Hugh bought land in 1659 in Baltimore Co., MD, but it looks like he didn't move there, at least not immediately (or po
2 CONC ssibly ever).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1648-1657 he lived in York,  Va 1659 arrived in Maryland
2 CONT
2 CONT It appears that Hugh was the heir to his brother Robert Kinsey's land after Robert died without a written will in 1656. On 21 May 1662, Hugh mortgages to Josh Fish of London, 500 acres of the plantation where Hugh lived, for 33 po
2 CONC unds and six shillings.
2 CONT
2 CONT bef. 1662/3	England to Virginia	Margaret (COULTON) KINSEY and children (Daniel, Sarah, Elizabeth, Mary) make the crossing
2 CONT
2 CONT He died after 6 May 1667 in Anne Arundel, Maryland, leaving a will:
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT Date of birth might specifically be February 21, 1585.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Surname has also been reported to be [https://www.geni.com/surnames/kensey Kensey].
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * February 1592 at an unspecified location
2 CONT * circa 1629 in Calvert County, Maryland
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife seen as https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Johns/6000000181392016828 without supporting evidence.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of marriage have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1651 in Calvert County, Maryland <unattested>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been erroneously reported to be May 6, 1667 in Anne Arundel County, Maryland <unattested, conflicts with the date of his will>.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * Diocese of Chester parish registers of marriages c1538-1910 Transcription; First name(s) Hugh; Last name Kinsey; Marriage year 1632; Marriage date '''16 Dec 1632'''; Marriage place Chester; Parish St. Mary's-On-The-Hill; Spouse'
2 CONC s first name(s) Margarett; Spouse's last name Coulton; City or town Chester; County Cheshire; Country England; Reference item 1 p 131; Record set Cheshire Diocese of Chester parish marriages 1538-1910; Category Birth, Marriage & D
2 CONC eath (Parish Registers); Subcategory Parish Marriages; Collections from England, United Kingdom; Repository: Cheshire Archives and Local Studies [https://www.wikitree.com/photo.php/1/15/Kinsey-60.jpg image] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
