2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Kinsey-60
2 CONT * https://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I40532&tree=Tree1
2 CONT * http://dgmweb.net/FGS/K/KinseyHugh-MargaretCoulton.html
