1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://thecityobserver.org/scarborough/b27512.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  1651 Calvert County, Maryland, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Feb. 1, 1715 Scientists Cliffs, Calvert County, Maryland, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Johns, the dear and well-beloved virtuous wife of Richard and mother of this family, d. 1st day of 12th month, 1715/16 at a quarter past 8 in the morning.
2 CONT
2 CONT Widow of Thomas Sparrow, died 1674.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Thomas Sparrow:
2 CONT *1. Elizabeth Sparrow,   b. 20 Oct 1667, Clifts, Calvert County, Maryland,   d. Aft 1717, Baltimore County, Maryland
2 CONT * 	2. Thomas Sparrow,   b. Abt 1672, All Hallows Parish, Anne Arundel County, Maryland  d. 12 May 1719, All Hallows Parish, Anne Arundel County, Maryland  (Age ~ 47 years)  [natural]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Kensey SPARROW, dau. of Thomas and Eliza KINSEY or KENSEY.  [SIC: Hugh Kinsey] She m. (secondly) Richard JOHNS of Calvert Co., Md. in 1676. She was the widow of Thomas Sparrow. She was an elder in the Quaker Church or So
2 CONC ciety of Friends for over 30 years. She is memorialized in a memoir written in 1718 by the youngest child, Elizabeth Johns, widow of Henry Troth, later married to John Stevens of Philadelphia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Richard Johns (1649 - 1717)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *Abraham Johns (1677 - 1707) 
2 CONT *Aquilla Johns (1679 - 1682)
2 CONT *Priscilla Johns Roberts (1681 - 1725)
2 CONT *Aquilla Johns (1685 - 1709)
2 CONT *Richard Johns (1687 - 1719)
2 CONT *Kensey Johns (1689 - 1729)
2 CONT *Isaac Johns (1692 - 1734)
2 CONT *Elizabeth Johns Stevens (1694 - 1772)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Clefts Monthly Meeting of the Society of Friends, Scientists Cliffs, Calvert County, Maryland, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sparrow, Thomas, A. A. Co.,1st Jan., 1674; 5th June, 1675.
2 CONT * To wife Eliza: ½ home plantation, during life.
2 CONT * To son Thomas and hrs., whole of sd. plantation and plantation at Patapsco at 21 yrs. of age.
2 CONT * To sister Eliza: Champe, certain land, (unnamed).
2 CONT * To dau. Eliza: and brother Solomon, personalty.
2 CONT * Exs.: Wife Eliza: and brother Solomon.
2 CONT * Test: Nath. Heathcote, Richard Tydeings. 2. 76.
2 CONT
