1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I think Mary was a Williamson born November 11, 1662, in Virginia. Her father was James Williamson and mother Ann Underwood. Her grandfather was Captain William Underwood and great-grandfather was William Underwood
2 CONC . She married John Rozier first and married second Andrew Harrison. She died about 1715, in Virginia.
