2 CONT
2 CONT >On 11 March 1662/3 Margaret & Mary Williamson, daughters of James & Anne [Underwood] Williamson, patented 882 Acres in Old Rappahannock County, Virginia "between some of the head branches of Pepetick Cr. & head branches of Mr. Po
2 CONC pes Creek, beg. nigh Rappa path &c. to the head of land of Silvester Thatcher & Thomas Whitlock, thence NW &c. upon land of Tho. Wright &c. Granted to William Underwood, Gent., 10 September 1658 & given to the above named by the l
2 CONC ast will of said Underwood." (VA Patent Book 4:102(597), Cavaliers & Pioneers, Vol. I, p. 429
