1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Sarah Young==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of William Young, was born about 1670 in Virginia and died before 6 Aug 1742 and 10 Sep 1742 in Lancaster County, Virginia, United States 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Married===
2 CONT
2 CONT from http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=adboyd&id=I5353
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: (1)  '''Spencer MOTTROM,''' b: Abt 1672 Married: Abt 1685
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: (2) '''William HOWSON,'''Married: Abt 19 Apr 1700 in Northumberland County, Virginia, United States 3
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married (3) '''Richard BALL,''' (son of William Ball & Margaret Williamson) b: 12 Aug 1675 in Lancaster County, Virginia, United States Married: Aft Jan 1700/01
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Spencer MOTTROM==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Mary MOTTROM,''' b: Abt 1685 in Northumberland County, Virginia, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Richard Ball==
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. '''Margaret Ball;''' married 17 February 1722/23 William Ball Jr; died October 1783.
2 CONT * ii. '''Sarah Ball;''' married 13 October 1725 John Selden.
2 CONT * iii. '''Hannah Ball;''' married 16 October 1727 William Montague.
2 CONT * iv. '''Eshter Ball;''' married Capt. William Glasscock.
2 CONT
