2 CONT A Guide to the Ball Family Papers, 1680-1785  Accession Number 23554  A Collection in  the Library of Virginia 
2 CONT
2 CONT Contact Information:  The Library of Virginia 800 East Broad Street Richmond, Virginia 23219-8000 USA Phone: (804) 692-3888 (Archives Reference) Fax: (804) 692-3556 (Archives Reference) Email: archdesk@lva.virginia.gov (Archives) 
