2 CONT * '''Alt Marriage''': 12 FEB 1721/22, Lancaster County, Virginia to William Ball, IV
2 CONT * '''Other''': 9 Apr 1741, Lancaster, Virginia, United StatesAdministrator of Estate of William Ball, her late husband
2 CONT * '''Other''': 6 Aug 1742, Lancaster, Virginia, United Statesnamed in mother's will
2 CONT * '''Other''': 14 Aug 1744, Lancaster, Virginia, United Statesnamed in Will of William Ball, her father-in-law
