1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Esther (Ball) Glascock''' was born circa 1712 in Indian Banks, Farnham, Richmond County, VA, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-23126077 Richard Ball, of Lancaster, VA] and [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-23126779 Sarah (Young) Ball]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34667773817 Capt. William Glascock]. Together they had the following children (five sons and six  daughters) : [https://www.geni.com/profile-34667773698 Dr. George Glascock]; [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/profile-34686673485 Priscilla (Glascock) Henry]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902585 Million (Glascock) Peachey]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902587 William Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-3466390
2 CONC 2586 Thomas Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902595 Winnifred Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902588 Richard Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902594 Elizabeth (Glascock) Downman]; [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/profile-34663902592 John Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902596 Mildred (Glascock) Harding]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663902401 Ann (Glascock) Robertson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 1779 in Farnham, Richmond County, VA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT G.H.S. King, _Marriages of Richmond County, VA, 1668-1853_ (Easley, SC:
2 CONT Southern Historical Press, 1986), p. 78: "GLASCOCK, WILLIAM of Richmond County and Mrs. Esther (Easter) Ball of St. Mary's White Chappel Parish, Lancaster County. Bondsman and witness: Thomas Edwards and John Selden. The marriage 
2 CONC bond was dated 10 April 1728. LCMR #1, p. 9. [Esther Ball was the daughter of Captain Richard and Sarah (Young) Ball. Hayden, p. 62-63. On 8 September 1770 William Glascock, aged 66, made a deposition in Richmond County court and 
2 CONC on 28 September 1771 Esther Glascock, aged 59, made a deposition in the same suit. Thomas Taff v. John Yerby, VSL:AD #25391.]"
2 CONT
2 CONT ===comments===
2 CONT
2 CONT http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/VA-NORTHERN-NECK/2010-04/1271016141
2 CONT
2 CONT "This William h/o Esther was the son of George Glascock 1675-1714 and Million Downman b. 21 Nov. 1683. Siblings are Thomas, George and John."
2 CONT
2 CONT "William Glasscock's brother George married Esther/Easter/Ester Ball's cousin, Judith Ball, just to keep things in the family."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
