1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eliza Ball [128778] b.16_Mar_1702 m.Nov_1721, Lancaster Co. VA wife of William Keene m.May_1727, Lancaster Co. VA wife of Joseph Chinn d. before 14_Apr_1736  .   .   . + William Keene
