1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Agness-McCarty/6000000020445218404
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sinah Ball was the daughter of James Ball & Mary Conway.  Married Daniel McCarty (son of Dennis McCarty & Sarah Ball)
2 CONT
2 CONT Their only son was Col Daniel McCarty (who married Sarah Mason)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://books.google.com/books?id=kjESAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA130&ots=LKu2K-yvdP&dq=sinah%20ball%20daniel%20mccarty&pg=PA129#v=onepage&q&f=false page 129] of William and Mary College Quarterly Historical Magazine.  "The McCarthy Fami
2 CONC ly"
2 CONT
2 CONT >We follow now the children of Maj. Dennis in the order in which they appear in the will, that is, Daniel, Dennis, Thaddeus, Sarah, and Ann.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Daniel McCarty, the oldest son of Maj. Dennis married Sinah Ball. He died in Fairfax County, Virginia, about 1792 leaving will in which he mentions;
2 CONT
2 CONT * son Daniel (apparently his only son), 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughters 
2 CONT * Mary McCarty, 
2 CONT * Sarah Chichester, 
2 CONT * Sinah Wagener, and 
2 CONT * Anne McClenachan; 
2 CONT
2 CONT grandson 
2 CONT * Daniel; 
2 CONT
2 CONT >wife Sinah and son Daniel are appointed executors. The will is witnessed by John Hereford, Jr., Joseph Gordon, Patrich Keogh, Doddridge Pitt Chichester, and R. R. Wagoner
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT (descendants of William Joseph Ball)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Col. James Ball [126919]  b.1678 d.13_Oct_1754,  Lancaster Co. VA
2 CONT *Mother: Mary Conway [126937] <b.16_Feb_1686, Virginia m.16_Apr_1707, Virginia wife of Col. James Ball d.15_Sep_1730, Lancaster Co. VA
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
