2 CONT * # [http://books.google.com/books?id=yeWgvfDpwbwC&lpg=PA795&ots=4YNZOML5oZ&dq=Joseph%20ball%20mary%20Spencer&pg=PA795#v=onepage&q=Joseph%20ball%20mary%20Spencer&f=false Lewis of Warner Hall: ] The History of a Family.  Page 795 "
2 CONC Ball Family."
2 CONT * Lancaster County, Virginia Will Book 13, BALL, Sarah. Will. 6 Aug. 1742. Rec. 10 Sept. 1742 Abstracts of Lancaster County, Virginia Wills 1653-1800; {Ida J. Lee} BALL, Sarah. Inventory & Appraisement. Rec. 9 October 1742. Return
2 CONC ed by Wm. Glasscock, Extr. W.B. 13, p. 290.
2 CONT * An Act of the House of Burgesses in May 1732 regarding land in Essex County (British Colonial Office 5/1389 , ff. 70-71)
