1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Spencer Ball
2 CONT *Born 14 Mar 1707 in Northumberland County, Virginia
2 CONT *Son of Joseph Ball of Coan and Mary Mottram
2 CONT *Brother of William Ball, Richard Ball, Joseph Ball and	Sarah (Ball) Harding
2 CONT *Husband of Judith Jones — married about 1734 [location unknown]
2 CONT *Father of James Ball, Jesse Ball, Judith Ball, Mary Ball, William Ball, Spencer Mottram Ball, Elizabeth Ball and William Ball
2 CONT *Died 11 Feb 1767 in Northumberland County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes
2 CONT
2 CONT *Spencer was a Justice and Member of the Northumberland County Court - 1735-57
2 CONT *Inspector of Tobacco - 1737
2 CONT *Vestryman of St. Stephen's Parish - 1738
2 CONT *Qualified as LT-Col. - 1753
2 CONT *Burgess - 1755-58
2 CONT *Member of the Westmoreland Association - 27 Feb 1766
2 CONT *one of the signers of the Association of 1770
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Links
2 CONT * http://www.wikitree.com/genealogy/Ball-Family-Tree-1287
2 CONT * https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=thamm&id=I13355 has his wife as Frances Mottrom 
2 CONT
