1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ellen HEALE was born 19 NOV 1705 in North Farnham Parish, Richmond Co., VA. She was the daughter of 2. George Nicholas HEALE and 3. Catherine CHINN. She married David BALL 29 MAY 1727 in Lancaster Co., VA, son of W
2 CONC illiam II BALL and Margaret WILLIAMSON. He was born 26 SEP 1686 in Lancaster Co., VA, and died 14 DEC 1732 in Lancaster Co., VA. He was buried DEC 1732 in Saint Mary's Whitechapel Episcopal Churchyard, Lancaster, Lancaster Co., VA
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Catherine Chinn and George Heale. Wm and Mary Quarterly, 1st series, 17; 297.
2 CONT
2 CONT !24 May 1727: David Ball & Ellen Heale, daughter of George Heale, who consents to dau's marriage. Marriage Bonds in Lancaster County. William and Mary College Quarterly Historical Magazine, Vol. 12, No. 2 (Oct., 1903), pp. 98.
2 CONT
2 CONT !9 Feb 1726: Mentioned in her Aunt Ann Chichester's will.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---- 
2 CONT
2 CONT Re:  his wid. m. (second) Dec. 20, 1736, Moore Fauntleroy. From Colonial Families of the Southern States.
2 CONT
2 CONT She did not marry 2nd to Moore Fauntleroy.  That was Anne Heale, daughter of John Heale, born about 1720 (wrong generation).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
