2 CONT * [http://books.google.com/books?id=SJcsAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA299&lpg=PA299&dq=rawleigh+travers+1622&source=bl&ots=z4N-Sco66C&sig=tr4dvY3qBicU-T7HkbNjMKzHLjg&hl=en&sa=X&ei=vBESUYeUDMaiiQKO4oGgBA&ved=0CDYQ6AEwAQ#v=onepage&q=rawleigh%20trav
2 CONC ers%201622&f=false Virginia genealogies: a genealogy of the Glassell family of Scotland] and by Horace Edwin Hayden.  Page 299
2 CONT * http://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I023905&tree=Tree1
2 CONT
