1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Joseph Chinn
2 CONT * Birth:	1700 - Morattico, Lancaster, Virginia, United States
2 CONT * Death:	Jan 28 1754 - Morattico, Lancaster, Virginia, United States
2 CONT * Parents:	Rawleigh Chinn II, Esther Chinn (born Ball)
2 CONT * Spouses:	Elizabeth Ball, Priscilla Downman
2 CONT * Children:	Hannah Chinn, Anne Chinn Edwards, Mary Elizabeth Montague (born Chinn), John Joseph Chinn
