1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Do not confuse this Elizabeth with https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Breeden/6000000001366181576.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT Elizabeth CONWAY was born Abt 1704 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA, and died Abt 1753 in Northumberland Co.,VA.   She was the daughter of Edwin CONWAY and Anne BALL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Christopher GARLINGTON (III) on 05 MAY 1724 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA, son of Christopher GARLINGTON/ II and Margaret JONES. He was born Abt 1684 in ,Northcumberland Co.,VA, and died ,,1753 in ,Northcumberland Co.,VA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Conway-826
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was born in 1709. Daughter of Col. Edwin and Ann Ball Conway, she married Christopher Garlington [1] on 5 May 1724 in Lancaster County, Virginia. [2] [3] [4] Elizabeth and her husband Christopher Garlington were parents 
2 CONC of: Joseph Conway Garlington (born abt. 1725), Sarah Ann Garlington (born 1727), Christopher Garlington IV (born 1729), William Garlington (born abt. 1731), and Edwin Conway Garlington (born 1746). She passed away in 1773.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.com/trees/229221/I419/-/individual
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth /CONWAY/ and Christopher GARLINGTON /(III)/ are:
2 CONT # Sarah GARLINGTON was born 24 FEB 1727 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA, and died Abt 1790 in ,Northumberland Co.,VA,USA.
2 CONT # Christopher GARLINGTON (IV) was born 04 DEC 1729 in Lancaster,Northcumbrland Co.,VA, and died Abt 1808 in Charleston,Sumter Co.,SC,USA.
2 CONT # William GARLINGTON was born Abt 1731 in Lancaster,Northcumbrland Co.,VA, and died ,,1802 in ,Berkeley Co.,SC,USA.
2 CONT # Mary Elizabeth GARLINGTON was born 24 JAN 1734 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA, and died ,,1820 in Isalnd Ford,SC,USA.
2 CONT # Elizabeth GARLINGTON was born 24 JAN 1734 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA.
2 CONT # Edwin Conway GARLINGTON was born 05 MAR 1746 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA, and died ,,1823 in ,Laurens Co.,SC,USA.
2 CONT # Joseph Ball GARLINGTON was born ,,1750 in ,Lancaster Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of birth has also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1704.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of death might be 1780.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * Virginia Genealogies by Rev. Horace Hayden, published by Genealogical Publishing Company of Baltimore, Maryland, 1966 is the accepted published work for the Ball Family by the Society.  there is a daughter of Colonel Edwin Conwa
2 CONC y and (1) Anne Ball named Elizabeth. She is listed in Hayden, page 243, number 11. However, she married Christopher Garlington. Further, her entry in Hayden, page 244, number 11, cites the marriage and names her children on page 2
2 CONC 45, none of whom are named James B. Breeden/Breeding.
2 CONT *http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=susanrubel&id=I419 
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Conway-826 cites
2 CONT *↑ “Conway Family.” The William and Mary Quarterly, vol. 12, no. 4, 1904, pp. 264–267. JSTOR, www.jstor.org/stable/1915587.
2 CONT *↑ Ancestry.com. Virginia, Marriages of the Northern Neck of Virginia, 1649-1800 [database on-line]. Provo, UT, USA: Ancestry.com Operations, Inc., 2012. Original data: Headley, Robert K. Married Well and Often: Marriages of the N
2 CONC orthern Neck of Virginia, 1649–1800. Baltimore, MD, USA: Genealogical Publishing Co., 2003
2 CONT * https://www.scvpalmbeach.com/sub-garlington-family
