1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://www.archive.org/stream/descendantsofcap00mill#page/n737/mode/2up The Decendants of Capt Thomas Carter], page 269: John Carter, third son of Captain Thomas and Katharine Dale Carter, "was born ye 8th Ma
2 CONC y 1674 and bap. Sunday ye 14th..."
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married three times, once to Frances Ball, who died from the labor of her first child, a Miss Payne, with whom he had "several daughters, none of which married" before herself dying, and then Margaret Todd.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT "3d Son was born ye 8th May 1674 and bapd Sunday ye 24th and had for Godparents Coll. Jno. Carter, Mr. Jno Stretchley and Mrs. Ball. "  Ibid, p. 8.
