1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary was the maternal grandmother of George Washington. Her parentage is unknown. Prior to marrying Col. Joseph Ball, she was married to (1) a ___ Johnson, and had children Elizabeth Bonham(Johnson) and John Johnso
2 CONC n (mentioned in her will). She then married (2) Col. Joseph Ball, and had one daughter, Mary Washington (Ball). She then married (3) Richard Hewes (Hughes).
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary ___ Johnson Ball Hewes died in 1721 at Cherry Point Farm in Northumberland Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Refs
2 CONT # Pierce, Elizabeth Combs. "Mary Johnson, second wife of Col. Joseph Ball," William and Mary College Quarterly Historical Magazine 15, no. 2: 176-7.
