3 FORM png
3 TITL https://tourbly.com.co/atraccion/parque-washington/
3 NOTE George Washington, 1st President of the United States is my 13th cousin 7 times removed.
4 CONT
4 CONT You  → Alberto Ferreira Palacio (your father) → Emma Palacio Skinner (his mother) → Rafael Maria Palacio Botero (her father) → María Josefa de Jesús Botero Arango (his mother) → Raimunda Arango Palacio (her mother) → Antonio Ambro
4 CONC sio Arango Botero (her father) → Pedro Pablo Arango (his father) → Lorenza Francisca del Carmen Angel Uribe (his mother) → María de la Rosa Uribe y López de Restrepo (her mother) → Martín de Uribe Echavarría y Ugarte (her father) 
4 CONC → Juan Sáez de Uribe Echavarría (his father) → Francisco Sáez de Uribe Larriño (his father) → Catalina Okarantza Ariznabarreta (his mother) → Martín Okarantza Eraña (her father) → Catalina Eraña Otálora (his mother) → María López 
4 CONC Otálora Galartza (her mother) → Catalina Galarza Ayala (her mother) → Teresa Constanza Díaz de Ayala y Sarmiento (her mother) → D. Fernán Pérez de Ayala, señor de Ayala (her father) → Pedro 'el Cronista' López de Ayala, canciller 
4 CONC mayor de Castilla y señor de Ayala (his father) → Dª. Inés de Ayala, señora de Malpica (his sister) → Sancha Blount, Lady de Ayala (her daughter) → Constance de Hastings (her daughter) → John de Sutton, VI, 1st Baron Dudley (her s
4 CONC on) → Sir Edmund Sutton, of Dudley (his son) → John Sutton (his son) → Margaret Sutton (his daughter) → William Butler, Esq., of Tyes (her son) → Margaret Washington (his daughter) → Reverend Lawrence Washington (her son) → John W
4 CONC ashington (his son) → Capt. Lawrence Washington (his son) → Augustine Washington, Sr. (his son) → George Washington, 1st President of the United States (his son)
3 NOTE The city of Barranquilla, in Colombia, honours this american president in a beuatiful park surrounded by high buildings. Amazing.
