2 CONT *[http://lewis-family-descendants.com/?page=about “Lewis Family Descendants”]  The Lewis Family Descendants help to support the colonial home, Kenmore Mansion, home of Betty Washington and Fielding Lewis in Fredericksburg, Virgini
2 CONC a.  Our membership includes, primarily, descendants of Fielding Lewis, Sr. and Betty Washington Lewis, George Washington's only sister. [http://lewis-family-descendants.com/?page=qualifying Chart]
