2 CONT Colonel Samuel Washington was the 3rd eldest child and second eldest Son of Augustine Washington, I & Mary (Ball) Washington, He Built "Harewood Plantation" (Jefferson County) Virginia now West Virginia, He was Col. Virginia Milit
2 CONC ia, JP and High Sheriff, born @ Wakefield, Westmoreland County, Virginia, he married 5 times:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)Jane Champe ca. 1754 dau. of John Champe & Elizabeth Pope. no Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT 2)Mildred Thornton ca. 1756 dau. of John Thornton & Mildred Gregory. children:  Thornton Washington married twice 1st to Mildred Berry & 2ndly to his cousin Frances Townsend Washington Tristram Washington died young
2 CONT
2 CONT 3)Louisa Chapman ca. 1762 dau. of Nathaniel Chapman & Constantia Pearson. no Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT 4)Anne Steptoe 24 Mar. 1764 dau. of James Steptoe & Hannah Ashton. & widow of Willoughby Allerton children:  Ferdinand Washington died young Frederick Augustus Washington died young Lucinda Washington died young George Steptoe Was
2 CONC hington married Lucy Ann Payne Lawrence Augustine Washington married Mary Dorcas Wood Harriet Washington m. Col. Andrew Parks
2 CONT
2 CONT 5)Susannah Ferrin ca. 1778 dau. of John Ferrin and unknown Mother children: John Ferrin Washington died young
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/103941452/samuel-washington Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 29 2019, 1:47:08 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Colonel Samuel Washington''' was born on November 16, 1734, in Wakefield, Westmoreland County, Virginia, Colonial America. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-2669062 Capt. Augustine Washington] and [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/profile-2669165 Mary Washington]. He was a Colonel, Col. Virginia Militia, JP, and High Sheriff. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-80307272 Jane Washington] in 1754 in VA, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34623522500 Mildred Washington] circa 1759 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-80307399 Ens Thornton Augustine Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-80307445 Tristram Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-80307488 Lucy Washington] circa 1762 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34669576995 Infant Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-5517069 Anne Washington] on March 24, 1764 in Berkeley, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-80307543 Ferdinand Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-58507278 Frederick Augustus Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-43308949 Lucinda Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-5517721 Lawrence Augustine Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-5517855 Harriot Parks];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-24138507 Capt George Steptoe Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-5517083 Susannah Washington] in 1780 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-5517813 John Perrin Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 26, 1781 in Harewood, Jefferson, Alexandria, Virginia, United States from Probably tuberculosis  and was buried after September 26, 1781 in Washington Burial Ground, Harewood, Jefferson, West Virginia. 
2 CONT --------------------
