2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *    1. George A. WASHINGTON b: 1763
2 CONT *    2. Samuel WASHINGTON b: 1765
2 CONT *    3. Frances WASHINGTON b: 1763
2 CONT *    4. Mildred WASHINGTON b: 1777
2 CONT
