2 TITL Washington Family Coat of Arms
2 NOTE Family Coat of Arms
3 CONT
3 CONT Throughout his life, Washington had the family’s heraldic crest applied to such diverse personal belongings as silverware, wax seals, horse-drawn carriages, walking sticks, and interiors of buildings including Mount Vernon, where 
3 CONC the coat of arms was featured in the middle of the wooden fireplace mantel in the front parlor.
3 CONT
