2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # Margaret B. Kinsey in "Ball Cousins" compiled a book based on the distribution of Joseph Ball's estate between 1827 and 1858 which is a great help to researchers in sorting out the family of Sarah Ball Custer and also shows no r
2 CONC elationship to the Washington family.  Margaret Kinsey, Ball Cousins, (Gateway Press, Baltimore, Maryland 1981)
