2 NOTE  I am also assuming dates to the right of decendancy lines are death,  left are birth, and the dates are under the people they are for.  Also, notice James Taylor married Mary Taylor daughter of Jonathan Taylor?  Interesting.  Tho
3 CONC se dates bottom left are "John at Church 1335-1396".  Crazy.
