1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Church was born ABT 1448 in Leicestershire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of John Church of Leicester and Agnes
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife Catherine was born ABT 1450.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Catherine  and John Church are:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Church was born ABT 1472 in Leicestershire, England.
2 CONT # Reynold Church of Leicester was born ABT 1474 in Castle Camps, Cambridgeshire, England. He married Margaret Greene 1496, daughter of Robert Greene and Margaret She was born ABT 1476 in Cheshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up
2 CONT
2 CONT John Church, styled Junior, son of John Church, merchant, had two sons, Reynold and John. They were minors at the death of their parents. The land in Leicester was conveyed by John to Catherine by deed of May 8, 1450. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
