2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut By Charles Washburn Church [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up page 4-5]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Church, son of Reynold and Margaret, was alderman and baileff of Maiden. He married ist Joan Henkyn; and 2d Mary, daughter of Edmund Tyrrell, a descendant of Walter who slew Wm. Rufus. He died Nov. 19, 1559. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His children were John and Edmund. 
