1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Dr. John Bennett
2 CONT *Born 10 Jul 1624 in Wiveliscombe, Somerset, England
2 CONT * Died before Dec 1699 before age 75 in Richmond County, Virginia, Colony of Virginia
2 CONT * Husband of Mary (Sawyer) Bennett — married before 1656 in Christ Church, Middlesex, Virginia Colony
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bennett-1146
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Thomas Bennett
2 CONT * Mother: Agnes Beard
2 CONT * Siblings: None
2 CONT * Spouse: Mary Berry Sawyer, 1628-1667. m. Feb 18, 1646 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # William Bennett
2 CONT # Robert Bennett
2 CONT # Ann Bennett
2 CONT # Richard Bennett
2 CONT # Mary Bennett
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth, death, and other details were collected from the well-documented website of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, "Pedigree Resource File," database, FamilySearch[8], entry for John /Bennett/. It may not be 100% 
2 CONC accurate, but it is as close to accurate as we can attain given the information and sources available to us.
2 CONT This particular profile is an on-going project to document the genealogy of one Bennett line. If you have a problem with a particular entry, please contact the submitter of said entry. This profile is a collaborative work-in-progr
2 CONC ess, always in need of direct and primary sources. Please contribute valid sources with your information.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=white%5Fof%5Fgeorgia&id=I23855
