2 CONC :00:00
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Thomas Bennett b: 5 Nov 1603 in Wiveliscomb, England Mother: Anges Beard b: Dec 1608 in Wiveliscomb, Somerset, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Mary Berry b: 1628 in New Kent Co., Va Children Has Children William Bennett b: 1659 in King and Queen Co., Va Has No Children Richard Bennett b: 1662 in King and Queen Co,. Va Has No Children John Bennett b: in King an
2 CONC d Queen Co,. Va
2 CONT ----
