1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth (Nash) Simmons (1609-1680) was born in ENGLAND, the daughter of ?? Nash and Margaret (Porter) Nash. In 1628 Elizabeth married Thomas Simmons, Jr. (1602-1682). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth came to Massachusetts, and died as Elizabeth (Nash) Simmons in 1680, in Boston.
2 CONT
2 CONT See [http://archive.org/stream/nashfamilyorrec00nashgoog#page/n25/mode/2up The Nash Family: Or, Records of the Descendants of Thomas Nash,] of New Haven, Connecticut, 1640.  Case, Tiffany, 1853 - Connecticut - 304 pages.  Page 18,
2 CONC  for the list of Thomas Nash's children - Elizabeth Nash of Boston was not one.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=73108146&ref=wvr some of the data is erroneous - not the mother of https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Brooks/6000000008260494730 
2 CONT * Not the mother of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Simmons-Sr-of-Bruton-Parish/5056009563640051552?through=6000000082945379139
