1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===John Porter 
2 CONT *Birth:  Feb. 9, 1621 Harwich, England 
2 CONT *Death:  Aug. 2, 1688 Windsor Hartford County Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 9 Feb 1621/2 in Felsted, Essex, England to John & Anna/Rosanna (White) Porter I. Married Mary Stanley in 1650 in Hartford CT. Had twelve children, including John Porter III. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *  John Porter (1594 - 1648)
2 CONT *  Anna/Rosanna White Porter (1600 - 1648)
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT * Mary Stanley Porter (1633 - 1688)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *   John Porter (1651 - 1698)*
2 CONT *   Mary Porter Phelps (1653 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Sarah Porter Drake (1655 - ____)*
2 CONT *   James Porter (1657 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Nathaniel Porter (1660 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Hannah Porter Loomis (1662 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Samuel Porter (1663 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Rebecca Porter Loomis (1666 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Esther Porter (1669 - 1686)*
2 CONT *   Ruth Porter Loomis (1671 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Hezekiah Porter (1673 - 1757)*
2 CONT *   Joseph Porter (1674 - ____)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT *   Anna Porter Gaylord (1621 - 1653)*
2 CONT *   John Porter (1621 - 1688)
2 CONT *   Rebecca Porter (1630 - ____)*
2 CONT *   Joseph Porter (1634 - 1648)*
2 CONT *   Samuel Porter (1635 - 1689)**
2 CONT *   Mary Porter Grant (1637 - 1681)*
2 CONT *   Nathaniel Porter (1640 - 1780)*
