2 CONT
2 CONT _________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT John came to New England on the ship SUSAN & ELLEN in 1630 at Dorchester, MA, then removed to Windsor, CT in 1635. John married Mary Stanley in 1650 in Windsor, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternate source (unspecified) suggests arrived with 1638 sailing, when John was age 16.
