1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary (Porter) Grant''' was born on October 1, 1637 in Messing, Essex, England. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-3654051 John Porter, II, of Windsor] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3654059 Anna (Rosanna) (White)
2 CONC  Porter]. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT HISTORY OF THE TOWN OF STONINGTON, County of New London, Connecticut, from its first settlement in 1649 to 1900, by Richard Anson Wheeler, New London, CT, 1900, p. 400
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-48231878 Samuel Grant] on May 27, 1656 in Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut Colony, (Present USA). Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-37638464 Sam
2 CONC uel Grant, Jr.]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-22028421 Sarah (Grant) Deming]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-101356575 Infant Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-69795239 Noah Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86274885 John 
2 CONC Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86275101 Matthew Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86275237 Josiah Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86275417 Nathaniel Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-87015048 Mary (Grant) Skin
2 CONC ner]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-126322501 Unkown Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-87015241 Sarah Grant]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-43414335 Grant]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 16, 1681 in Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut Colony. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ACTUALLY HER SURNAMES ARE  WHITE PORTER!!!!! (Source?)
2 CONT --------------------
