1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nathaniel Porter, b. 19 Jul 1640, Windsor, Hartford, CT, died Jan 1680 Statford, Fairfield, CT, spouse Hannah Groves, spouse Elizabeth Baldwin.  He married Elizabeth Baldwin in 1673.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some controversy about his two wives.  Some list the second wife as Elizabeth Groves.  See the reference below for some of the sources.  Early Families of Milford, Connecticut (Abbott) simply said Elizabeth Baldwin marrie
2 CONC d a Porter and does not list children for her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel was born Jul. 19, 1640 in Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA and died Jan. 14, 1680 in Stratford, Fairfield County, Connecticut, USA. He was the son of John Porter (1594 - 1648) and Anna White (1600 - 1647).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Hannah Groves:
2 CONT # Hannah, 10 April 1665. Died 14 Feb 1738.  Married Zachariah Curtiss.
2 CONT # Sarah, 7 Sept 1667. Married Nathaniel Beach.
2 CONT # Ruth, 2 Nov 1669. Married Sgt Ebenezer Curtiss.
2 CONT # Nathaniel, 27 August 1672.  Married Ruth Woodruff.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Elizabeth Baldwin:
2 CONT # John, 28 March 1674.  Married Hannah Peck.
2 CONT # Samuel, 17 July 1675.  Married Mary ____.
2 CONT # Mary, 28 Feb 1677.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT # [http://www.familyporter.com/porter_family_line.htm Porter Family site]
2 CONT # [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=35639560 Find a Grave for Nathaniel Porter]
2 CONT # [http://boards.ancestry.com/surnames.porter/6150/mb.ashx Discussion about evidence for the wives of Nathaniel Porter]
2 CONT # [http://sdwgenealogy.vibobgen.com/page17.htm a family website for Porter]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
