2 CONT My executor to supply what Tobacco shall be required for my children's education in England, according to my Husband's Will and that he make sufficient provision when they shall come from Schoole for their accomodation and their b
2 CONC ringing of them home to Virginis all my wearing cloathes which last yeare I sent for as the profitt of my Tobaccoes bee upon the arrival locked in my Cask kept for & devided between my two daughters and the rest my Executor to hav
2 CONC e for his household use what remains in the hands of Messrs. Jeffries [Gifford?] and Manfords [Munford?] hands in London be disbursed by them for a bed & furniture for my son Francis, in lieu of one his Father in Law did owe him a
2 CONC nd two small Silver Tankards (if it so holds out) to be added to the rest of the plate for the children of my deceased husband Estate be kept entire and not parted before their legacies given by me become due unto them and if the 
2 CONC Court shall take my Childrens Estate out of my Executors hands that then my Children shall altogether be mained well educated & provided for by and with the profitt of their own estate and that my thirds and the profitts thereof s
2 CONC hall remain in my Executors hands till they come of age my Beloved husband, Amory Butler, Sole Executor and Guardian to my Children and my cousin, Captain Thos. HAWKINS my brother, Edward Rowzie and Mr. Daniel Gaines, overseers of
2 CONC  this my will provided that if my Executor do not Educate & keep them well that then Mr. Daniel Gaines shall have Guardianship of my Children my sd Executor allowing him a sufficient maintenance for their well being and education 
2 CONC according as my Overseers and Executor shll agree and if they do not what the Court shall determine for the same and if Mr. Gaines shall dye my desire is that my Cousin Hawkins do take the Children upon the same terms and if my Ex
2 CONC ecutor shall imbezill the estate or forsake the Country then my will is that my Overseers shall call him to account and finding him delinquent my Executor shall be either bound to make good the same out of his own Estate or else y
2 CONC ield it up to Mr. Daniel Gaines the sd GAINES doing as before for the Security of the Estate my sd Executor doe purchase as soon as he can a negro man for my Sonne Francis by or with the profitt of the Estate in lieu of one his Fa
2 CONC ther in Law deceased did owe him give and bequeath of the catle that were my Mothers and now in the keeping of Thomas Kirk two of the female to my Sister PEIRCE hir children with their increase for ever and also the other two of t
2 CONC he female kind with their increase and eight steers to my Bro Booths children, the sd Steers and encrease when they come of age and quality excepted if the Estate of my Children be taken out of my Executors hand within halfe a yea
2 CONC r after my decease and if my Executor be compelled to make good of the sd Estate what sall be falling short my Executor sall make good the same out of the encrease of the negroes that have bin since the same have bin committed to 
2 CONC him the sd increase to bee delivered to my children in kind when they come of age and if it shall not suffice then the same to bee made good out of my thirds or the portions thereof as my Executor shall think best for my Children 
