2 CONC :	1641 Arrival Place:	Virginia Primary Immigrant:	Williamson, Richard Source Publication Code:	2772 Annotation:	Includes 25,000 names from records of the Virginia State Land Office. Excerpts of the Irish names from the Greer list 
2 CONC were published in no. 6258, O'Brien, Early Immigrants to Virginia....Source Bibliography:	GREER, GEORGE CABELL. Early Virginia Immigrants, 1623-1666. Richmond [Va.]: W.C. Hill Printing Co., 1912, 376p. Reprinted by Genealogical Pu
2 CONC blishing Co., Baltimore, 1978. Repr. 1982.Household Members:	Name	Relation Richard Williamson	Age (blank)
