1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not confirmed as wife of https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Place/6000000006093165775?through=6000000099507127827. Disconnected July 2019
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Primary source of information: (Relationship to Francis Place, date and place of marriage)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: 'Kinfolk, Ownbey Family Lines of the Blue Ridge Mountains of North Carolina', p 1. 'The Stepp/Stapp Families of America,' Henry P. Scalf. IGI 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.smokykin.com/ged/f002/f27/a0022718.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth and death date information from 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Family History and Genealogy 
2 CONT
2 CONT of Arden Gremmert and Eva Doherty 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gremmert.com/getperson.php?personID=I79370&tree=ardeneva
2 CONT
2 CONT The above source confirms that marriage to Francis Place was in 1637 (Family 2), in Virginia, and it also indicates that she also had a marriage (date unknown) to a Robert Dooling (indicated as Family 1), and that she had three ch
2 CONC ildren 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Rowland Place, b. 1643 in Durham, Oxfordshire, 
2 CONT
2 CONT England, d. 1643
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Mary Place, b. 1648, Lancaster County, Virginia, USA; died about 15 Dec 1640
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Place, b. 1651, Lancaster County, Virginia, USA; d. unknown date
2 CONT
2 CONT It is not clear how it happened that she married Frances Place (b. Oxfordshire) in at age 20 in 1637 in Virginia, and gave birth 6 years later to her first child in 1643.  When and where did the marriage to Dooling, supposedly the
2 CONC  first husband, occur?  This source attributes the children to each marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have not added Dooling to the Tree in Geni; I can't identify him satisfactorily, and his marriage to Ann Williamson seems irrelevant to this genealogy.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have found no information about Ann Williamson's ancestors.
2 CONT
2 CONT This link gives information about Ann Williamson’s descendants, including many I have not added.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gremmert.com/descend.php?personID=I79371&tree=ardeneva
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.smokykin.com/tng/getperson.php?personID=I24640&tree=Smokykin
