2 CONT ## Nugent, Nell Marion, Abstracted and Indexed by. Cavaliers and Pioneers: Abstracts of Virginia Land Patents and Grants, 1623-1800. In Five Volumes. Richmond, VA.: Press of the Dietz Printing Co., 1935. page 558 < [https://archiv
2 CONC e.org/details/cavalierspioneer00nuge/page/558/mode/2up Archive.Org] >
2 CONT ##WILLS AND ADMINISTRATIONS OF ISLE OF WIGHT COUNTY, VIRGINIA, 1647-1800, BLANCHE ADAMS CHAPMAN, Smithfield, Virginia, 1938, Page 9 
