1 NOTE {geni:about_me} at a court held in Rappahannock County, June 4, 1684, 'Mr. Henry Williamson exhibited an account as Guardian of Margt & Arabella Williamson orphan daughters of Mr. Wm. Williamson dec'd which was Exam'd and made oat
2 CONC h to by him & ordered recorded & vouchers files.'
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/154842064/arabella-carter
2 CONT
2 CONT Info copied from [http://www.tonycoxhome.com/cox2005-p/p7.htm#i330 Anthony W. Cox Geneology].  See also ''[http://www.archive.org/stream/descendantsofcap00mill#page/n7/mode/2up The Decendents of CAPT Thomas Carter]''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arabella, daughter of William Williamson,   b. Bef 1643,   d. Bef 1679, Essex County, Virginia   (Age < 36 years) & Mother	Arabella MNU Waters
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Arabella WILLIAMSON and Captain Thomas CARTER Jr are:
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. Joseph CARTER was born 1698 in ,Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died Apr 1751 in St George Parish,Spotsylvania,Virginia. He married Catherine STEVENS 1719 in Of, Spotsylvania,VA.
2 CONT * ii. Isaac CARTER was born 1699 in ,Barford,Lancaster,Virginia.
2 CONT * iii. Thomas CARTER III was born 1 Feb 1700 in Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 8 Dec 1776 in ,Lancaster,VA. He married Miss HAYNIE ABT 1721 in Lancaster Co.,Virginia. He married Mrs Anne Wale HUNTON 15 Jan 1750 in Lancaster 
2 CONC Co.,Virginia. He married Mary BAYNES. He married Jo Anna MILLER ABT 1730 in ,Lancaster,Virginia, daughter of Nathaniel MILLARD and Susanna GLADDING. She was born 12 Aug 1708 in Swansea,Bristol,Massachusetts, and died 14 Jul 1751 i
2 CONC n Christchurch Par,Lancaster,Virginia.
2 CONT * iv. Daniel CARTER was born 1 Feb 1700 in Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 1759 in ,Lancaster,Virginia. He married Elizabeth PANNELL 1722/1725 in ,Lancaster,Virginia.
2 CONT * v. Moore CARTER was born 1700 in ,Barford,Lancaster,Virginia.
2 CONT * vi. Edward CARTER was born 1702 in ,Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 1759.
2 CONT * vii. James CARTER was born 1704 in ,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 18 Nov 1758 in Near Winchester,Frederick,Virginia. He married Joyce ABT 1728. He married Joyce NEALE ABT 1731. He married Hannah CHENOWETH ABT 1733 in Of Baltimore
2 CONC ,,Of Md. He married Joyce NEALE.
2 CONT * viii. Peter CARTER was born 23 May 1706 in Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 15 May 1765 in ,Fauquier,Virginia. He married Judith NORRIS 1 May 1730 in ,Fauquier,Virginia. He married MORGAN.
2 CONT * ix. Dale CARTER was born 1708 in Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 12 Dec 1776 in Christchurch Par,Lancaster,Virginia. He married Elizabeth EDWARDS ABT 1724.
2 CONT * x. Charles CARTER was born 1710 in Barford,Lancaster,Virginia, and died 2 Nov 1766 in Amherst, Lancaster,Virginia. He married Lucy MORGAN ABT 1745. He married Lucy Mrs CARTER ABT 1745
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Williamson was the President of the first county court held in Essex County, Virginia. Henry was named Guardian of his nieces Margaret and Arabella Williamson. (Ref: 1.) Essex Co. Deed Book 8, p. 262 and 2.) Essex Co. Order 
2 CONC Book 1, p. 43).
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
