1 NAME John /Rozier/ Jr.
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Rozier
2 NSFX Jr.
2 _MARNM Rosier
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1637
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 31 OCT 1705
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Rozier II was a son, born to Rev. John Rozier and Elizabeth Hiller circa 1637 at London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rozier !! was married twice.
2 CONT
2 CONT His 1st wife was Elizabeth Solley, whom he married circa 1656 at Westmoreland Co.,VA.  Elizabeth was born ca 1640 and died in 1672 at Westmoreland Co.,VA, at the age of 32.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rozier II and Elizabeth Solley were known to have had 3 children:  
2 CONT #David Rozier (b c 1656 - d 6/1/1698);  
2 CONT #Bridges Rozier (b c 1672 - d 1704) and 
2 CONT #Elizabeth Rozier (b after 1672 - d before 1704).
2 CONT
2 CONT John's 2nd wife was Mary Williamson, a daughter of James Williamson & Anne Underwood.  Mary was born in Lancaster Co.,VA ca 1656 and died before 1717 in Richmond Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT John & Mary were known to have had 2 children:  
2 CONT #Mary Rozier [b after 1672 - d after 1698] and 
2 CONT #William Rozier [b after 1673].
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rozier !! died on October 31, 1705 at Westmoreland Co.,VA.  His burial site is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLS OF Westmoreland County, Virginia 1654-1800 BY AUGUSTA B. FOTHERGILL: Pg 2
2 CONT
2 CONT HILLER, JOHN, 12 October 1657; 20 February 1657. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Legatees; dau. Elizabeth Rozier and grandchild John Rozier, Jnr. to have all my estate save child of Mr. Webb my late wife's godchild one cow and calf; son in law John Rozier, clerk, to be executor.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
