2 CONT G(2) "The Chinn and Myers Families," by Randie Myers (http://wc.rootsweb.com, rjm66 database, 29 Apr 2007). Cites: 
2 CONT *(a) Lancaster Co., Wills, etc. No 8 (1690-1709) p.210-211. Copied from a handwritten copy in the Chinn Family file #73 developed by Miss Nanon L. Carr and located in the Mid-Continent Genelogy Library, Independence, MO. *(b) Stev
2 CONC e L. Smoot (smoots@compuserve.com), 1/7/97, Ref.: WFT Vol. 1, #5009, Ref.: WFT Vol. 1, #5196, Ref.: WFT Vol. 2, #5282. Birth:  (1) Bef. 1660. Alice SMOOT, surname not certain. Sister of Dorothea and Thomasine.   (2) d/o William SM
2 CONC OOT/Grace. Abt 1642. York Co., VA.
2 CONT *Marriage to John CHINN: (1) Bef. 1682. (2) Abt 1679. Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT *Marriage to John STRETCHLEY: (1) (2) Abt 1692. VA.
2 CONT *Death: (1) 29 Aug 1701. [NOTE: Date of will.] (1,2) Lancaster Co., VA. (2) Sep 1701. (2a) Will dtd 29 Aug 1701, probated 8 Oct 1701, Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT *Burial: 
2 CONT **(1) St. Marys White Chapel, Lancaster Co., VA.
