1 NOTE !DEATH - ABSTRACTS LANCASTER CO., VA WILLS 1653-1800 by Ida J. Lee, p. 110
2 CONT Heale, Ellen of St. Mary's White Chappell, widow 15 Oct 1710 - 13 Dec 1710 Recorded
2 CONT Sons:  Will, Joseph, George, Nicholas & John
2 CONT Son Will to have land bought of Mr. Thos. Taylor & Elizabeth his wife, lying upon the braches of Capt. Richard Ball's Swamp.
2 CONT Daus:  Ellen, Elizabeth, Sarah, Mrs. Hannah Ball wife of Capt. Wm. Ball.
2 CONT Exors:  Sons Joseph, John & William Heale.
2 CONT Wits: Joseph Ball, James Stevenson, Joseph Taylor. W.B. 10, p. 43
2 CONT Note:  She mentions son, Will who was not mentioned in husband, George Heale's will.  He may have been born after father's death. - JMC
2 CONT Note:  She mentions daughter, Mrs. Hannah Ball wife of Capt. Wm. Ball which again proves that Capt. Wm. Ball married Hannah Heale and not Hannah Beale. - JMC
