2 CONT !  Birth: (1,5) s/o George HEALE/Ellen. (3) s/o George HEALE/Ellen ROGERS. 1686.
2 CONT   Marriage to Catherine CHINN: (5) (3) 1702. Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT   Death: (3) Abt 1736. VA. (4a) Will dtd 23 Sep 1736, Lancaster Co., VA. (5) Will proved 23 Sep 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT   (2) [Undated]: Ann (CHINN) (FOX) CHICHESTER, in her will, names niece Ellen HEALE, Capt. Geo. HEALE, Geo. HEALE Jr., Wm. HEALE Jr., Ann and Catherine HEALE, Elizabeth HEALE.
2 CONT   (4a,5) 1736, 23 Sep: (4a) George HEALE made his will. Gave to my Daughter Elizabeth DAVENPORT; My daughter Sarah; my Daughter Ann HEALE; to my Daughter Catherine; Brother Joseph; Brother John; Son In Law Lindsy OPIE; John HEALE 
2 CONC & Joseph HEALE to be my executors. (5) Will proved.
2 CONT   (4a) 1742, 13 Aug: Indenture between Lindsey OPIE and Sarah his wife and George HEALE, "Sarah's fourth part of the Lands & tenements which were of John HEALE Gent dec'd . . . descended and came to her as one of the Daughters & c
2 CONC oheirs of Capn George HEALE," Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT   (4a) 1763, 14 Jun: Indenture between Lindsey OPIE and Elizabeth his wife and Andrew ROBERTSON, "Tract of Land Devised by the Last Will & Testament of George NEALE Gent dec'd Late of the said County of Lancaster bearing Date" 13 
2 CONC Dec 1697 "unto his son Joseph in Tail remainder to his son John both whom dying without issue, the said Tract of Land descended unto Elizabeth Sarah Anne and Catherine, Daughters and Coheirs of George Eldest son of the said George
2 CONC  HEALE," Lancaster Co., VA.
2 CONT
