2 CONT Heale, Wm. 6 Feb. 1731/2   Recorded 12 July 1732
2 CONT Wife:  Priscilla  Son:  George.  Dau:  Betty.  Brother:  Joseph Heale to have certain negroes made over to him and his former wife Elizabeth 25 Nov. 1725.  Brothers:  George & John Heale.  Mrs. Pinckard, My wife's sister.
2 CONT Exors:  John Heale, Wm. Downman and cousin Wm. Ball.
2 CONT Wits:  Thomas Pinckard, Isaac Cundiff, Edwin Conway.  W.B., 12, p. 357
2 CONT 5 Aug. 1732.  Inv. & Ap. returned by John Heale, his Exor. W. B. 12, p. 231
2 CONT Note:  He would have died some time between 6 Feb. 1732 - 12 July 1732. - JMC
