1 NAME Daniel Daniel /McCarty/ of Pope’s Creek
2 GIVN Daniel Daniel
2 SURN McCarty
2 NSFX of Pope’s Creek
2 _MARNM McCarty
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1720 AND 1725
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
