2 CONT Married 2nd Sarah McCarty 1766/1767.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died in Fairfax Co., August 22, 1796 (tombstone).
2 CONT
2 CONT He moved from Lancaster Co. to Fauquier Co.. 1765.  When he moved to Fairfax Co.. is not known, prob. soon after his 2d marriage. - Ibid
