2 CONT Children of Judith PAYNE and George BALL are:
2 CONT
2 CONT # William BALL died 1796 in , Frederick, Virginia. He married Judith THROCKMORTON BEF 1765. She was born in , , Virginia. He married Drusilla SINGLETON 18 JUL 1790 in , Frederick, Virginia.
2 CONT # Benjamin BALL.
2 CONT # Richard BALL.
2 CONT # John BALL died in , Fauquier, Virginia. He married Mary BALL 2 MAR 1765 in , Lancaster, Virginia, daughter of William BALL and Hannah KENNER. She was born 1748 in , Fauquier, Virginia.
2 CONT # Williamson BALL was born 1740, and died in , Richmond, Virginia. He married (wife of Williamson Ball) GLASSCOCK AFT 1759 in , , Virginia. He married Anne BEALE 23 NOV 1762 in , Richmond, Virginia. He married Priscilla CHURCHILL 
2 CONC 9 FEB 1765 in , Middlesex, Virginia. She was born 1740 in Bushby Park, Middlesex, Virginia.
2 CONT # George BALL.
2 CONT #  Judith BALL.
2 CONT # Hannah BALL.
2 CONT # Sarah BALL.
2 CONT #Elizabeth BALL.
