2 CONT "Howson,  Leond. Sold land to Tho Bayles.  19 Feb 1665/6.  19.3." ...... "Leonard. Wit deed Hill to Taylor.  10 Aug 1667.  16.70." ........ "Mr. Leond:  His servt Mary Levistone adj 17 yrs old.  20 Oct 1668.  3.44." ...... "Mr. Le
2 CONC ond:  Justice.  20 Nov 1668.  3.48." ....... "Leond:  Buys 2 servants, Lewis Jenkins and Nicholas Allgrone, from George Courtnell.   Wit:  Jam: Gaylord and John Rotherram.  27 Jan 1668/9 16.69." ...... "Leond: Wit P of A Mould to 
