1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Benjamin and Nancy (Petty?) Ball. Came from Abbeville County, South Carolina with his family in about 1824.  Settled first in Franklin County, Indiana where his father probably died and moved to Fayette Coun
2 CONC ty by 1830. Husband of Susan Myers Ball (1817-1845) and Cynthia Ann Coe Ball (1824-1899).
