2 CONT ==Edwin Conway ll==
2 CONT * Born: Abt 1644, England,U.K.
2 CONT * Died: Aug 1698, Richmond Co.,Virginia,U.S.A.
2 CONT * Father: Edwin Conway
2 CONT * Mother: Martha Eltonhead
2 CONT
2 CONT Married  
2 CONT # 1675-1680 at Old Rappahannock,Virginia,U.S.A. to Sarah Walker, daughter of Lieut-Col. John Walker, Esq., of Gloucester County, and Sarah, his wife, widow of Lieut. Colonel Henry Fleete, Lancaster county, VA.
2 CONT # 21 May 1695, Lancaster Co.,Virginia,U.S.A. to Elizabeth Thompson, [daughter of Richard Thompson & Ursula Bish] Disputed that https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Presley/6000000000628463489 was a wife of https://www.geni.com/pe
2 CONC ople/Gentleman-Edwin-Conway-II-of-Lancaster/6000000002649904133 “21 May 1695, Lancaster Co., Virginia Edwin Conway married to Elizabeth Thompson, daughter of Richard Thompson & Ursula Bishe as his 2nd wife.”
2 CONT
2 CONT lived first in Lancaster County on lands acquired by his father and then moved to Richmond County where his will was probated on September 7, 1698
2 CONT
