2 CONT
2 CONT >Abstracts of Lancaster County, Virginia Wills 1653-1800; {Ida J. Lee}
2 CONT
2 CONT >SELDEN, Mildred (of Richmond Co.) 29 Mar. 1793. Rec. 16 Sept. 1793.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Sisters: Sinah Beale, Judith Fauntleroy, Ann Ball, Sarah Fauntleroy, Frances Lee. Nieces: Ann Ball, dau. of brother Col. Jesse Ball & Louisa Fauntleroy. Brother: Col. James Ball. Nephews: William Ball, son of Col. Jesse Ball, Jam
2 CONC es Ball McCarty, Wm. Henry Fauntleroy. Ex: James Ball. Wits: Fanny Ball, Fanny McCarty, Mary W. Ball. W.B. 22, p. 394.
