2 DATE 28 JUL 1749
2 PLAC Bewdley Plantation
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lancaster
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY British Colonial America
1 BURI
2 DATE 1800
2 PLAC Springwood Plantation, Ball Burial Ground  
