1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/mccarty/4364/<br/>
2 CONT I recently made the discovery that our Jacob McCarty who died in 1812 in Stewart Co., TN was the son of Daniel & Agnes, not the Jacob McCarty who married Mary Morrow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob's wife Cathrine was the daughter of David and Hannah Standley/Stanley/Standlee of Anson/Tryon/Mecklenburg Co., NC. If you read the story of Stanley Creek, in the town of Stanley, it tells about George, John & David Stanley. 
2 CONC We've been able to determine that John is David's father, but haven't been able to place George yet.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Much documentation given at this site)
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/McCarty-853<br/>
2 CONT (parents unknown)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/104508512/jacob-mccarty<br/>
2 CONT Husband of Mary Polly Morrow, and father of eight children. James Madison, John W., William M., Jacob Jr., Andrew P., Hugh Blair, Mary Ann Hill, and Martha Jane (McCarty) Stringfellow.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/mccarty/4343/<br/>
2 CONT Jacob McCarty, another candidate for the son of Daniel & Agness McCarty. Brother-in-law of  Abraham Standley (son of David, and Catherine Standley's brother). " I Abraham Standley of the State of Tennesee at present of the County 
2 CONC of S' Clair in the North West Territory By Virtue of Powers Vested in me By my Father David Standley and by power from my Brother John Standley and David Standley Jun' and by Powers Vested in me By my Brother in Law Jacob McCarty"
2 CONT ----
2 CONT found at:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/l/l/o/Robert-H-Lloyd/GENE3-0004.html 8. Jacob McCarty, born Abt. 1765 in Mecklenburg Co., North Carolina; died February 26, 1841 in Tippah Co., Mississippi. He was the son of 16.
2 CONC  Colonel Daniel McCarty II and 17. Agnes Unknown. He married 9. Mary Polly Morrow Abt. 1800 in Georgia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT       9. Mary Polly Morrow, born Abt. 1770 in North Carolina; died 1844 in Tippah Co., Mississippi. She was the daughter of 18. James Morrow and 19. Mary Unknown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jacob McCarty and Mary Morrow are: 
2 CONT  	4	i.	 	James Madison McCarty, born June 06, 1802 in Oglethorp Co., Georgia; died September 14, 1869 in Meridian, Bosque Co., Texas; married Nancy Fike Abt. 1824 in Perry Co., Alabama.
2 CONT  		ii.	 	John W. McCarty, born March 31, 1805 in Ogelthorp Co., Georgia; died May 1860 in Tippa Co., Mississippi; married Cynthia Unknown 1829 in Possibly Tennessee.
2 CONT  		iii.	 	Martha Jane McCarty, born August 05, 1807 in Tennessee; died March 19, 1870 in Tippa Co., Mississippi; married Mastin Stringfellow Abt. 1824 in Dallas Co., Alabama.
2 CONT  		iv.	 	Mary Ann McCarty, born Abt. 1809 in Alabama; married Giles Bird Hill 1830 in Dallas Co., Alabama.
2 CONT  		v.	 	William M. McCarty, born Abt. 1814 in Madison Co., Alabama; died July 29, 1870 in Pike Co., Arkansas; married Arminda Nilla McVay November 13, 1834 in Lawrence Co., Alabama; born 1818 in Alabama.
2 CONT  		vi.	 	Jacob McCarty II, born Abt. 1815 in Alabama; married Elizabeth A. Simpson 1836 in Tippah Co., Mississippi.
2 CONT  		vii.	 	Andrew P. McCarty, C.S.A., born Abt. 1817 in Dallas Co., Alabama; died October 08, 1863 in Alton, Madison Co., Illinois in Federal Prison Camp; married Mary S. McVay Abt. 1843 in Mississippi; born February 24, 1826 in No
2 CONC rth Carolina or Alabama; died April 06, 1887 in Kennedale, Tarrant Co., Texas.
2 CONT  		viii.	 	Hugh Blair McCarty, born Abt. 1822 in Dallas Co., Alabama; died October 18, 1910 in Kennedale, Tarrant Co., Texas; married Mary Macon April 04, 1846 in Hardeman Co., Tennessee; born 1829 in South Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT       10. William Fike, born Abt. 1780. He was the son of 20. John Fike and 21. Unknown Mahatable. He married 11. Mary Cook. 
2 CONT
2 CONT       11. Mary Cook 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Fike and Mary Cook are: 
2 CONT  	5	i.	 	Nancy Fike, born August 01, 1802 in Chatham Co., North Carolina; died in Duffau, Erath Co., Texas; married James Madison McCarty Abt. 1824 in Perry Co., Alabama.
2 CONT  		ii.	 	Jerman M. Fike, married Catherine Smith September 23, 1836 in Perry Co., Alabama.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
