2 CONC t", situated in Northumberland county and to be laid off next and adjoining the land belonging to Colonel Peter HACK for the use and behalf of Joseph BALL and  William BALL, sons of the said Mary Lowry, late widow and relict of Jo
2 CONC seph BALL, deceased.
