1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  THOMAS5 DAMRON (GEORGE4 DAMERON, LAWRENCE DAMERON3 SR., GEORGE2 DAMERON, EDMUND1) was born 1683 in Northumberland Co. VA, and died 1750 in Northumberland Co. VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Parents: George Dameron (1649–1698)
2 CONT *Spouses:  1) Katherine Huglett Dameron (1683–1716 (m. 1705)) 2) Winifred Conway Dameron-Fielding (1687 – unknown (m. 1717)), 3) Ann Ball Dameron-Pope (1687 – unknown (m. 1730))
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of THOMAS DAMRON include 
2 CONT *                   i.    THOMAS6 DAMRON, b. Abt. 1708, Northumberland Co, Va; d. 1757, Northumberland Co, Va.
2 CONT *11.             ii.    WINIFRED DAMRON, b. Abt. 1719.
2 CONT *12.            iii.    ELIZABETH DAMRON, b. 1706.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT As stated before Ann Pope, widow of John Pope, m. Thomas Dameron of Wicomico parish, about 1729 or 30, by whom she had two children, George and Anne Dameron. Thomas Dameron's will dated March 27, 1750, names wife, Ann, and his chi
2 CONC ldren, George and Anne Dameron, both minors.
2 CONT
