2 CONC 2016), entry for John Lillard; Applications for Headstones for U.S. Military Veterans, 1925-1941. Microfilm publication M1916, 134 rolls. ARC ID: 596118. Records of the Office of the Quartermaster General, Record Group 92. Nationa
2 CONC l Archives at Washington, D.C..
