1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Travers Daniel BIRTH	30 Mar 1741 DEATH	28 Jun 1824 (aged 83) BURIAL	 Daniel Family Cemetery Falmouth, Stafford County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/68601829/travers-daniel
2 CONT
2 CONT TRAVERS DANIEL, Sr. {Peter2 James1), of "Tranquility," Stafford county, Va., b. Mount Pleasant, Va., May 26, 1741; d. "Crow's Nest," Stafford county, Va., June 28, 1824; m. "Clermont," Stafford county, by Rev. James Scott, Oct. 7,
2 CONC  1762, Frances Moncure, b. Sep. 20, 1745; B. Sep. 28, 1745; d.—; daughter of Rev. John and Frances (Brown) Moncure.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Sarah Travers Daniel Adams 1765–1815
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances Brown Daniel Greenhow 1774–1840
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Peter Vivian Daniel 1784–1860
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Eliza Travers Daniel 1802–1823 TRAVERS DANIEL, Sr. {Peter2 James1), of "Tranquility," Stafford county, Va., b. Mount Pleasant, Va., May 26, 1741; d. "Crow's Nest," Stafford county, Va., June 28, 1824; m. "Clermont," Staffor
2 CONC d county, by Rev. James Scott, Oct. 7, 1762, Frances Moncure, b. Sep. 20, 1745; B. Sep. 28, 1745; d.—; daughter of Rev. John and Frances (Brown) Moncure.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Travers Daniel, b. Aug. 4, 1763; m. July 1791, Mildred Stone, born 1771, died Oct. 26, 1836, daughter of Hon. Thomas and Margaret (Brown) Stone. Note: Thomas & Margaret Stone are buried at Thomas Stone National Historic Site Po
2 CONC rt Tobacco, Charles County, Maryland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  i. Frances Daniel, b. 1797, d. 11 JUN 1833, m. John Moncure, b. 24 DEC 1793, d. 3 AUG 1876.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Moncure Daniel, d. young.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Eliza Travers Daniel, b. 1802, d. 29 JUN 1823.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Emily Travers Daniel, b. 1806, d. , m. 15 NOV 1832 Gustavus Brown Wallace, b. 26 JAN 1810, d. 11 MAY 1882.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Samuel Greenhow Daniel, b. abt 1810, m. 1) Margaret B. (Richardson) Lewis, b. 15 APR 1813, m. 2) Maria K. Henderson, b. MAY 1836.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Travers DANIEL and Frances MONCURE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Travers DANIEL was born 4 AUG 1763 in Stafford Co., VA, and died AFT 1810 in VA. He married Mildred STONE JUL 1791, daughter of Thomas STONE and Margaret (Mary) BROWN. She was born 27 FEB 1772 in Calvert Co., MD, and died 27 OC
2 CONC T 1837 in Stafford Co., VA. She was buried in Crow's Nest Cemetery, Crow's Nest Point, Stafford Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Sarah Travers DANIEL was born 31 DEC 1765 in Stafford Co., VA, and died JUN 1815. She married Charles HAY, son of Anthony HAY and Elizabeth DAVENPORT. He was born ABT 1768. She married Richard ADAMS, son of Richard ADAMS and E
2 CONC lizabeth GRIFFIN. He was born 26 NOV 1760, and died 9 JAN 1817.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. John Moncure DANIEL was born 14 SEP 1769 in Crow's Nest, Stafford Co., VA, and died 7 OCT 1813 in Stafford Co., VA. He married Maria "Jean" NIVIN 16 JAN 1792 in St. John's, London, Middlesex, England. She was born ABT 1769, a
2 CONC nd died 30 OCT 1792 in Dumfries, Stafford Co., VA. He married Margaret Eleanor STONE 15 DEC 1793, daughter of Thomas STONE and Margaret (Mary) BROWN. She was born 1771 in MD, and died 9 MAR 1809. He married Maria VOWLES MAR 1809, 
2 CONC daughter of Henry VOWLES and Mary FRAZIER. She was born ABT 1799. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Frances Brown DANIEL was born 19 FEB 1774 in Stafford Co., VA. She married Samuel GREENHOW. He was born ABT 1774.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Elizabeth DANIEL was born 18 OCT 1778 in Stafford Co., VA, and died 8 AUG 1827. She married Richmond LEWIS 20 OCT 1802, son of Zachary III LEWIS and Anne Overton TERRELL. He was born 14 MAR 1774 in Belair, Spotsylvania Co., VA,
2 CONC  and died 31 JUL 1831. 
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Hannah Ball DANIEL was born 29 DEC 1780 in Stafford Co., VA. She married Raleigh Travers BROWN ABT 1799, son of Raleigh Travers BROWN and Million WAUGH. He was born ABT 1780. She married John Grayson HEDGMAN AFT 1800, son of J
2 CONC ohn HEDGMAN and Catherine GRAYSON. He was born ABT 1784 in Stafford Co., VA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Ann Moncure DANIEL was born 17 FEB 1782 in Stafford Co., VA. viii. Walter Raleigh DANIEL was born 1783 in Stafford Co., VA, and died 11 SEP 1818. He married Elizabeth LEWIS, daughter of Zachary III LEWIS and Anne Overton TERR
2 CONC ELL. She was born 20 MAY 1786 in VA, and died 24 SEP 1816.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. Peter Vivian DANIEL was born 24 APR 1784 in Crow's Nest, Stafford Co., VA, and died 30 JUN 1860 in Richmond, VA. He married Lucy Nelson RANDOLPH 1811, daughter of Edmond Jennings RANDOLPH and Elizabeth Carter NICHOLAS. She was
2 CONC  born 1790 in VA, and died NOV 1847. He married Elizabeth HARRIS 1853. She was born ABT 1790.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. Jane Wood DANIEL was born 1787 in VA, and died 3 JAN 1853 in Frankfort, Franklin Co., KY. She married John LEWIS 21 NOV 1808, son of Zachary III LEWIS and Anne Overton TERRELL. He was born 25 FEB 1784 in Llangollen, Spotsylvani
2 CONC a Co., VA, and died 15 AUG 1858 in Franklin Co., KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT INFORMATION PROVIDED BY CONTRIBUTOR Richard H. L. Chichester, III.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/68601829/travers-daniel Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 
2 CONC 1 2020, 2:01:03 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
