1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 101
2 CONT Joseph Chinn born 1739 (prob. in Lancaster Co., VA - JMC).
2 CONT I think that he must have been son of Priscilla Downman Heale and Joseph Chinn as the recording of estate of her previous husband, William Heale is dated 8 July 1837 and she is listed as wife of Joseph Chinn, Gent. - JMC
2 CONT Note:  VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES gives his name as John while THE BEVERLEY FAMILY OF VA. gives his name as Joseph Chinn, Jr. - JMC
