1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Father*	Christopher Garlington1 d. b 21 Aug 1678 	 	Christopher Garlington was the son of Christopher Garlington.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Residence*	March 1680 	Christopher Garlington lived in March 1680 at Northumberland, Virginia; Xpfer. Heavily fined for abusing Lt Coll Smith, breaking his collar bone, etc. March 1680/1. 4.85.2  Land*	18 June 1706 	He obtained a 
2 CONC Bureau of Land Management land patent from Christo. Gent of N. Co., ded to Maurice Jones. 18 June 1706. 17.1. Margarett. Wife of Christo: 18 June 1706. 17.3. 18 June 1706 Northumberland, Virginia.2  Will*	18 May 1709 	He left a wi
2 CONC ll on 18 May 1709 at Northumberland, Virginia; Of Wicco par. To sons Christo, Saml, Wm. Refs to land adj Maurice Jones. Wife Margaret. Dau Frances. Dau Sarah Jones. Exors "My Bro Maurice Jones", wife Margaret, son Christopher and 
2 CONC friend Tho Gaskins. Maurice Jones swears he wrote the will. Wm Gallaway and Tho Hill swear they wit it. No dates for these depos but would be recorded 19 May 1714. 17.210.2  Probate*	19 May 1714 	His estate was probated on 19 May 
2 CONC 1714 at Northumberland, Virginia; Gallaway, Wm. Swears he wit will d 18 May 1709 of Christo Garlington. 19 May 1714. 17.210.2  Family 	
2 CONT Child		
2 CONT
