1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Christopher Garlington1 d. 1753 Birth*	24 February 1727 	Sarah Ann Garlington was born on 24 February 1727 at Lancaster, Virginia.1  	 	She was the daughter of Christopher Garlington.1  Marriage*	before 13 January 
2 CONC 1748 	Sarah Ann Garlington married Peter Spencer Hack before 13 January 1748 at Northumberland, Virginia.1  Marriage*	1 September 1763 	Sarah Ann Garlington married Capt. John Foushee, son of James Foushee and Mary Sarah (?), on 1
2 CONC  September 1763; Foushee, John (wid.) & Yeats, Winifred; bef. 3 Apr 1728; bride was the 2nd wife of Jno. Foushee & a dau. of Francis (d. RC c. 1724) & Winifred (Jacobus) Yeats; (RC AB 1:74;OB 9:400; MRC:72 (and James Lewis Correct
2 CONC ions))
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 1:      Fouchee, John Spouse 2:      Hack, Sarah Anne Marriage Date:      1 Sep 1763 Marriage Location:      Virginia Northumberland County.1,2  Death*	1776 	Sarah Ann Garlington died in 1776.  Family 1 	Peter Spencer Hack 
2 CONC b. 11 Feb 1700, d. b 1760 Family 2 	Capt. John Foushee b. 6 Jul 1697, d. 3 Mar 1769
