1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Rev James Creswell, said to have been born in Ireland and to have lived at Creswell?s Ferry (now Port Deposit), Cecil County, Md., was in Lancaster County, Va., with Dr. John Creswell in 1762. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He and Mary Elizabeth ?Molly? Garlington, age 29, were married in Lancaster County, bond issued 9 June 1763.[25] She was born 1733-1734, a daughter of Christopher and Elizabeth (Conway) Garlington. 
