1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married to Winifred Oldham who was born November 19, 1736, died April 3, 1797 and was also buried at the First Presbyterian Church in Allegheny County, Pittsburgh PA. Winifred Oldham's parents were John Oldham (who
2 CONC  was descended from John Oldham who emigrated to VA. from England in March, 1635) and Anne Conway. They had two children, Presley Neville who married Nancy Morgan and Amelia Neville who married Major Issac Craig.
