1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Nancy "Ann" Oldham==
2 CONT * Birth: ABT 1744
2 CONT * Death: 1818 in Clark County, Ohio (also seen as Hampshire VA)
2 CONT * Burial: on the William Ross farm, Clark County, Ohio
2 CONT * Father: John Oldham b: 17 OCT 1708 in Northumberland, Virginia 
2 CONT * Mother: Ann Nancy Conway b: 1718 in Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 
2 CONT # on 7 JAN 1760  to Daniel Rector , Sr., son of John Rector & Anna Catharina Fishback.  He  b: 8 FEB 1741/42 in Germantown, Fauquier, Virginia & died 1 MAY 1814 in Clark County, Ohio  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT #  Winifred Rector b: 6 MAR 1756 in Prince William, Virginia.  Married William Ross.
2 CONT #  John Rector b: ABT 1758.  
2 CONT #  Conway Rector b: ABT 1760 in of, Hampshire, Virginia.  Married 1) Mary Copsey 2) Nancy Parker
2 CONT #  Charles M. Rector b: 26 MAR 1761 in Rectortown, Fauquier County, Virginia.  Married 1) Sarah Chapman 2) Catherine (Haynes) Marshall
2 CONT #  Nancy Rector b: 1767.  Married Freeman Battershell.
2 CONT #  Abigail Rector b: ABT 1768.  Married John Battershell (brother of Freeman).
2 CONT #  Daniel Rector , Jr. b: ABT 1770.  Married Nancy Garber.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT 1796 Will of Ann Nancy Conway Oldham Aughey, mother of Nancy Ann Oldham Rector, mentions daughter Nancy Rector. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=52988274
