1 NAME Agatha /Conway/
2 GIVN Agatha
2 SURN Conway
2 _MARNM Ball
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1745
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT === Research notes from Louis W McFaul
2 CONT
2 CONT Agatha Conway was the daughter of Peter Conway's second wife, Elizabeth Lee, rather than his first wife, Elizabeth Spann. Agatha Conway married Jesse Ball and they named a daughter Betty Lee Ball.
2 CONT
2 CONT Betty Lee Ball married John Gordon. Their second son, John Willison Gordon, named a son John Lee Gordon.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1740 division of Richard Lee's estate acknowledges that Peter Conway's wife was his (Richard Lee's) daughter. Agatha Conway was married in 1765 and thus Agatha was likely to have been born sometime in the decade of the 1740's.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT # https://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I106912&tree=Tree1
