2 CONC ried.  He had two spouses, the first, name unknown and the second, Katherine Dale, daughter of a British military commander assigned to duty in the colonies.  Thomas and his second wife, Katherine, were members of the Church of En
2 CONC gland and their twelve children are listed in the Captain Thomas Carter Prayer Book in the possession of the Historical Society of Richmond, Virginia.
