2 CONC h: Hayne, ye Lady Ann Skipworth & Elizh Dale godparts." !April 24, 1728, "Thomas Carter of the County of Lancaster Gent." made his will, probated Oct. 10, 1733. He left all estate to wife Aarabella during her widowhood, after whic
