1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Katy, Aunt Fanny said, was a great beauty, and married a Mr. Tabb, and I guess was the great grandmother of the Gloucester Tabbs, who are a rich and prominent family.". 
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharine "3d Dau. was born at 6 aclock Easter Morning 4h Apl 1686 Bapd on Whit-Sundy Mr. David Fox Mrs. Hannah Fox & Mrs. Sarah Perrotte Gdpts." (1).  Alt death date: May 28, 1746 (60), which conflicts with the Prayer Book source
2 CONC  (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Captain Thomas Carter, Sr.(1631-1700) &  Katherine Dale (-d. 1703)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # 16 June 1703 to John Lawson born about 1681.  He was the son of John Lawson & Mary Kilby.
2 CONT # Unknown Tabb
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT #  Elizabeth Lawson born 30 Apr 1707 in Northumberland, Virginia.  Died 1769 in Lancaster, Virginia.  named in Mary Kilby's will
2 CONT # other daughters ?
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT * Also spelled Catherine. "Died at age 51." Pg 4 of The old Carter Prayer Book says that Katharine Carter married John Lawson on the 16th of June 1703. (1). [http://files.usgwarchives.net/va/lancaster/bibles/carter1.txt Prayer Boo
2 CONC k of Captain Thomas Carter of Barford, Lancaster County, VA]
2 CONT * her mother's pedigree is said to go back to Charlemagne.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
