2 CONT # [http://archive.org/stream/descendantsofcap00mill#page/n93/mode/2up/search/Lawson  Miller, Joseph L, and Effie S. Campbell. The Descendants of Capt. Thomas Carter of "barford," Lancaster County, Virginia, 1652-1912: With Genealo
2 CONC gical Notes of Many of the Allied Families. Thomas, W. Va: J.L. Miller, 1912. Internet resource.] Page 4.
