2 CONC 1762. My wife being delivered of a son George; my wife in descent from her grandfather Col. Ashton; my brothers Samuel and Charles; the children of my sister Lewis and the children of my sister in law Mrs. Booth; to Mrs. William B
2 CONC ooth of Cople Parish.
