2 CONT Augustine Washington Jr. is the half-brother of George Washington, the first president of the United States. Augustine Jr. is the son of Augustine Washington Sr. and his first wife Jane Butler. Augustine Jr is also the brother of 
2 CONC Lawrence Washington, the builder of the Mt. Vernon estate. Augustine Washington Jr. married Ann Aylett. They are both buried is the same common grave. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Augustine, Jr. & Ann (Aylett) Washington: Jane Augusta Washington Thornton (1740 - 1833)* Elizabeth Washington Spotswood (1749 - 1814)* William Augustine Washington (1757 - 1810).
2 CONT
2 CONT For more pictures go to the Media section.
2 CONT
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial # 21504.
