1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA LINEAGES, LETTERS & MEMORIES p. 270
2 CONT Mildred Warner of Warner Hall, Goucester Co. born about 1671.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #1 - ANCESTORS OF AMERICAN PRESIDENTS compiled by Gary Boyd Roberts, p.1
2 CONT Married abt 1689 at Warner Hall, Gloucester Co., VA to Lawrence Washington, son of Col. John Washington and Ann Pope.  Mildred Warner Washington and Lawrence Washington became the grandparents of George Washington.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - Ibid
2 CONT She married second, George Gayle of England and returned with him to that place where she died in 1701 and was buried in St. Nicholas Church, Whitehaven.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - VIRGINIA LINEAGES, LETTERS AND MEMORIES p. 270 by Alice Jean Nelson
2 CONT Mildred Warner Washington died 26 Mar 1701 Cumberland, England.
