1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===John Washington  
2 CONT * Gender:	Male 
2 CONT * Birth:	circa November 12, 1692  
2 CONT * Bridges Creek, King George, Virginia, USA 
2 CONT * Death:	September 01, 1746 (49-57)  
2 CONT * Highgate, Gloucester, Virginia, USA 
2 CONT * Place of Burial:	George Washington Birthplace National Monument, Westmoreland, VA, United States 
2 CONT * Son of Captain Lawrence Washington and Mildred (Warner) Gale  
2 CONT * Husband of Catherine (Whiting) Washington 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Catherine WHITING and John WASHINGTON are:
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. Elizabeth WASHINGTON was born 1718. She married Nathaniel WILLIAMS, son of Jonathan H. WILLIAMS and Mary KEELING. He was born 2 DEC 1712 in New Kent County, Virginia, and died SEP 1766 in Charlotte County, Virginia.
2 CONT * ii. Augustine WASHINGTON was born ABT 1720 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia.
2 CONT * iii. francis WASHINGTON was born ABT 1720 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia.
2 CONT * iv. henry WASHINGTON was born ABT 1720 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia.
2 CONT * v. Lawrence WASHINGTON was born ABT 1720 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia. He married KATHERINE FOOTE 5 OCT 1774 in Stafford County VA, daughter of Richard III FOOTE and KATHARINE FOSSAKER. She was born 24 NOV 1740 in St
2 CONC afford County VA, and died 1799 in Stafford County VA.
2 CONT * vi. Mildred WASHINGTON was born ABT 1720 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia.
2 CONT * vii. Warner WASHINGTON was born 22 SEP 1722 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia, and died 1791 in Winchester, Frederick, Virginia. He married Elizabeth MACON. She was born 1729, and died 1763 in Winchester, Frederick, Virgi
2 CONC nia. He married Hannah FAIRFAX 10 MAY 1764 in fairfax county Virginia, daughter of william col FAIRFAX and Deborah GEDNEY. She was born 1739 in Belvoir Manor, Fairfax County, Virginia, and died 3 SEP 1804 in Frederick County, Virg
2 CONC inia.
2 CONT * viii. catherine WASHINGTON was born 11 FEB 1724 in Highgate, Gloucester County, Virginia, and died 19 FEB 1750 in Fredericksburg, Virginia. She married Fielding Gen. LEWIS 18 OCT 1746, son of John LEWIS and Frances FIELDING. He 
2 CONC was born 7 JUL 1725 in warner Hall Gloucester County, Virginia, and died 1782 in Gloucester County, Virginia.
2 CONT
