2 CONT Born: Abt 1696 Died: 5 Sep 1747, Virginia, USA about age 51
2 CONT * daughter of Laurence Washington and Mildred Warner
2 CONT
2 CONT * Marriage (1): John Lewis in 1716 in Virginia, USA 
2 CONT * Marriage (2): Colonel, Roger Gregory in Jul 1718 in Spotsylvania County, Virginia, USA 1518
2 CONT * Marriage (3): Henry Willis ; After Mildred Howell Brown (Lewis) Willis  death Henry Willis married Mildred Washington, daughter of Lawrence Washington and Mildred Warner, and they had one child, Lewis Willis. 
