1 NOTE Martha Dandridge Custis Washington
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=8030e9ec-4050-422b-9bda-b5ca92d4574b&tid=6722186&pid=-1026737186
1 NOTE Martha Dandridge Custis Washington 
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=document&guid=16d8dcf2-cd67-485e-8c3b-5de109a92138&tid=6722186&pid=-1026737186
1 NOTE !BIRTH - ANCESTORS OF AMERICAN PRESIDENTS compiled by Gary Boyd Roberts, p. 1
2 CONT Martha Dandridge was born 21 June 1731 in New Kent Co., VA
2 CONT She was the daughter of Col. John Dandridge of New Kent Co.,VA and Frances Jones.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #1 - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 335
2 CONT She married Daniel Parke Custis in 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - Ibid
2 CONT Mrs. Martha (Dandridge) Custis, widow of Daniel Parke Custis, married George Washington 6 Jan 1759 probably at the White House in New Kent Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT She died at Mt. Vernon, Fairfax Co. VA 22 May 1802.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BURIAL - Ibid
2 CONT Buried in family crypt at Mt. Vernon, VA
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 91
2 CONT On May 1, 1761, Washington sent a letter to ....London merchants, informing them of his marriage to Mrs. Custis and directing them to address him thereafter in regard to any business they had with the estate of Mrs. Washington's l
2 CONC ate husband, Daniel Parke Custis; and at the same time he gave  them an order for a quantity of furniture, clothing, seeds and books on agriculture.
