1 NOTE He was a nephew of President George Washington.
1 NOTE !BIRTH - SOME PROMINENT VIRGINIA FAMILIES, VOL II by Louise duBellet, p. 629
2 CONT Lawrence Lewis, son of Fielding Lewis and his wife, Betty Washington was born 1767.  He lived on his estate, Woodlawn, near Mount Vernon.  He was the adopted son and executor of the will of General Washington.  
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Eleanor Parke Custis, daughter of Washington Parke Custis, adopted child of Mrs. Washington on February 22, 1799, Washington's birthday.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 199
2 CONT Lawrence Lewis died in 1839.
