1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Corbin Washington was born 1765 In Bushfield, Westmoreland, Virginia and died 10 Dec 1799 in Bushfield, Westmoreland, Virginia. Parents: John Augustine Washington (1736-1787) & Hannah Bushrod.
2 CONT
2 CONT * from [http://gwpapers.virginia.edu/documents/will/text.html The Will of George Washington, Mount Vernon, 9 July 1799] - "To Corbin Washington, and the heirs of Jane Washington, Son & daughter of my deceased brother John Augustin
2 CONC e Washington, I give & bequeath two parts; one part to each of them. [37]"
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 8 May 1787 in Chesterfield, Westmoreland, Virginia to Hannah Lee (1766-1802).  She was the daughter of Richard Henry LEE & Anne AYLETT.  They had 8 children.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT * 37. Corbin Washington had recently moved from his farm on the family place in Westmoreland County. He was living at Selby, Fairfax County, where Washington visited him in November 1799 (Diaries, 6:374)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: [http://www.familysearch.org/Eng/Search/af/family_group_record.asp?familyid=1636082&frompage=0 Corbin WASHINGTON (AFN:8MS5-F0)] FamilySearch™ Ancestral File v4.19.
2 CONT
2 CONT Link: [http://www.politicalfamilytree.com/samples%20content/members/PDF%20Content/Washington-VA-2.pdf Partial Genealogy of the Washingtons Part ll (of Virginia and Maryland)] PDF file.
2 CONT
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial # 50942373.
