2 CONC (Oct. 1903) p.97-98. (b) "Virginia Heraldica." (c) Tishomingo Co. Records. 
2 CONT *(3) "Virginia Marriage Records from the Virginia Magazine of History and Biography, the William and Mary College Quarterly, and Tyler's Quarterly" (Baltimore: Genealogical Pub. Co., 1984; rpt. FTM CD 174, 1998), "Marriage Bonds i
2 CONC n Lancaster County," p.289, 295-296.
2 CONT **Birth: (1) Abt 1682. (2b,c) s/o John CHICHESTER/Elizabeth SYMES. 5 Mar 1656/7. England.
2 CONT **Marriage to __ __: (2) Came to VA in 1702 with son John.
2 CONT **Marriage to Ann CHINN: (1,3) Widow of William FOX. (1) 11 Jun 1729. (1,2) Lancaster Co., VA. (2a,3) Ann, widow of Wm. FOX, gent. 11 Jul 1719. Security, Jo. (p.295) or James (p.289) CHICHESTER. Wits. Rawleigh CHINN, Wm PAYNE. Fin
2 CONC e seal of arms opposite to Richd. CHICHESTER's name. Death: (2) 1726. VA.
2 CONT **(2) 1702: Came to VA, bringing with him his son John.
