2 CONT
2 CONT When Richard Bushrod was born on 10 February 1690, in Northumberland, Virginia, British Colonial America, his father, Thomas Bushrod, was 18 and his mother, Anne Reynolds, was 20. He married Elizabeth Kenner in 1708, in Northumber
2 CONC land, Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son. He died in 1710, in Northumberland, Northumberland, Pennsylvania, United States, at the age of 20, and was buried in Virginia, British Colonial America.
