2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT : PAUL CUSTER (2) , farmer, son of Hermanus and Isabella (Conrad) Kuster or Custer, was born in Montgomery County, Pa. about the year 1710. He married Sarah Martha Ball , daughter of John Ball [ of Virginia ? ]about the year 1730.
2 CONC .. : Their children were:
2 CONT # John Custer, born 1732, died in infancy;
2 CONT # JONATHAN CUSTER (i), born 1734;
2 CONT # PAUL CUSTER (3), born about 1736...;
2 CONT # William Custer (i), bom about 1740;
2 CONT # GEORGE CUSTER (i G.), born Dec. 3, 1744; and
2 CONT # Nicholas Custer (1) , born probably about the year 1746. : PAUL CUSTER (2) died in Montgomery County, Pa. Nov. 10, 1783. Sarah Martha (Ball) Custer, his wife, died Dec. 10, 1779.<ref name=Milo>MiloCuster. [https://archive.org/de
2 CONC tails/custerfamilies00cust ''The Custer Families'']. Published in Bloomington, Illinois (1912).</ref>
2 CONT
