2 CONT Following info is from "Ball Cousins" by Margaret B. Kinsey. Lamesa, Texas, c. 1980
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Richards was baptised at the same time as her two sisters and a brother at St Gabriel's Church, Douglasville, Pa. 20 Sept 1737. She is mentioned as the oldest daughter of William and Elizabeth Richards, born abt 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Richards and John Ball
2 CONT # John
2 CONT # Elizabeth
2 CONT # Samuel
2 CONT # Joseph (1752-1821)(Book is abt his estate & heirs)Joseph Ball married Sarah Lee, dau of Margaret Brazure and stepdaughter of Richard Westcoat.
