1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4. William Ball, son of John Ball & Sarah Rhodes,  b. abt 1720, M Martha Brumfield b. 1725, dtr of Thomas Brumfield, Amity Twsp, (later became Berks Co.,PA)
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://genforum.genealogy.com/ball/messages/5955.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT William Ball, son of Samuel Ball and Ann Catherine Tayloe, was born in 1718 in Virginia. He married Martha Brumfield in 1741 in Bucks County, Pennsylvania. They had nine children during their marriage. He died on July 19, 1785, in
2 CONC  Fauquier County, Virginia, at the age of 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
