1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Greene (Rooke Greene1). She married John Church, son of John Church and Mary Tyrrell. He died 14 JAN 1565 in England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret Greene and John Church is:
2 CONT # Rocke Church was christened 9 APR 1564 in England.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From Simeon Church of Chester, Connecticut By Charles Washburn Church [https://archive.org/stream/simeonchurchofch1914chur#page/4/mode/2up page 4-5]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Church, son of Reynold and Margaret, was alderman and baileff of Maiden. He married ist Joan Henkyn; and 2d Mary, daughter of Edmund Tyrrell, a descendant of Walter who slew Wm. Rufus. He died Nov. 19, 1559. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His children were John and Edmund. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Margaret, daughter of Rooke Greene of Little Sampford, Co. Essex. He died Jan. 14, 1565. His son Rocke, bap. Apr. 9, 1564, was surveyor to King James. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
