2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Phereba-Paschall/6000000003153632684?through=6000000226510839821 is not the daughter of the JOHN WARD who died in Tyrrell County, North Carolina. That JOHN WARD did not list a daughter named PHEREBA in 
2 CONC his will. His will only listed two daughters, ELIZABETH and DORCAS. Also, the BIBLE record shows mother was MARY.
2 CONT
