2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth (Murray) Ward
2 CONT * Born before 18 Sep 1715 in Bertie, North Carolina 
2 CONT * Died 1790 at about age 74 in Tyrrell, North Carolina, United States 
2 CONT * Daughter of James Murray Sr. and Elizabeth (Edwards) Murray 
2 CONT * Sister of James Murray Jr, David Murray, Mary (Murray) Hollingsworth, Jesse Murray, Daniel Murray and Jonathan Murray
2 CONT * Wife of John Ward Sr. — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
