2 CONT : James Murray & Lydia Hughes-Pr. Wm County By Kim Murray March 27, 2002 at 12:49:06 In reply to: Re: James Murray & Lydia Hughes-Pr. Wm County Lynn Murray 3/27/02 Lynn, Here is some information that I have: James Murray Sr. b.169
2 CONC 0 (in Virginia) ISSUE:James Murray Jr. married to Lydia Hughes ISSUE: 1.Alice Murray b.1747 married to John Dishman Seaton 2.Ralph Murray b.1752 married May Pearl (THIS IS MY LINE) 3.John Murray b.1757 4.Reuben Murray b.1763 5.Lyd
2 CONC ia Murray
2 CONT
2 CONT Ralph Murray served in the Revolutionary War. He was with General George Washington in Dec. 1777 and Jan 1778 at Valley Forge.
2 CONT
