1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sugg-421
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Sugg was born about 1688 in Virginia. She was the daughter of George Sugg and his first wife Miss Ives.
2 CONT
2 CONT A deed dated July 20, 1696, and recorded in Deed Book 6 of Norfolk Co., VA, is signed by Timothy and Elizabeth (by marks), and grants 130 acres of land unto "my son-in-law George Sugg & his daughter, Margrett Sugg."[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret was first married to Benjamin Beck, son of Jeremiah Beck and Ann Morrow.
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Benjamin Beck, she married John Mercer and they had a daughter Rachel.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
2 CONT # Norfolk County, Virginia Deed Book #6.
2 CONT # See also: https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/m/u/l/Donna-T-Mullins/GENE8-0013.html#CHILD50725379
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
