2 CONT *2. Hanna Gaylord b. 30 Jan 1645/46 
2 CONT *3. John Gaylord b. 27 Jun 1648, d. 27 Apr 1699 
2 CONT *4. William Gaylord b. 25 Feb 1649/50, d. 1680 
2 CONT *5. Hezekiah Gaylord b. 11 Feb 1652, d. 12 Sep 1677 
