1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Hezekiah Gaylord=
2 CONT * BIRTH 11 Feb 1652 Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 12 Sep 1677 (aged 25) Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Palisado Cemetery Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * PLOT NO TOMBSTONE REMAINS MEMORIAL ID 54277907
2 CONT
2 CONT Windsor, Hartford, Co, Connecticut Vital Records 1638-1704 First Book Windsor Births Marriages and Deaths Item 2 Film 1316427 page 14.25 has "Hezekiah Gaylord, Son of William Gaylord was born Febr 11 1652"
2 CONT
2 CONT The grandson of William & Ann (Porter) Gaylord of Windsor, he was unmarried. In the will of William Gaylord proved Sept., 1673, to "Hezikiah Gaylord my grandson (who now lives with my son John) four rods breadth in the land over t
2 CONC he great river "that lieth next to the land I gave his father"; 
2 CONT
2 CONT A Digest of the Early conn. Probat Records, Manwaring, Vol. 1, p. 199:
2 CONT "Gaylord, Hezekiah, Windsor, who deceased 12 September, 1677.
2 CONT Invt. 109-14-06. Taken by Henry Wolcott, Jr., Joseph Elsworth.
2 CONT Legatees, the Brothers and Sisters, viz: John Gaylord, William Gaylord, Ann Phelps, Hannah Crandall, Joseph Gaylord & Nathaniel Gaylord, the two last be the Father only."
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT William Gaylord 1617–1656
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
