2 CONT Hannah Gaylord Crandall 1646–1678
2 CONT John Gaylord 1648–1699
2 CONT William Gaylord 1651–1680
2 CONT Josiah Gaylord 1654–1727
2 CONT Nathaniel Gaylord 1656–1720
2 CONT
