1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Tudor was the daughter of Owen & Mary (Loomis) Tudor and twin of Samuel. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married James Porter, son of John Porter, Jr. (d. 1688) and his wife Mary Stanley, on 15 Jan 1678/9 at Windsor, Connecticut. They were the parents of James, Mary, Isaac, Marion, Sarah and Ruth Porter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born at Windsor
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Family:James_Porter_and_Sarah_Tudor_%281%29
2 CONT
2 CONT
