2 CONT **	IV. Mehitable, born 1642; married Daniel Cone.
2 CONT **	V. Thomas, married Elizabeth Bates; removed to Westbrook before 1679.
2 CONT **	VI. Samuel.
2 CONT **	VII. William.
2 CONT **	VIII. Nathaniel.
2 CONT **	IX. Rebecca, married 1st John Kennard, of Haddam, about 1692; he died Feb. 1689; she married 2nd John Tanner, of Lyme, Conn.
2 CONT **	X. Ruth, married Joseph Clark
2 CONT **	XI. Timothy.
