2 CONC apt. John Allyn would be pleased to oversee that his Will. I appoint my two sons Daniel Brainard and William Spencer Adms. to the Estate."
2 CONT
2 CONT Witness: John James, JARRAD SPENCER
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Arnold
2 CONT
2 CONT Court Record, Page 111-3 September 1685: Adms. to Daniel Braynard and William Spencer, with the Will annexed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gerrard Spencer and Hannah Hills are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 . i. MEHITABEL14 SPENCER, b. 1638, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. 1691, East Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ii. JOHN (HADDAM FOUNDER) SPENCER, b. August 17, 1638, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. August 03, 1682, Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. iii. HANNAH SPENCER, b. 1641, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. 1691, Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. iv. ALICE (MARAH) SPENCER, b. 1642, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. December 22, 1714, Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. v. SARAH SPENCER, b. July 27, 1644, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. Aft 1707.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. vi. ELIZABETH SPENCER, b. 1646, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. August 1688, Saybrook, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. vii. SAMUEL SPENCER, b. 1648, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. August 07, 1705, East Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. viii. THOMAS SPENCER, b. 1650, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. February 03, 1698/99, Saybrook, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. ix. TIMOTHY SPENCER, b. 1652, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. May 06, 1704, Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. x. RUTH SPENCER, b. 1654, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. November 28, 1744, Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. xi. WILLIAM SPENCER, b. 1656, Haddam, Middlesex, CT; d. 1731, East Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. xii. NATHANIEL SPENCER, b. December 21, 1658, Lynn, Essex, MA; d. 1718, East Haddam, Middlesex, CT.
