1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HISTORY OF THE TOWN OF STONINGTON, County of New London, Connecticut, from its first settlement in 1649 to 1900, by Richard Anson Wheeler, New London, CT, 1900, p. 663
2 CONT ----
2 CONT EXPERIENCE PORTER (1676–1750) He was born in Hadley, Hampshire, Massachusetts, and died in Mansfield City, Tolland, Connecticut. He married Abigal Williams on 26 May 1698 in Roxbury (Boston). 
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT Experience Porter was the son of Samuel Porter Sr.
