1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sarah (Grant) Deming''' was born circa 1660 in Wethersfield, Connecticut Colony. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-48231878 Samuel Grant] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-19191801 Mary (Porter) Grant]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-49485986 Ebenezer Deming] on July 16, 1677 in Probably Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut Colony. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-39487661
2 CONC  Ebenezer Deming, Jr.]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-39487680 John Deming]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-39487683 Sarah (Deming) Talcott]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-39487685 Prudence (Deming) Wright]; [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rofile-39407688 Ephraim Deming]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-39487687 Josiah Deming]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 2, 1705 in Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut Colony. 
2 CONT ----
