2 CONC yoftownofs00whee_1#page/n489/mode/1up
2 CONT The Groton Avery Clan (Avery & Avery, 1912), p. 80, no. 3.v: https://archive.org/stream/grotonaveryclan01aver#page/80/mode/1up
2 CONT Profile History
2 CONT
