1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hannah Porter, daughter of Nathaniel Porter (ca Jul 1640-Jan 1679/80) & Hannah Groves. Born on 10 Apr 1665 in Stratford, CT.64 Hannah died in Stratford, CT, on 14 Feb 1738; she was 72.64
2 CONT
2 CONT Married  Zachariah Curtis.  Born on 14 Nov 1659 in Stratford, CT.64 Zachariah died in Stratford, CT, on 12 Jun 1748; he was 88.  He was the son of [http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr03/rr03_116.html#P40972 Capt. Willia
2 CONC m Curtis (1796) & Mary]  
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Zachariah and Hannah (Porter) Curtis, born at Stratford:
2 CONT *     i. Nathaniel Curtis, d. 1761, m. at Stratford 27 Nov 1712 Hannah Welles (b. ca. 1692 at Stratford, d. ca. 1761 at Hartford, dau. of John & Mary (Hollister) Welles);
2 CONT *     ii. Hannah Curtis, d. 1749;
2 CONT *     iii. Elizabeth Curtis, b. 1692, d. 22 May 1776 at Ripton, CT, m. Zachariah Beardsley (b. 13 Nov 1686 at Stratford, d. 1748);
2 CONT *     iv. Isaac Curtis, d. 1741, m. at Stratford 8 Sep 1726 Elizabeth Bostick;
2 CONT *     v. Jonathan Curtis, b. 1 Apr 1697;
2 CONT *     vi. Zachariah Curtis, twin, b. 1 Apr 1697, d. 18 Feb 1746 at Trumbull, CT, m. at Stratford 9 Jan 1722 Mary Mitchell (b. 27 Feb 1701, d. 3 jan 1745 at Trumbull, dau. of Daniel Mitchell); and
2 CONT *     vii. Jeremiah Curtis, bp. 26 may 1706, d. 31 Mar 1795 at Southington, CT, Rev., m. 1st at Stratford 7 Jan 1731 Hannah Burnham (b. 18 Nov 1708, d. 6 Apr 1772 at Southington, dau. of William & Hannah (Wolcott) Burnham), m. 2nd
2 CONC  at Southington 4 May 1774 Rachel Guernsey (d. 21 Oct 1794 at Southington).
2 CONT
