1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Langdon/6000000024508449941
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Porter. Born on 28 Feb 1677 in Stratford, CT.51 Mary died in Wallingford, CT, on 11 Mar 1759; she was 82
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: daughter of Nathaniel Porter (ca Jul 1640-Jan 1679/80) & Elizabeth Baldwin (ca 1649-6 Feb 1682/3), in Wallingford, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT On 2 Jun 1692 when Mary was 15, she married Dea. Robert Royce , son of Ens. Samuel Royce (2780) (ca 1638-24 Dec 1711) & Hannah Churchill  (1 Nov 1644-bef Jun 1690), in Wallingford, CT. Born on 29 Jan 1670 in New London, CT.51 Robe
2 CONC rt died in Wallingford, CT, on 2 Apr 1759; he was 89.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert and Mary (Porter) Royce, born at Wallingford:
2 CONT #     i. Nathaniel Royce, b. 21 Oct 1693, d. soon;
2 CONT #     ii. Nathaniel Royce, b. 22 Oct 1694;
2 CONT #     iii. Dinah Royce, b. 24 Feb 1696, d. 13 Apr 1732 at Stratford, m. there 11 Jun 1718 David Sherman;
2 CONT #     iv. Josiah Royce, b. 10 Jul 1698;
2 CONT #     v. Ruth Royce, b. Sep 1701;
2 CONT #     vi. Sarah Royce, b. Apr 1703, d. 5 Apr 1703;
2 CONT #     vii. Timothy Royce, b. 2 Jun 1705, d. 2 May 1737 at Wallingford, m. there 16 May 1727 Mindwell Waples (b. ca. 1707, d. 15 Oct 1748 at Wallingford, dau. of Ephraim & Mindwell Waples);
2 CONT #     viii. Mary Royce, b. Jul 1717, d. Sep 1799 at Wallingford, m. there 19 Jan 1732 John Austin;
2 CONT #     ix. Elizabeth Royce, b. Aug 1709;
2 CONT #     x. Gideon Royce, b. 4 May 1711;
2 CONT #     xi. Prudence Royce, b. 11 Apr 1714, d. 7 Feb 1756/7 at Wallngford, m. there 25 Apr 1733 Timothy Gaylord; and
2 CONT #     xii. Moses Royce, b. 24 Sep 1716, d. 26 Oct 1799 at Wallingford, Capt., m. 1st at Wallingford 6 Jan 1740 Thankful Austin (b. 10 Jul 1715 at Wallingford, d. there 26 Dec 1784, dau. of John & Prudence (Royce) Austin), m. 2nd 1
2 CONC 7 Nov 1785 Kezia (widow of Dr Isaac Lewis).51
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Porter was born at Stratford, Connecticut on February 28, 1675 and married Robert Royce on June 2, 1692. Mary's father was Nathaniel Porter of Windsor, Connecticut. In 1669, he was listed among the Freemen of Stratford. His f
2 CONC irst wife was Hannah, daughter of Philip Groves, and upon her death he married Elizabeth, her sister. (?)  He died in January 1680. Mary's grandfather, John Porter was born in 1590. He came from England about 1638. He received a l
2 CONC arge land grand and was Constable at Windsor, Connecticut, 1639; Deputy to the General Court, 1639 et seq. In 1620, he married Anna White of England, He died, 1648.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
