2 CONT LIEUTENANT JOHN COLEMAN, JR 1669-1746
2 CONT
2 CONT King Phillips War
2 CONT
2 CONT John Coleman, JR was born on the 11th of April 1669 in Hatfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts, the son of Deacon John Coleman, SR 1635-1711 and his wife, Hannah PORTER 1642-1677. John's Father was married 3 times.
