1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was taken captive by Indians Sept 19 1677 and brought back by Wait and Jennings 1678.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Coleman only 4 years old, was taken by the Indians in the raid. When she was found, she was wearing a shoe which is now in a museum. Sarah Coleman’s 5 ¼” long shoe is in Memorial Hall Museum online http://www.memorialhall.ma
2 CONC ss.edu/collection/browse/results.jsp?subcategoryid=35
