2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Coleman and Hannah (Porter) Coleman
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Thomas Coleman, Hannah (Coleman) Nash, John Coleman, Noah Coleman, Berthia Coleman, Ebenezer Coleman [half] and Nathaniel Coleman [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Field II — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
