1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sappharia* (Sophia) RICHARDSON37 was born on 2 Jul 1680 in Anne Arundel, Maryland. She died after 21 Aug 1703 in Anne Arundel, Maryland. She a 4th g grandaunt of Althea Current.
2 CONT
2 CONT > Sopphira and Elizabeth Richardson daus of William & Eliza of A.A. Co. b. 2nd day of 5th mo. 1680, 2 or 3 hours with night. Sophia being first born
2 CONT
2 CONT Sappharia* (Sophia) RICHARDSON and Thomas SPARROW , Pirate were married on 28 Nov 1698 in All Hallows Church, Anne Arundel, Maryland. Thomas SPARROW , Pirate38,39,40 (son of Thomas SPARROW , Constable and Elizabeth (Eliza) KINSEY)
2 CONC  was born about 1672 in All Hallows Parish, South River Hundred, Anne Arundel, Maryland. He died before 12 May 1719 in All Hallows Parish, South River Hundred, Anne Arundel, Maryland. He a 4th g granduncle of Althea Current.
2 CONT
2 CONT > Thomas Sparrow (of Thomas and Sofia late of All Hallows Parish) and Sofia Richardson (of William and Elizabeth) m. 28 Nov 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were Thomas Sparrow (1699-1753) & Solomon Sparrow (1701-1742)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
