1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LYXS-8NS/william-underwood-iii-1649-1718
2 CONT
2 CONT William Underwood III
2 CONT January 1649–19 July 1718 
2 CONT
2 CONT When William Underwood III was born in January 1649, in Rushmere, Isle of Wight, Virginia, British Colonial America, his father, Col William Underwood Jr, was 24 and his mother, Mary Elizabeth Moseley, was 20. He married Mary Butl
2 CONC er before 1672. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 19 July 1718, in Lambs Creek, King George, Virginia, British Colonial America, at the age of 69.
