2 CONC  5 Jun 1663.
2 CONT
2 CONT From "Virginia Biographies, Vol 1 & 2, pg 206 he was the presiding Justice in Rappahannock County, VA in 1665.
2 CONT
2 CONT From "Virginia Biographies, Vol 1 & 2, pg 206 he was killed by the Indians while defending the fort at Port Royal about 1670. He left a son of the same name.
