1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Brooke married Catherine BOOTH , daughter of Captain Humphrey BOOTH Of Rappahannock and Margaret UNDERWOOD , on 19 Jun 1689 in Essex Co., Virginia. Catherine was born about 1664 in Old Rappahannock, Virginia
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary BROOKE was born in Essex Co., Virginia and died on 28 Nov 1748 in Essex Co., Virginia. 
2 CONT # Robert II BROOKE "The Knight" was born about 1700 in "Farmer's Hall" Essex County, Virginia and died about 1744 in Virginia, about age 44. 
2 CONT # Humphrey BROOKE Sr. was born about 1701 in Essex Co., Virginia and died on 14 Oct 1738 in King William Co. VA, about age 37. 
2 CONT # William "The Elder" BROOKE was born about 1702 in Essex Co., Virginia and died in 1734 in Died In A Naval Battle, about age 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT * 1685 Sept 4 Catherine had been placed in the care of Mrs. Martha Moseley wife of Capt. William Moseley since his(father) decease. (1676-82, 172). (Wm. &ary Quarterly, Jan 1903,p.210) Catherine was put in possession of half of he
2 CONC r father's estate 4 sep 1685, having come of age and on 19 Jun joined in a deed with her brother Humphrey Booth. 
2 CONT * Marriage Notes: (Wm. & M Quarterly, Jan 1903, p. 210). Database: Essex County, Virginia Marriages, 1655-1900 : 1689,: BOOTH, : CATHARINE : Daughter of Humphrey Booth, married Robert Brooke
2 CONT
2 CONT Book: D 8, Page: 49.  Index to Marriages of Old Rappahannock and Essex Counties, Virginia page 24
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT * Genealogies of VA Families, Vol. 1 Brooke Family of VA, p. 506. 1689 Index to Marriages of Old Rappahannock and Essex Counties, Virginia page 24: 1689,: BOOTH, CATHARINE; Daughter of Humphrey, married Robert Brooke Book: D 8, Pa
2 CONC ge: 4
2 CONT * (1) Carolyn Tayloe Davidson Carey, Greenwood Village, CO. Cites: (a) "VA Hist. Magazine," VXIII, p.325-326. (b) "William & Mary Quarterly," Jan 1903, p.210. (c) Robert Brooke's Will, Bk 7, p.265.
2 CONT * ! Birth: (1) 1664, VA, d/o Humphrey Booth/Margaret Underwood.
2 CONT
