1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''This Ann's supposed birth surname of Allen, birth in Middlesex and death in Essex suggest that she is a member of the family that is charted on Stirnet's "Allen03" page; however, that page does not seem to mention this Ann.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==changes to be made by curator==
2 CONT * Title: '''Lady?
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Given name has also been reported to be '''Anna'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1567 at London, Middlesex (now Greater London), England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be circa 1620 in Caernarvonshire, Wales, Kingdom of England and Scotland (later Kingdom of Great Britain, now United Kingdom).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&dbid=5917&h=138010&ssrc=pt&tid=23317812&pid=26018693359&usePUB=true Text: Robert Williamson & Ann Allen 14 Oct 1596 Book:	Marriages at Wollaton, 1576 to 1812. (Marriage) Collecti
2 CONC on:	Nottinghamshire: - Register of Marriages, 1576-1812.  A different couple based on date & location.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/23317812/person/26018693359/facts is a source for parents of https://www.geni.com/people/Richard-Alleyne/6000000007299660638 & https://www.geni.com/people/Lucy-Allen/600000003649362
2 CONC 3466 Locations inconsistent with other reports.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
