1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://members.cox.net/garyrea/pafg299.htm#6816 (source)
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert WILLIAMSON was born in 1658 in Wight, Mecklenburg County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 Apr 1726 in Middlesex, Accomack County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Robert WILLIAMSON and Joan ALLEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Catherine LEWIS. Robert WILLIAMSON and Katherine LEWIS were married on 27 Feb 1681 in Middlesex, Accomack County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: Margaret Mary WILLIAMSON.
2 CONT
