2 CONT # Daniel Carter citing ''The Descendants of Capt. Thomas Carter of "Barford," Lancaster County, Virginia: with genealogical notes of many of the allied families.'' < [https://archive.org/stream/descendantsofcap00byumill#page/210/m
2 CONC ode/2up Archive.Org] > misidentified wife Elizabeth as daughter of William Pannil.  More recent research suggests her father was William’s brother, Thomas Pannil.  
2 CONT # ''The William and Mary Quarterly'', Vol. 16, No. 4, p. 290. http://www.jstor.org/stable/1922669
2 CONT # https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/carter/18712/
