2 GIVN John
2 SURN Shelton
2 _MARNM Shelton
2 NICK John
2 NICK John Skelton
2 NICK John Shelton
2 NICK Chilton
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1649
2 ADDR
3 CITY Currioman
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY Colonial America
1 DEAT
2 DATE 15 NOV 1706
