1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Shelton was born Abt 1649 in Currioman, Westmoreland, Virginia, and died 15 Nov 1706 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===family===
2 CONT
2 CONT from  http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=norvan&id=I19537
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of 4. James Shelton and 5. Mary Jane Bathurst.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Jane, she was  born Abt 1650 in York, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jane and John Shelton are:
2 CONT # John Shelton was born 1666 in Virginia, America, and died 1726. He married Lettice Hall.
2 CONT # Thomas Shelton was born 1668, and died 1738. He married Winifred King.
2 CONT # Mary Shelton was born 1669. She married John Sharp.
2 CONT # Sarah Shelton was born 1672 in Virginia, America. She married Richard Gissage. He was born Abt 1670.
2 CONT # William Shelton was born 1676 in Westmoreland County, Virginia, and died 1734 in York County, Virginia. He married Hannah Armistead Abt 10 Dec 1698 in Elizabeth Co., Va, daughter of Anthony Armistead and Hannah Ellison. She was 
2 CONC born 1674 in Elizabeth, York, Virginia, and died Abt 1748. He married Katherine Nutting, daughter of Thomas Nutting and Elizabeth Booth. She was born Abt 1680.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Shelton was born 1678. She married Bryan Graves.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Built Rural Plains in what is now Hanover County, VA
