1 NOTE !MAR - VIRGINIA MARRIAGE RECORDS indexed by Elizabeth Petty Bentley - MARRIAGE BONDS IN LANCASTER CO., P. 300
2 CONT 20 Jan 1746, George Heale and Miss Sarah Smith.  Consent of Jos. Chinn and Priscilla Chinn.  Witnesses:  Jesse Ball, Richard Selden.
2 CONT Note:  George Heale's mother evidently married Joseph Chinn after death of William Heale, her 1st husband. - JMC
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLIAM & MARY QUARTERLY, p. 298
2 CONT George Heale (son of William) married Sarah Smith, daughter of Philip Smith of Northumberland, who was son of Capt. John Smith of Purton and Mary Mathews, his wife, great granddaughter of Governor Samuel Mathews.  He was a member 
2 CONC of the House of Burgesses in 1759 from Lancaster but later moved to Fauquier Co. where he made his will which was proved July 28, 1806.
2 CONT
2 CONT ABSTRACTS LANCASTER CO., VA WILLS 1653-1800 compiled by Ida J. Lee, p. 112
2 CONT Will of John Heale leaves to George Heale, son of my brother, William Heale, dec'd.  Also George Heale is made one of the executors.
