1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Lettice Weeks
2 CONT * Gender:	Female
2 CONT * Birth:	circa 1670  Middlesex, Virginia
2 CONT * Death:	1704 (29-38)  Christ Church Parish, Middlesex, Virginia:	
2 CONT * Daughter of Abraham Weekes, of Weekes Farm and Millicent (unknown)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT * She was named daughter Lettice Lidford in her father's 1691 will. Her husband, Mr. Matthew Lidford, was one of the executors of the will. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # Matthew Lifford b: 1663 on 6 JAN 1691/1692 in Christ Church Par., Middlesex Co., VA 1
2 CONT # William Montague , Sr. b: ABT 1670 in Middlesex Co., VA AFT 1692 in Rappahannock Co., VA 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Thomas Montague b: BEF 1691
2 CONT # Abraham Montague b: 28 SEP 1701 in Christ Church Par., Middlesex Co., VA
2 CONT #  William Montague b: 1707 in Rappahannock Co., VA
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Lettice Weekes was born about 1672 in Christ Church Parish, Middlesex County, Virginia, a daughter of Abraham Weekes and Millicent ______.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married
2 CONT (1) Matthew Lidford on 6 January 1691/92 and
2 CONT (2) William Montague about 1694.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Lettice (Weekes) Montague died about 1707 (between 23 February 1704 and 10 May 1710).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
