1 NAME John /Rogers/ Privateer
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Rogers
2 NSFX Privateer
2 _MARNM Rogers
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Cyprus Farm
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1620
2 PLAC England or, James City, Virginia
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 21 JUL 1680
2 PLAC Lewisetta, Northumberland, Virginia
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Captain; justice and Sheriff of Northumberland County
1 TITL Capt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Captain Rogers was a privateer
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=moseleymiller2&id=P4348
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt John ROGERS was born about 1620 in England or Virginia, and died before July 1680 in Northumberland Co Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 
2 CONT #Ellen UNKNOWN before 1650 in probably Northumberland Co Virginia. She was born about 1620 in England or Virginia, and died before 1668 in Northumberland Co Virginia.
2 CONT # Anne Widow CLAY before Sept 1668 in Northumberland Co Virginia. She was born about 1620 in England or Virginia, and died in Northumberland Co Virgini
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Capt John ROGERS and Ellen UNKNOWN are:
2 CONT *i.	Elizabeth ROGERS was born about 1643 in Northumberland Co Virginia, and died July 1720 in Northumberland Co Virginia. She married William KEENE before Sept 11, 1665 in Northumberland Co Virginia. He was born March 10, 1642 in 
2 CONC Kent, England, and died before 1687 in Northumberland Co Virginia. She married Thomas BANKS Dec 8, 1687 in Northumberland Co Virginia. He was born 1642 in Woodstock, Wiltshire, England, and died in Northumberland Co Virginia.
2 CONT *  ii.	Katherine ROGERS was born about 1645 in Northumberland Co Virginia.
2 CONT *  iii.	Ellen ROGERS was born about 1652 in Northumberland Co Virginia, and died before Dec 1710 in St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster Co Virginia. She married George HEALE about 1677 in Northumberland or Lancaster Co Virgin
2 CONC ia. He was born about 1650 in Virginia, and died before Jan 1698 in St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster Co Virginia.
2 CONT * iv.	William ROGERS I was born about 1655 in Northumberland Co Virginia, and died April 14, 1714 in St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster Co Virginia.
2 CONT * v.	Richard ROGERS was born about 1660 in Northumberland Co Virginia. He married Jane PRESLEY before Aug 18, 1697 in Northumberland Co Virginia, daughter of Peter PRESLEY. She was born June 29, 1664 in Northumberland Co Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Capt John ROGERS and Anne Widow CLAY is:
2 CONT *  i.	Noah ROGERS was born after 1668 in Northumberland Co Virginia, and died before July 10, 1717 in Lancaster Co Virginia. He married Elizabeth HARVEY before Dec 14, 1693 in Lancaster Co Virginia. She was born in Northumberland 
2 CONC or Lancaster Co Virginia.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *Married Well and Often: Marriages of the Northern Neck of Virginia 1649-1800 Note:  Page: p 302
