1 NOTE !MAR #1 - ABSTRACTS LANCASTER CO., VA WILLS 1653-1800 by Ida J. Lee, p. 112
2 CONT HEALE, Joseph   1 July 1740   Rec. 9 Oct 1741
2 CONT Names wife, Hannah.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - LANCASTER CO., VA MARRIAGE BONDS 1652-1850 by Ida J. Lee, p. 15
2 CONT Crump, Adam of Prince Wm. Co. to Hannah Heale, wid. - 6 Aug. 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT !ABSTRACTS LANCASTER CO., VA. WILLS 1653-1800 by Ida J. Lee, p. 60
2 CONT CRUMP, Adam Will 8 Sept 1748    Rec. 16 March 1753
2 CONT CRUMP, Adam lists 2 sons by last wife, John Bushrod and James Crump and daughter by laast wife, Hannah Bushrod Crump and wife Hannah Crump.
2 CONT Note:  I think this use of Bushrod in name of 2 children almost verifies that mother must have been Hannah Bushrod Heale Crump.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT She must have died after 1753 as she was still alive when will was recorded.
