2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Peachey (1699-1750) was married three times:
2 CONT # Katherine McCarty, daughter of Captain Daniel McCarty (1 child, Elizabeth)
2 CONT # Winifred Griffin, daughter of Thomas Griffin and Elizabeth Medstand Lee (4 sons: William Griffin, Samuel jr, Thomas Griffin, Leroy, and 2 daughters: (NN) Flood and (NN) Eustace.)
2 CONT # Judith Steptoe Lee, widow of Richard Lee of Ditchley (no children)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
