2 CONT 1653-1800 Lancaster County, Virginia Wills [Ida J. Lee];
2 CONT CHICHESTER, John. Will. 14 Sept. 1753. Rec. 15 March 1754. Wife Jean, plantation I now live on. Dau. Mary Chichester; brother Richard Chichester, four sisters, Elizabeth, Ellen, Mary and Hannah. Brother Rawleigh Downman; Miss Eliz
2 CONC abeth Griffin. Extrs. James Ball, Jr., Richd. Chichester. No witnesses. W.B. 15, Page 168.
