2 CONT # https://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I42335&tree=Tree1
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Chichester was born bef 14 Sep 1753 Lancaster County, Virginia. Her parents were John Chichester abt 1735 - bef 1754 and Jean Smith 
2 CONT Marriage to Col. Burgess Ball 2 July 1770 St. James :Northam, Goochland County, Virginia. Col Ball married 2nd Frances Washington Apr 7 1781.
2 CONT Children with Col Burgess Ball:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Burgess Ball
2 CONT Burgess Ball, Jr. b Oct 26 1773
2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile was initially created with spouse as Cornelius Leport (abt.1765-) and daughter Melinda Leport Lowell (1798-1877). Both have been removed
2 CONT
