4 CONC y own (our correspondence documented as well) so I would not want to be credited for what he did - I just included his work with mine in onto my GED and research per his requests/permission. Thank you for understanding..
4 CONT
4 CONT If he was still with us I am sure he would want me to clarify.
4 CONT
