3 NOTE Transcription of original text (scroll down) of deposition of "Richard Lee of London, gentleman", aged 34 years or thereabouts, pertaining to suit brought by William Morton against John Spencer in 1654. Date of deposition, 5 Septe
4 CONC mber 1654.
4 CONT
4 CONT "34 years or thereabouts" could mean as much as five years older or three years younger (age range 31-39). *Probably* not 40 or older, nor younger than 30. But it's by no means an exact figure.
