2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT Francis was born about 1648. He is the son of [[Lee-318|Richard Lee]] and [[Constable-322|Anne Constable]].  He passed away about 1714.   Francis, the third born child, became the family's factor in London.<ref>Entered by Jeff Ken
2 CONC ner, Jun 20, 2012</ref>
