2 CONT ********************* : William Lee Leigh 1 Sex: M Birth: ABT 1588 in England Death: 1653 in , James, VirginiaMarriage 1 Mary Dawkes  b: ABT 1578 in < , Charles City County, Virginia> Marriage 2 Catherine  b: ABT 1592 Children Wil
2 CONC liam COLONEL Lee Leigh  b: 1654 in Surry County, , Virginia Sources:
