2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Anne was born in 1650. 1653 or 1654, depending on the source you use. She was the daughter of [[Lee-7597|Richard Lee]] and [[Constable-521|Anne Constable]].  She passed away around 1701.  Anne, married Captain Thomas Youell, with 
2 CONC whom she had at least three daughters that survived to adulthood, married, and had children of their own. The surnames of Anne Lee Youell’s sons-in-law were English, Watts, and Spence. Starting with the daughters the spelling of t
2 CONC he last name was changed to Ewell, in many cases
