3 TEXT Land owned by William Lee and wife Alice that Richard Henry Lee (Wm's brother and uncle to Wm's children) went to court and took back inheritance.  Court ordered after boys took uncle back to court and were granted the land Willia
4 CONC m Lee had acquired outside of inheritance from grandfather.  Land records show property adjacent to prior Felton land - see Virginia County land division and renaming during this period to understand the connection. Jacqueli Finle
4 CONC y
