2 CONT Hancock I LEE was born in 1650/1653 in Of, Northumberland, W. Moreland, Va. He was christened in 1677 in Of, Ditchley, Northampton, Va. He died on 25 May 1709 in Ditchley, Northumberland, Virginia. He was buried on 20 Oct 1709 in 
2 CONC Ditchley, Northumberland, Virginia.
2 CONT
