1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The seven known children of William Keene Sr. and Elizabeth "Eliza" Rogers were: 
2 CONT *''' William Keene Jr''' . was born on September 11, 1665 at St Stephen's Parish, Northumberland, VA. He married Ann Therriatt. She was the daughter of William Therriatt of St. Maryâ€™s White Chapel Lancaster County VA. He remarri
2 CONC ed an unknown person in 1690. He died on October 4, 1700 at St. Stephens Parish, Northumberland, Virginia, at age 35. 
2 CONT * Female Keene was born circa 1667 at Kent,, Maryland. She married an unknown person in 1688 at Westmoreland, Virginia. She married an unknown person circa 1722 at Westmoreland, Virginia. She died in May 1739 in Cople Parish, West
2 CONC moreland, Virginia 
2 CONT * Elizabeth Keene was born on 16 May 1669 in St Stephen's Parish, Northumberland, VA. She married Samuel Samford on 26 March 1689. She died before 1720. 
2 CONT * Hon John Keene, was born 12 August 1671 in St Stephen's Parish, Northumberland, VA; married Elizabeth Oliver. 
2 CONT * Hannah Keene was born on 4 February 1676 in St Stephen's Parish, Northumberland, VA. She married first, Gent Capt John Bushrod, second Col. Willoughby Allerton, and third, John Cooper. She died in 1739 at Cople Parish, Westmorel
2 CONC and, VA. 
2 CONT * Sarah Keene was born on 7 October 1678 at St Stephen's Parish, Northumberland, VA. She married Capt John Woodbridge in 1705. 
2 CONT * Anne Keene was born in 1680 at Northumberland, Virginia.
2 CONT
