2 CONC ve.org/details/garnerkeenefamil00ritc/page/203/mode/1up Archive.Org]>
2 CONT *Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com : accessed 06 August 2020), memorial page for Elizabeth Ann Keene Scrosby (2 May 1701–16 Mar 1759), Find A Grave: Memorial #108301517, citing Cobbs Hall Burying Ground
2 CONC , Northumberland County, Virginia, USA ; Maintained by GPs (contributor 47100504) .
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/108301517/elizabeth-ann-scrosby
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/108301541/thomas-lee
