2 CONT * deced 15th February 1732 (1733) .. items valued and totalled, 302.13.2
2 CONT * .. includes two negro men; an old negro woman, a woman named Sarah and
2 CONT * children; one sea chest .. made by. appraisers JOS. STROTHER~ SAML.
2 CONT * SKINKER, T. TURNER ..
2 CONT * At a court held 6th April 1733 .• inventory presented into court and
2 CONT * admitted to record.
2 CONT * ELIZABETH GIBSON of county of King George made her will on 14th November 1732. Presented into court by her son (Executor) JONATHAN
2 CONT * GIBSON 2nd February 1732 (1733) and admitted to record.
