1 NOTE  Six children, youngest being Nelly Conway, mother of President James
2 CONT Madison.  Two of Nelly Conway's sisters married into the Taylor family
2 CONT of
2 CONT Orange County, VA, and her brother Francis II seeems to have been a
2 CONT particular friends of James Madison, Sr.  Two sons of Francis II,
2 CONT Francis
2 CONT III (1749-1794), and Catlett (1751-1827) were childhood playmates of
2 CONT President Madisons's and remained his intimate friends as long as each
2 CONT lived.
