1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	unknown
2 CONT Death: 	Oct. 28, 1689 Middlesex County Virginia, USA
2 CONT Father: Edwin Conway, Sr. 
2 CONT Mother: Martha Eltonhead
2 CONT Sister of Edwin Conway, Gent., of Lancaster
2 CONT Wife of Henry Chichley Thacker, Capt. and William Stanard, Jr.
2 CONT Mother of Henry Thacker, II; Edward Thacker, Sr.; Martha Hickman; Alice Conway Goff; Frances Thacker; Lettice Thacker; Chicheley Corbin Thacker;  Elizabeth Ferrell; Sarah Yates (Standard) and William Stanard.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * “Conway Family.” The William and Mary Quarterly, vol. 12, no. 4, 1904, pp. 264–267. [http://www.jstor.org/stable/1915587 JSTOR]
2 CONT *”A Genealogy of the Glassell Family of Scotland and Virginia : Also of the Families of Ball, Brown, Bryan, Conway, Daniel, Ewell, Holladay, Lewis, Littlepage, Moncure, Peyton, Robinson, Scott, Taylor, Wallace, and Others, of Virg
2 CONC inia and Maryland.” Horace Edwin Hayden E.B. Yordy, printer, 1891 - Virginia - 759 pages.  Page 231: [https://books.google.com/books?id=SJcsAAAAYAAJ&vq=Conway&pg=PA231#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Mother of Henry Thacker, II; Edward Thacker, Sr.; Martha Hickman; Alice Conway Goff; Frances Thacker; Lettice Thacker; Chicheley Corbin Thacker; Mary Chambers Bibb; Elizabeth Ferrell; 
2 CONT
2 CONT I. Henry THACKER, B. 19th August, 1663; d. before 1714; m. Elizabeth, surname unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Edwin THACKER, B. 7th January, 1665; d.  16th February, 1719; m. Frances, surname unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Martha THACKER, b. 5th December, 1667; m. 18th December, 1683, Thomas HICKMAN.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Lettice TRACKER, b. 24th February, 1669.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Alice TRACKER, b. 30th December, 1671; m. 31st May, 1688, William GOUGH.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Chickley Corbin THACKER, b. 4th January, 1673.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with William Stanard:
2 CONT 1. Sarah Yates (Standard) and 2. William Stanard.
