1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT '''Martha Taylor''', born about 1702 at Lancaster County, and died there before 21 Mar 1776, when her Will was probated.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Thomas Taylor (d. bef 11 June 1718)  and his wife Elizabeth Therriott.  
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Wiliam Miller (b abt 1695 - d 13 May 1719, Lancaster County, Virginia - probate) on 10 Dec 1718.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1653-1800 Lancaster County, Virginia Wills [Ida J. Lee];
2 CONT * MILLER, Martha, widow "being old." 22 Apr. 1774. Rec. 21 Mar. 1776.
2 CONT * Nephew: John Taylor, son of my Brother Thomas Taylor.
2 CONT * Cousin: Martha Ball, dau of Capt. Geo. Ball, Frankie Carter, dau of Dale Carter.
2 CONT * Nephew: Thomas Ball. Sarah Ball, dau of Capt. Geo. Ball, Elizabeth Portes Ball, dau of my nephew Thomas Ball.
2 CONT * Sister: Anna Ball.
2 CONT * Nephew: David Ball.
2 CONT * Cousins: Sarah Ball & Martha Taylor.
2 CONT * Overseer: Benj. Willis. "To old Jenny her bed" and 1 cow.
2 CONT * "To my nephew John Taylor my blind Boy Adam and the Care of old Patrick as a Freeman." Nephew: David Ball, Jr.
2 CONT * Exors: David Ball, Jr. & John Taylor.
2 CONT * Wits: Joseph Williams, Margaret Ball, Sarah Jones. W.B. 20, p. 94.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * MILLER, Martha, dec'd. 21 Mar. 1776. Rec. 19 Aug. 1784.
2 CONT * Inventory. Wm. Montague, Richard Ball, Edwin Conway. W.B. 22, p. 38.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1653-1800 Lancaster County, Virginia Wills [Ida J. Lee];
2 CONT * TAYLOR, Thomas. 7 Feb. 1718. Rec. 11 June 1718.
2 CONT * Wife's name not given.
2 CONT * Sons: Thomas, plantation in Wiccocomoco Psh, and Theriatt Taylor.
2 CONT * Daus: Martha, Elizabeth, Ann and Sarah.
2 CONT * Wits: Rich. Cundiff Jr. and Rich. Ball. W.B. 10, p. 265.
2 CONT
2 CONT
