2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From Lee, Edmund Jennings. ''Lee of Virginia, 1642-1892 : biographical and genealogical sketches of the descendants of Col. Richard Lee.''  Page 566-567.  < [https://archive.org/details/leeofvirginia16400inleee/page/1215/mode/2up 
2 CONC Archive.Org] >
2 CONT
2 CONT Apparently, Charles Lee (d. 1747) had two children by each wife, as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT * i. Ann5, “the daughter of Charles and Mary Lee, was born ye 24th June, 1742.”
2 CONT * ii. Charles5, See 9.
2 CONT * iii, Thomas5, was the son by the second wife, and was probably born about 1745 ; he died before the date of his mother's will, 24th of June, 1761.
2 CONT * iv, __, born after the date of his father's will, 30th December, 1746; as the second wife left no surviving child, he probably died young.
