1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/74061446/elizabeth_burgess_long
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Ball was the oldest daughter of Colonel Burgess Ball. Born in 1772, she was the daughter of his first wife, Mary Chichester. Elizabeth married Colonel Armistead Long, 22 June 1793. "MARRIED – In Fredericksburg on Saturda
2 CONC y, Mr. Armistead Long to Miss Betsey Ball, daughter of Col. Burges(s) Ball." After marriage they lived Culpeper and Loudoun counties.
2 CONT
2 CONT Two of her children are in the same grave with her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Armistead Long, b. 28 Jan, 1801, d. 14 Dec, 1875. He and his wife, Calista Rosser Cralle, were the parents of Armistead Lindsay Long #11017. [Source: Find a Grave member Krista AQ Thompson (#46948224)]
