1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 116
2 CONT Fayette Ball was born 23 Aug. 1791 in Loudoun Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #1 - Ibid, p. 132
2 CONT He married 1st Frances Williams, dau. of Maj. Gen. James Williams, Orange Co.,VA. who was Capt.. VA. Line, 1775-1781 and Maj. Gen. commanding VA. Militia, 1812. d.s.p.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - Ibid
2 CONT He married 2nd Oct. 6, 1819, Mary Thomson Mason.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Ball was named by General Washington, his godfather, after his Excellency's friend, Gen. LaFayette.  He served in the war of 1812 as Corporal under brother, Capt. G. W. Ball.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died May 8, 1835.
2 CONT
