2 CONT
2 CONT Ballentine lives and that whereon Jane Widow of my Son John Ballentine
2 CONT
2 CONT lives to him and his Heirs or assigns for Ever
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM I give and bequeath unto my Daughter Susanna Ballentine my
2 CONT
