2 CONT
2 CONT dies without Heirs to be divided among my other Children
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM I give unto my Grandson John Ballentine a Heifer yearling
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM I haveing given to my Daughters Mary and Eliza Creekmur a Cow
2 CONT
2 CONT and Calf in my lifetime in respect of my Will
2 CONT
2 CONT Item my Will and Desire is that all the rest of my Estate within
2 CONT
2 CONT and without be Equally Divided among my Children after my decease. In
2 CONT
