1 NOTE {geni:about_me} daughter of Capt Alexander Swann.  Probably 2nd wife of Maurice Jones, youngest son of Robert Jones of Fleet's Bay & his wife Martha.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From  https://archive.org/stream/jstor-1915269/1915269#page/n5/mode/2up William and Mary Quarterly 269
2 CONT
2 CONT From the records the children of Capt. Morris Jones probably were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 15 Chas., b. before 1700, d. 1759 m., first, Elizabeth (possibly Lee), second, Mary Lampkin, widow of Theo (?) Lampkin, six children. [son of Maurice's 1st wife ?]
2 CONT
2 CONT 16 Swann, b. after 1700, d. before 1742, m. Elizabeth, who m., second, Zachary Taylor of Orange Co. Child, John Jones.
2 CONT
2 CONT 17 Betty, m. Smith, before 1721.
2 CONT
2 CONT 18 Judith, b. 171 m. Spencer Ball; children: (a) Judith b. 1730, died April 30 1759; m. Jan 17, 1750 John Cralle. (b) Mattrom (c) Betty m William Roane, had Spencer & Thomas (d) William. For further account see Hayden's Genealogie
2 CONC s.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I024311&tree=tree1
2 CONT
2 CONT >NotesÂ 	need to verify birthdate
2 CONT
2 CONT ===
2 CONT > Page 260 Jones, Judith, widow, est. adm. by Spencer Ball in behalf of her grandchildren and his children Judith, Motrom, Betty, and William Ball. 12 April 1742
