1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Swan Jones (1705-before 14 August 1734, Stafford County, Virginia), son of Maurice Jones (d. 1733) and Judith Swann, married Elizabeth Lee in 1730 in Northumberland County.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born 1703 at Ditchley, daughter of Hancock Lee (d. 1709) and Sarah Allerton.  Her second husband was Zachary Taylor (d. 1768).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Swan Jones and Elizabeth Lee:
2 CONT # John Jones,   b. Abt 1728, Northumberland County, Virginia  d. 22 Jun 1758, Orange County, Virginia - probate.  Married Mary Bell.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From  https://archive.org/stream/jstor-1915269/1915269#page/n5/mode/2up William and Mary Quarterly 269
2 CONT
2 CONT From the records the children of Capt. Morris Jones probably were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 16 Swann, b. after 1700, d. before 1742, m. Elizabeth, who m., second, Zachary Taylor of Orange Co. Child, John Jones.
2 CONT
