1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Catesby WARING (Francis Gouldman WARING3, Thomas II WARING2, Thomas WARING1) was born ABT 1742 in Goldsborough, Essex Co., VA, and died AFT 1795 in Northumberland Co., VA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=thamm&id=I13352
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Spencer Mottrom BALL 1770 in Essex Co., VA, Book W12, pg 432, son of Spencer BALL and Frances MOTTROM. He was born 9 SEP 1736 in Northumberland Co., VA, and died DEC 1786 in Coan, Northumberland, VA.
2 CONT  	  Children of Elizabeth Catesby WARING and Spencer Mottrom BALL are:
2 CONT *+	2	  i.	Spencer Mottrom BALL was born 6 AUG 1762 in Coan, Northumberland, VA, and died 28 FEB 1832 in Portici, Prince William Co., VA.
2 CONT *+	3	  ii.	Mottrom BALL was born ABT 1774 in Coan, Northumberland, VA, and died 23 AUG 1842 in Woodbury, Fairfax Co., VA.
2 CONT * 	4	  iii.	William BALL was born ABT 1776, and died BEF 11 MAR 1816 in Northumberland Co., VA.
2 CONT * 	5	  iv.	Judith BALL was born ABT 1777. She married James BURWELL 15 NOV 1797 in Northumberland Co., VA. He was born ABT 1777.
2 CONT * 	6	  v.	Lucy W. BALL was born ABT 1778. She married George BLACKWELL 27 MAY 1800 in Northumberland Co., VA. He was born ABT 1782.
