2 CONT <cheryl@loganctygenealogy.org> on Dec 22, 2004 wrote:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:   HARDING-L@rootsweb.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject:  George Harding Line
2 CONT
2 CONT Is anyone researching the line of George Harding of London whose son Thomas came to Virginia, America in 1650. He and wife Anne Moseley had six children including Henry. Henry married Jane Arledge and had at least four children in
2 CONC cluding William. William's wife is  unknown. He had at least four children including Charles who married Rachel Lunsford. They had eight children
2 CONT
2 CONT including William who married Clarissa Million. William and Clarissa had at least 10 children including John Bennett Harding who shows up in Knox County, Ohio, as John Bennett Hardin in 1820. John, whose wife is unknown, had at le
2 CONC ast 10 children. The first 9 seem to have been named Hardin and the last one, Daniel, was named Harding.
2 CONT
2 CONT This line is discussed in Hardin and Harding of Virginia and Kentucky by Dorothy Ford Wulfeck, 1963.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cheryl Rothwell
2 CONT
2 CONT Cheryl@loganctygenealogy.org  
2 CONT
2 CONT Logan County ILGenWeb www.rootsweb.com/~illogan   
2 CONT
2 CONT Central IL Regional Coordinator, ILGenWeb   
2 CONT
2 CONT Clark, Downing, Harding, Lucas, et al
2 CONT
2 CONT -- 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Christened in Worstead, Tunstead & Happing District, Norfolk, England; moved to VA as child
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes from Arledge Family History Project (Pam Wilson, wilsonpam@mindspring.com):
2 CONT
2 CONT Listed as Mary in most records; however, descendants of Jane Arledge, child of Clement, give her date of birth as 1670, and presumably this is the same person. She may have been Mary Jane.
2 CONT
2 CONT Email correspondence from Sue Harris <byrumha@ibm.net> on 18 Jan 1998:
2 CONT
2 CONT "My Arledge line ended way back, with Jane Arledge who m Henry Harding in Northumberland Co., VA. I know she was a daughter of Clement Arledge & Elizabeth Tills, but they had four daughters christened in Worstead, Norfolk, England
2 CONC : Eliz., 1669; Mary, 1670; Winifred(?), ca 1674; and Alice or Grace (?), ca 1676. Others favor Mary, and as that name goes well with Jane, and she was born about the right time to be the wife of Henry Harding, I entered her in my 
2 CONC files as Mary Jane Arledge. (All I have on the early Arledge family came from Boddie's Historical Southern Families, V. 10. Sometimes there are errors in Boddie, but I've not looked elsewhere for more information since finding thi
2 CONC s article. Do you know of other early family histories, or is your information also based on Boddie? If you disagree about Mary Arledge being Jane, would love to know more. This isn't my research and I have no strong feelings abou
2 CONC t the matter.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Moving along, here's my direct line from Jane Arledge & Henry Harding
2 CONT
2 CONT down:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Jane Arledge b 1670 Eng., m/1 Henry Harding (b 1666 Northumberland, d 1698 Northumberland); m/2 Charles Ashton, 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Harding b ca 1690 Northumberland, d 1737 Stafford, m ca 1714 Stafford, Anne (----) Beltcher (widow), who d 1754 Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Harding m ca 1736 Stafford, Rachel Lunsford.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Harding 1738 Stafford - 1826 Stafford, m c 1764 Stafford, Clarissa "Clarkey" Million, b 1745 VA - d 1826 Stafford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cuthbert Harding b ca 1766 Stafford, d 1842 Barren Co., KY, m ca 1785 Stafford(?), Winifred McInteer, b ca 1766 Stafford, d aft 1842 Bourbon Co., KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Harding, b 1790 Stafford, d 1863 Sumner Co., TN, m 1808 Sumner Co., TN, James Whitworth, b 1779 Amelia, VA, d 1829 Sumner Co., TN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza Whitworth, b 1809 Sumner Co., TN, d 1888 Dallas Co., TX, m 1829 Sumner Co., TN, Weeden E. Byram, b 1804 Stafford Co., VA, d 1850 Sumner Co., TN. (Weeden changed name to BYRUM.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon Byrum b 1835 Sumner, TN, d ca 1864 LA or OK (Indian Territory), Civil War, m 1856 Wilson Co., TN, Caroline Duncan, b 1832 Wilson Co., TN, d 1922 Dallas Co., TX.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Edwin Byrum, b 1857 Sumner Co., TN, d 1938 Dallas Co., TX, m 1890 Trousdale Co., TN, Lenora Susan Belcher, b 1866 Trousdale Co., TN, d 1930 Dallas Co., TX.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Griffin Byrum, b 1892 Troudale Co., TN, d 1968 Dallas Co., TX, m
2 CONT
2 CONT 1925 Dallas Co., TX, Annie Mary White, b 1895 Dallas Co., TX, d 1985
