2 CONT Following are my basic charts. I have details for each individual amounting
2 CONT
2 CONT to dozens of records in some cases. I don't know how much interest you have
2 CONT
2 CONT in this line since it is now my belief that Henry and Jane Harding had no
2 CONT
2 CONT children. The numbering system is generational, that is 1132 is the second
2 CONT
2 CONT child of the third child of the first child. Hopefully the e-mail does not
2 CONT
2 CONT screw it up too much. Let me know if you are interested in a full copy of the
2 CONT
2 CONT work I've done. There are five different families, not one as in most
2 CONT
2 CONT sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lee Pound
2 CONT
