2 CONT <cheryl@loganctygenealogy.org> on Dec 22, 2004 wrote:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: HARDING-L@rootsweb.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject: George Harding Line
2 CONT
2 CONT Is anyone researching the line of George Harding of London whose son Thomas came to Virginia, America in 1650. He and wife Anne Moseley had six children including Henry. Henry married Jane Arledge and had at least four children in
2 CONC cluding William. William's wife is unknown. He had at least four children including Charles who married Rachel Lunsford. They had eight children
2 CONT
2 CONT including William who married Clarissa Million. William and Clarissa had at least 10 children including John Bennett Harding who shows up in Knox County, Ohio, as John Bennett Hardin in 1820. John, whose wife is unknown, had at le
2 CONC ast 10 children. The first 9 seem to have been named Hardin and the last one, Daniel, was named Harding.
2 CONT
2 CONT This line is discussed in Hardin and Harding of Virginia and Kentucky by Dorothy Ford Wulfeck, 1963.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cheryl Rothwell
2 CONT
