2 CONC vers all the plantation formerly belonging to John Lewis (III) deceased - adjoining lands of ...............; also three slaves he bought from William Hughett's wife's thirds of John Lewis (II) deceased Estate and give 1 bed and f
2 CONC urniture, 1 cow , 1 calf or Big with calf; 1 sow and pigs or Big with pig." This transaction was witnessed by his uncle William Lewis and Lindsay Opie and recorded in court on December 3, 1759.
