2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Dameron Ingram is listed as such in her father's will.  She was the daughter of George Dameron, not Willis Dameron.   '''Nowhere is she listed with the first name Mary.'''  Her father George was a son of Lawrence Dameron
2 CONC .
