1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From "Genealogies of Virginia Families" p. 474
2 CONT
2 CONT >Hayden's statement that Geo. Ball probably later married Grace Waddy is due to the fact that Sarah, the mother of Grace Haynie Ball, and widow of Anthony Haynie, m. 2nd Francis Waddy and in her will Sarah Waddy names her daughter
2 CONC  Grace Ball.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Sarah, the mother of Grace Ball, was daughter and heir of Major John Harris. 1713, June 18, Will of John Harris dec'd presented in Court by Sarah Haynie and George Ball, executors.
