1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Davenport was born on December 27th, 1749 in North Farnham Parish, Richmond County. Her father was William Davenport. She married Caster Tune, son of Thomas Tune and Anne Harris of Richmond County before 
2 CONC 1771. Caster's name appeared as a land owner in Richmond County on the 1770 rent roll. Caster is also listed on a 1783 tax list for Richmond County in the "Moraticounty Precinct." I have not found any verified death records for El
2 CONC izabeth or Caster.
