1 NOTE Name: Anne CORBIN Given Name: Anne Surname: CORBIN Sex: F Birth: 9 Feb 1663/64 in Buckingham House, Middlesex County, Virginia 1 Death: 30 Jul 1694 in Mount Airy House, Richmond County, Virginia
2 CONT   Father: Henry CORBIN b: 1629 in Hall End, Warwick, England  Mother: Anne ELTONHEAD  b: Abt 1630 in Buckingham House, Middlesex County, Virginia  Marriage 1 James BYRNE
2 CONT Married: 1716
2 CONT  Marriage 2 William TAYLOR b: 1630 in London, London, England
