2 CONT Children of Tayloe are:
2 CONT # William Tayloe was born 1645 in , , England, and died 1706/1710 in , Richmond Co., Virginia. He married Anne Corbin ABT 1685 in , Virginia, daughter of Henry Corbin (Corbyn) and Alice Eltonhead. She was born 9 Feb 1664 in "Bucki
2 CONC ngham House", Middlesex Co., Virginia, was christened 29 Feb 1664 in Christ Church, , Middlesex Co., Virginia, and died 1694 in , , Virginia. He married Anne.
2 CONT # Joseph Tayloe died 1716 in , Lancaster Co., Virginia. He married Barbara Billington BEF 22 May 1710 in , , Virginia, daughter of Luke Billington (Bullington) and Barbara "Barbary". She died 1726/1727 in , Lancaster Co., Virginia
2 CONC .
2 CONT # Robert Tayloe died 1704. He married Ruth Field 30 Jul 1684 in St. James Parish, London, England.
2 CONT
