2 CONT
2 CONT James PENDLETON Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1702 - 1761
2 CONT
2 CONT ID Number: I3591
2 CONT
2 CONT     * OCCUPATION: 1757 Vestryman of St. Mark's & High Sheriff of Culpeper Co.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * RESIDENCE: Caroline and Essex Cos. or KandQ and Culpeper Cos.VA
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: 1702, King and Queen or Caroline Co. VA
2 CONT
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1761, Culpeper or Essex Co. VA
2 CONT
2 CONT     * RESOURCES: See: CONFLICT Notes [S11] [S157] [S172] [S179] [S324] [S641] [S721] [S747] [S1735] [S2036] [S2354] [S3337] [S3642] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Henry PENDLETON
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Mary Bishop TAYLOR
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Mary CLAYTON
2 CONT
2 CONT     * MARRIAGE: 8 Jan 1727, Lancaster Co. Virginia 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2 : Elizabeth COLEMAN
2 CONT
2 CONT     * MARRIAGE: ABT 1732 
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +Henry PENDLETON Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. +Anne PENDLETON
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. +James PENDLETON Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. +Philip PENDLETON 
2 CONT
