2 CONT *M iv Cadwalader Slaughter 1, 2 was born about 1735 in Essex or Culpeper County, Virginia. He died in 1798. 
2 CONT *F v Frances Slaughter 1, 2 was born about 1737 in Essex or Culpeper County, Virginia. She died in UNKNOWN.
2 CONT * F vi Ann Slaughter 1, 2 was born about 1739 in Essex or Culpeper County, Virginia. She died in UNKNOWN.
