1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6-Francis (1701-66), col. militia, justice, church warden, m 1729, Anne Lightfoot;
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT * Frederick Adams Virkus, ed.  1933.  The Compendium of American Genealogy.  Institute of American Genealogy, Chicago (repub. 1968 by Genealogical Publ. Co., Baltimore; Broderbund CD-200):
