1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Margaret Prather Lillard=
2 CONT * BIRTH 20 Apr 1777 Prince George's County, Maryland, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 24 Apr 1859 (aged 82) Lawrenceburg, Anderson County, Kentucky, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Lilliard Cemetery, Lawrenceburg, Anderson County, Kentucky, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 91972834
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Prather Lillard was the daughter of Thomas Prather & Mary Ann Phillips.  She married both John Ben Payne and Ephraim Lilliard in 1795.  Ephraim and her were the parents of Mary, Margaret, Elizabeth, Thomas, Stephen, Ellen
2 CONC der, Susanna, Nancy, Martha, and Ephraim Lilliard.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Thomas Prather 1757–1786
2 CONT Mary Phillips Prather 1760–1787
2 CONT
