2 CONT Robert Taylor, Haberdasher, Alderman Queenhithe, 1592-6, Sheriff 1592-3, (d 31 Dec 1596), had an ONLY dau Rebecca married Sir William Romney. Beavan says Romney was ?Son-in-law of Robert Taylor (Alderman, Sheriff 1592-3).?
