1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Vivion-1
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Vivion was born April 2, 1684, in Middlesex County, Virginia, to John Vivion and Margaret (Smith) Vivion.
2 CONT
2 CONT “Margarett Vivion ye Daughter of Jno. & Margt Vivion baptz 2th of Aprill 1684.” [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married James Daniel on January 27, 1704, in Middlesex County, Virginia. They had nine children. “James Daniel & Margaret Vivion were Married Jan ye 27th 1704.” [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away May 5, 1727, in Middlesex County, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Will
2 CONT
2 CONT Will of Margaret Daniel, nee Vivion: made 27 Aug 1750; proved 1750. WB1745-1760, P 138, Middlesex Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the name of God Amen, 27 Aug 1750. I Margaret Daniel of the County of Middlesex and Parish of Christ Church, being in perfect sound sense and memory do make this my last will and Testament in manner following: first, I give my 
2 CONC Soul unto the hands of Almighty God, in certain hopes of the Ressurection to Eternal life through the Meritts of my Blessed Saviour Jesus Christ. Secondly; I leave my Body to be decently interred by my Executores hereafter mention
2 CONC ed: ITEM: I give my son, Vivion Daniel, all my hole Estate excepting two cows which I leave my son James, which is all I intend for him, I also do appoint my son Vivion Daniel my hole and sole Executor. (Signed) Margaret DANIEL (X
2 CONC  her mark)
2 CONT
2 CONT Signed, sealed in presence of us, Charles Daniel, John Daniel, Jane Daniel.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is listed as #2531 on the pedigree chart in the book Morris Fork Kentucky: Family Stories and Genealogies from Breathitt County and Eastern Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * [http://home.comcast.net/~p.a.miller/genealogy/docs/danielmiddlesex/danieldna/index.htm DNA of the Daniel Family of Middlesex VA]
2 CONT * Virginia Genealogies: A Genealogy of the Glassell Family of Scotland and ... By Horace Edwin Hayden.  Page 294.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=SJcsAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA294#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Daniel-82 --------------------
