2 CONT Name 	Vivion Daniel
2 CONT Residence Date 	Abt 1802
2 CONT Residence Place 	Clark, Kentucky
2 CONT Probate Date 	21 Jun 1802
2 CONT Probate Place 	Kentucky, USA
2 CONT Inferred Death Year 	1802
