1 NAME John /Neville/
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Neville
2 _MARNM Neville
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 JUL 1731
2 ADDR
3 CITY Abington Parrish
3 STAE Province of Virginia
3 CTRY British Colonial America
1 BURI
