2 CONT
2 CONT A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA with the rank of LIEUTENANT COLONEL.  [http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A082526  DAR Ancestor #  A082526]
