1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/180219537/richard-a_-oldham Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 14 2019, 5:37:09 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Major Richard A. Oldham (1787-1842) was for many years an officer in the U.S. Army.  He married Eliza Martin, a daughter of Major Thomas Martin, the first Commandant of Newport Barracks, Ky.  Their eight children were Jane who mar
2 CONC ried William Wetmore, of New York; William Henry; Thomas M.; Catherine who married John W. Edgerton, of Ohio; Worden P.; Penelope Abigail (1825-1908); Mary who married Dr. A. S. Robertson, of Nashville; and George L. Oldham who ma
2 CONC y have died during the Civil War.  The latter married Harriett Josephine Miller (1835-), daughter of John Adam Miller.  Their son,  Alfred Violett Oldham (1862-1932), was clerk of the city court in Louisville.  Penelope Abigail Ol
2 CONC dham (1825-1908) married William Alfred Violett (1812-68), of New Orleans.  There five children were Atwood (1847-1932), Mignonette (1857-1910), Ella (1850-1904), Lilly and Edward R. Violett (1856-1919).  Atwood Violett (1847-1932
2 CONC ) was a prominent broker in New Orleans and New York.  He married in 1887, Olga Quentell, of Liverpool, Eng., and his children were Thelma (1892-1971) who married William Macy Brewster; and Rear Admiral Quentell Violett (1898-1984
2 CONC ) who served in WWI and WWII and married Geraldine Schleussner (1911-89).  Mignonette Violett (1857-1910) married financier and philanthropist Charles Smith Whelan (1850-1910), of Philadelphia, and their children were Violett (188
2 CONC 0-1904) who married Malcolm Scollay Greenough (1876-1903)(Harvard 1898), and Charles Smith Whelan, Jr. (1883-1904).
2 CONT
2 CONT Major Richard Oldham reportedly died in Habersham, Ga.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/180219537/richard-a_-oldham Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 14 2019, 5:40:52 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
