2 CONT === Grandmother Pine attends granddaughter's wedding. ===
2 CONT In "The Descendants of Capt. Thomas Carter'" by Joseph Lyon Miller M.D., P.?, Anne Pine, grandmother, attended Joseph Carter's Christening. He later wed her granddaughter, Ann Pines.  The grandmother also attended Joseph's older b
2 CONC rother, Henry Skipwith's, Christening. It is also written on the same page in the book. I do have the copy of this page in the book but have not located it yet.
