1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Middleton''', son of Jeremiah Middleton (d. bef 1777) and his wife Elizabeth Straughan, was born 17 Jan 1770 at St. Stephen's Parish, Northumberland County, Virginia.  He died November 1841 at Summerfield in Guilford Count
2 CONC y, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Middleton married on 29 Jan. 1788 at Westmoreland County to Hannah Wroe, daughter of John Wroe (d. 1794) and his wife Hannah Middleton.  She was born about 1765.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hannah Wroe and John Middleton were:
2 CONT
2 CONT #  Elizabeth  Middleton:   b. 28 Jan 1789, St. Stephens Parish, Northumberland County, Virginia.
2 CONT # Robert  Middleton : b. 17 Feb 1792, St. Stephens Parish, Northumberland County, Virginia; d. 13 Apr 1852, Stockton, Owen County, Indiana.
2 CONT #  John H. Middleton:    b. 29 Jan 1794, Virginia (prob. Westmoreland or Northumberland Co.); d. Apr 1872, Pleasant Site, Franklin County, Alabama.
2 CONT # Alcey Middleton:   b. Abt 1802
2 CONT # James   Middleton:   b. 1806, Guilford County, North Carolina; d. Bef 1860.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT # https://colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I89784&tree=Tree1
