2 CONT ## b. 29 Jan 1788; Geo Middleton (sec); bride was a dau of Jn Wroe (d. RC 1794); by 13 Nov 1800, Jn. and Hanah (Wroe) Middleton were res. of NoCar: (RC DB 17:439; WB 9:5; MLB WC; MLB WC2; JFL annotations to MLB WC; MLB WC3) (Marri
2 CONC ed Well and Often)
2 CONT ## Marriage Bond for John Middleton and Hannah Wroe dated 29 Jan 1788 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. John Middleton is the son of Thomas Middleton and Judith. Hannah Wroe is the daughter of John Wroe and Hannah Middleton.
