2 CONT
2 CONT When Anne Fairfax was born on 17 September 1728, in Salem, Culpeper, Virginia, British Colonial America, her father, William Fairfax, was 36 and her mother, Sarah Walker, was 29. She married Lawrence Augustus Washington on 19 July
2 CONC  1743, in Prince William, Virginia, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 14 March 1761, in Westmoreland, Virginia, British Colonial America, at the age of 32, and was buri
2 CONC ed in Coles Point, Westmoreland, Virginia, United States.
