1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Anne AYLETT and Augustine (Austin) WASHINGTON are:
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Anne WASHINGTON was born 2 APR 1752 in Westmoreland County, Virginia, and died 3 JUN 1777 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. She married Burdett col ASHTON 19 DEC 1768 in Westmoreland County, Virginia, son of Charles ASHTON and
2 CONC  Sarah BUTLER. He was born 21 NOV 1747 in Chestnut Hill, Westmoreland County, Virginia, and died 8 MAR 1814 in Westmoreland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 children, 3 who died without marrying.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT From [https://books.google.com/books?id=Pox2AAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA448&ots=D3F9dmxtVt&dq=Burdett%20Ashton&pg=PA448#v=onepage&q&f=true Page 448] of “Ancestral Records and Portraits: A Compilation from the Archives ..., Volume 2” By Colonia
2 CONC l Dames of America. Chapter I, Baltimore
2 CONT
2 CONT >The eldest son, Burdett Ashton, of Chestnut Hill, King George's County, born November 21, 1747, married December 19, 1768, Anne, the daughter of Augustine Washington II.; she was born April 2,1752. He was member of State Conventi
2 CONC on 1788, Delegate 1799 to 1800, etc. Issue: Charles Augustine, died 1800; Burdett, Sarah and Ann.”
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=thamm&id=I17655&ti=%252C
2 CONT
2 CONT >1799: Mentioned in will of George Washington: To William Augustine Washington, Elizabeth Spotswood, Jane Thornton, and the heirs of Ann Ashton; son, and daughters of my deceased brother Augustine Washington, I give and bequeath f
2 CONC our parts; that is--one part to each of them.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----  
2 CONT
2 CONT *This link details the marriages of Burditt Ashton and his children by each marriage. (https://www.jstor.org/stable/1923243?seq=3#metadata_info_tab_contents)
2 CONT *George Washington: A Biographical Companion, page 403 details the Ashton family - Burdett and his wife Ann Washington as well as 3 of their children. [https://books.google.com/books?id=RioTGCygpT8C&pg=PA403&lpg=PA403&dq=burdett+a
2 CONC shton+%26+ann+washington&source=bl&ots=LRWJ_FU-Bx&sig=IgwNPkB2u3KJsuLFD07d5zon7Zo&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjd4erN3P3dAhWDc98KHXOSAUAQ6AEwCHoECAAQAQ#v=onepage&q=burdett%20ashton%20%26%20ann%20washington&f=false link]
2 CONT *Genealogies of Virginia Families Vol. I, from the Virginia Magazine of History and Biography. 
2 CONT * http://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I023868&tree=Tree1
