2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Life Sketch ===
2 CONT Extant grave in Warner Hall Graveyard, Gloucester, Virginia for Mildred Reade, wife of Augustine WARNER II.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred Reade is the great grandmother of George Washington. Her daughter Mildred Warner remarried to Lawrence Washington and had children one of them being Augustine Washington, who married Mary Ball and had George Washington.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === My Linage ===
2 CONT Mildred Reade MY 10TH GREAT-GRANDMOTHER
