2 CONT Colonel Augustine Warner was born on 3 June 1642 at York County, Virginia, U.S.A.. He was the son of Captain Augustine Warner and Mary Towneley.1 He married Mildred Reade, daughter of Colonel George Reade and Elizabeth Martiau, in
2 CONC  1670/71. He died on 19 June 1681 at age 39 at Warner Hall, Virginia, U.S.A..
2 CONT
2 CONT Colonel Augustine Warner held the office of Speaker of the House of Burgesses [Virginia].
