2 CONT * Abby Sage Richardson (1875). The History of Our Country: From Its Discovery by Columbus to the Celebration of the Centennial Anniversary of the Declaration of Independence. H. O. Houghton and Company. 
2 CONT * Henry Cabot Lodge (1917). George Washington. Houghton Mifflin.
2 CONT * Great Houses of Britain, by Nigel Nicolson, p. 68.  “Colonel John Washington , a great-great grandson of Lawrence the builder of Sulgrave Manor emigrated to Virginia for business reasons in in 1656, and he was the great-grandfat
2 CONC her of George Washington, First President of the United State who was born in 1732." 
2 CONT
