0 @I6000000003918387026@ INDI
1 NAME Anne /Pope/
2 GIVN Anne
2 SURN Pope
2 _MARNM Washington
2 NICK Ann Pope
2 NICK Ann Washington
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC GW Birthplace National Monument Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY British Amercia
