1 NOTE !BIRTH - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 328
2 CONT John (Jr.) (1663-1697/98) son of John Washington the immigrant.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Ann Wickliffe and had children:  Lawrence, John, Nathaniel, Henry, Anne who married a Wright and another daughter who married a Lewis.
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in his father's house, east of Bridges Creek, near the family cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He made his will January 22, 1697; probated February 22, 1697/98.
