1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Ann Kendall (Washington) had to be born before her mother passed in 1669.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Washington-2728
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was born in 1665. She was the daughter of Col. John Washington (1627-1677). On 18 May 1692 she married Thomas Kendall. They had at least one known child. She passed away in 1735. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Henry Kendall b. 1699 - d. 1758 
