2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine Washington was born on 11 Feb 1724/25. She died on 19 Feb 1749/50 at age 25.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Maj. John Washington and Catherine Whiting
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # on 18 Oct 1746 to Gen. Fielding Lewis (1820-1799) as his first wife; he married Elizabeth Washington, daughter of Augustine Washington and Mary Ball, on 7 Mar 1750; 2nd wife.  He was the son of Col. John Lewis & Frances Fielding
2 CONC .
2 CONT
