2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Feb. 11, 1724 Gloucester County Virginia, USA  Death:  Feb. 19, 1750 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents of John Lewis married five times: 1) Lucy Thornton daughter of Col John Thornton and Mildred Gregory-had one child Mildred. Lucy Thornton's sisters married Samuel Washington; William Woodford and John Taliferro 2) Elizabet
2 CONC h Thornton daughter of Col. Francis Thornton and Frances Gregory {no children}. A brother of Elizabeth was Colonel John Thornton who married Jane daughter of Augustine Washington 3)a daughter of Gabriel Jones-a relative of General
2 CONC  Hugh Mercer. The wife of Gabriel Jones was a daughter of William Strother and Margaret Watts. The father of William and James Strother was Jeremiah Strother died 1741 Stafford CO VA. James Strother died 1761 who married Margaret 
2 CONC daugther of Daniel French. A son of James Strother was George French Strother was a member of the Virginia House of Burgess and married Lucy Coleman. A son of French Strother was Congressman George French Strother. A son of Jeremi
2 CONC ah Strother was Francis Strother married Susan Dabney; Francis son John was the father of daugthers from Whom are descended General E. P. Gaines; General Duff Green; Congressman John Strother Pendelton. Francis son Anthony was the
2 CONC  great grandfather of General David Hunter Strother; another son of Francis and Susan Dabney was William the father of Sarah Strother the mother of President Zachery Taylor
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: pp.87-88 
