2 CONT Sister of Nathaniel West Dandridge, Sr. and aunt to Dorothea Dandridge Henry, second wife of Patrick Henry.
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT Here lies interred the body of Martha Aylett wife of Philip and the daughter of the Honorable William Dandridge and Unity (West) Dandridge who died 25th April, 1747 in the 26th year of her age and left behind her two daughters and
2 CONC  two sons viz Unity, William, Ann and John Aylett
