2 CONT ''When Charles Augustine Lewis I “of Cedar Creek” was born on 25 February 1729, in Gloucester, Virginia, United States, his father, John Lewis IV, was 36 and his mother, Frances Fielding, was 29. He married Lucy Catlett Taliaferro
2 CONC  in 1750, in Caroline, Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. He registered for military service in 1754. He died in 1770, in Port Royal, Caroline, Virginia, United States, at the age of 
2 CONC 41, and was buried in Goochland, Virginia, United States.''
2 CONT FamilySearch https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/G7F6-48Z/charles-augustine-lewis-i-%E2%80%9Cof-cedar-creek%E2%80%9D-1729-1770
