2 CONT
2 CONT MISTRESS OF RIVERSDALE, THE PLANTATION LETTERS OF ROSALIE STIER CALVERT 1795-1821 Edited and Translated by Margaret Law Callcott, p. 50
2 CONT Martha (Custis) Peter (1777-1854) was the wife of Thomas Peter of Georgetown and the Calverts' niece.  She was one of the four children of Eleanor (Calvert) Custis, George Calvert's older sister, and John Parke Custis (1753-1781),
2 CONC  the only son of Martha (Dandridge) Custis Washington by her first marriage.
2 CONT
