2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L2MQ-LTH/mary-eliza-angela-lewis-1813-1839
2 CONT When Mary Eliza Angela Lewis was born on 1 April 1813, in Woodlawn, Fairfax County, Virginia, United States, her father, Lawrence Lewis, was 45 and her mother, Eleanor Parke Custis, was 34. She married Senator Charles Magill Conra
2 CONC d on 30 July 1835, in New Orleans, Orleans, Louisiana, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. She died on 21 September 1839, in Pass Christian, Harrison, Mississippi, United States, at the age of 2
2 CONC 6, and was buried in Mount Vernon, Fairfax County, Virginia, United States.
