2 CONT ===Mary Thornton 
2 CONT * BIRTH: 4 May 1743 - Caroline County, Virginia, USA
2 CONT * DEATH: 8 Feb 1792 (aged 48) - Caroline County, Virginia, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL: Burial Details Unknown. Specifically: likely buried on their estate "Windsor" in Caroline County on the Rappahannock River, ten miles southeast of Fredericksburg, Va. It is now part of the A.P. Hill Military Reservation.
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID: 243243317 · View Source
2 CONT
