1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucy_Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lucy Todd Washington (Payne)''' (1772?–1846), one of eight children born to John Payne and Mary Coles, was the sister of Dolley Madison, the wife of American President James Madison. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She first married Major George Steptoe Washington, a nephew of American U.S. President George Washington. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT # George Steptoe Washington Jr.
2 CONT # Dr. Samuel Walter Washington m. Louisa Clemson 
2 CONT
2 CONT After his death, she married Supreme Court Justice Thomas Todd on March 29, 1812. It was the first documented wedding ceremony in the White House. 
2 CONT
2 CONT That couple had three children: 
2 CONT # William J. Todd 
2 CONT # Madisonia Todd 
2 CONT # James Madison Todd
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=18932101
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1772
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanover County
2 CONT
2 CONT Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Jan. 29, 1846
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of George Steptoe Washington. Was buried on the Washington estate "Harewood", removed after 1893 and reinterred in Zion Episcopal Churchyard by request of Louisa C. Washington wife of Lucy's son Dr. Samuel W. Wahington who wa
2 CONC s also buried at "Harewood" and reinterred at Zion Episcopal Churchyard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT * John Payne (1740 - 1792)
2 CONT * Mary Coles Payne (1743 - 1808)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # Samuel Walter Washington (1798 - 1831)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses:
2 CONT #   George Steptoe Washington (1772 - 1809)
2 CONT #   Thomas Todd (1765 - 1826)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Point here for explanation
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial:
2 CONT
2 CONT Zion Episcopal Churchyard 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Town
2 CONT
2 CONT Jefferson County
2 CONT
2 CONT West Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Edit Virtual Cemetery info [?]
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: stars&bars
2 CONT
2 CONT Record added: Apr 14, 2007 
2 CONT
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial# 18932101
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL DATE IS CORRECT. Lucy was re-interred in 1893. See bio below.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
