1 NOTE THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 48
2 CONT George Steptoe Washington's wife was Lucy Payne, a sister to Dolly Payne Todd; and thus it came about that the marriage of James Madison and Dolly Payne Todd at Harewood, the home of George Steptoe Waqshington and Lucy (Payne) Was
