1 NOTE !BIRTH - TIDEWATER DYNASTY A BIOGRAPHICAL NOVEL OF THE LEES OF STRATFORD HALL by Carey Roberts and Rebecca Seely - From Family Tree
2 CONT Hannah Lee, the daughter of Richard Henry Lee and his first wife, Anne Aylett and was born 1766 prob. in Westmoreland Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - MARRIAGES AND DEATHS FROM BALTIMORE NEWSPAPERS, 1796-1816 by Robert Barnes, p. 338
2 CONT WASHINGTON, Mrs. Hannah, widow of Corbin Washington, died at Alexandria, Mon, se'ennight, in her 37th year. (Balto. American, 8 Dec 1801)
2 CONT
2 CONT !BURIAL - Ibid
2 CONT She was buried at "Bushfield" in Westmoreland Co.,VA
