1 SUBM @S6000000001179768364@
1 NOTE !DEATH - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 340
2 CONT Richard Henry Lee, son of Cortin Washington and wife Hannah Lee, died 1819 unmarried.  His mother's home in 1800 was "Selby", Fairfax Co.,VA.
