1 NOTE !BIRTH - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 316
2 CONT Bushrod Corbin was born December 25, 1790, son of Corbin and Hannah Lee Washington, was born in Westmoreland Co.,VA and later lived in Jefferson Co.,VA
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #1 - Ibid, p. 211
2 CONT He married first Ann Maria Thomasina Blackburn.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - Ibid p. 215
2 CONT He married 2nd Maria P. Harrison.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid, p. 217
2 CONT Bushrod Corbin Washington died on July 27, 1851.
