1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA LINEAGES, LETTERS & MEMORIES by Alice Jean Nelson, p. 240
2 CONT William Thornton, the son of Francis Thornton, III (1714-1749) and wife, Frances Gregory, was born in 1742 in Spotsylvania Co.,VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Martha Stuart 11 May 1775 at Chantilly, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died in 1818 at Rappahannock Co.,VA
2 CONT
2 CONT William Thornton's home was "Montpelier", Rappahannock Co.,VA.  He served with distinction during the Revolutionary War as Col. of Culpeper Co. VA. Militia.  His will which was proved 17 Aug 1818, Culpeper Co., names children:  Ma
2 CONC rtha, Maria, Lucinda, George A. and William Thornton.
