1 NOTE !MAR - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 507
2 CONT Francis Peyton, M.D., son of Col Francis Peyton and his wife, Frances Dade, married April 7, 1802 Frances (Washington) Ball, widow of Col. Burgess Ball and daughter of Col. Charles Washington.
