1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dorothea Washington''' was born on May 6, 1778 in Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-8544671 Francis Thornton, IV of &quot;Fall HIll&quot;] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-77993331 Ann Tho
2 CONC rnton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothea married [https://www.geni.com/profile-26035186 Captain Samuel T Washington] in 1795 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036353 Mildred Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764503977 Mildred Ann Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036414 Samuel Thornton Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036446 August C Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036475 George Fayette Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26034794 Francis Augustine Washington, Sr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764503979 Francis Augustine Washington, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 27, 1813 in Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States and was buried there. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Her husband, Samuel Washington, is buried in Bangor Cemetery, Kanawha Co., West Virginia. Her children are listed as:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred Ann Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Thompson Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta Clifford Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT George Fayette Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Augustine Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis was born in 1811 and Dorothea passed away in 1813. She probably died in child bearing, but no child is listed born or died for that year.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/122854159/dorothea-washington Find 
2 CONC A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 3 2020, 21:20:33 UTC''
