1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Flake''' was born ca 1653, the daughter of Robert Flake (1621-1697) and Katherine Moore (ca 1615 - aft 1679). 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married about 1669 to Peter Hayes (ca 1650 - 1721).  He was the son of Peter Hayes (ca 1600 - 1668)
2 CONT
2 CONT known children of Peter Hayse and Elizabeth Flake :
2 CONT # Robert Hayes of VA bef 1690 - 1771. married  Miss Harris 
2 CONT # Samuel Hayes of NC bef 1690 - settled in the Meherrin River Valley
2 CONT # Peter Hayse ca 1691 - 1761 Halifax Co NC married  ca 1726 Martha Sledge
2 CONT # Elizabeth Hayes of VA  married  George Harris
2 CONT # Katherine Hayes of VA married  Roger Stevens
2 CONT # Arthur Hayes of VA aft 1691 - 1776
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Moore and Robert Flake:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Elizabeth Flake ca1653 – married ca 1669 Peter Hayes
2 CONT * 2. Mary Flake ca 1650/55-aft 1717 married bef. 25 Oct 1670 John Clarke ca 1636 – 1722 he had married 1st 7 May 1666 Katherine Gwaltney ca 1630 – ca 1669
2 CONT * 3. Robert Flake Jr. ca 1660-1724 married bef. 1702 Margaret Marriott
2 CONT * 4. Katherine Flake ca 1667 – ? married 1st 1689 William Evans married 2nd bef. 1692 Thomas Pierce
2 CONT
