2 CONT 1. HENRY2 KING (MICHAEL1)1 was born Bet. 1650 - 1655 in Nansemond, VA, and died 16 April 1716 in Chowan, CO., NC (will dated Feb. 24, 1716).
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1) ELIZABETH CLARK Abt. 1684 in Surry Co., VA, daughter of JOHN CLARK and MARY BYRD  She was born 1655 in Isle of Wight, Surry Co., VA, and died Bef. 1698 in Chowan Co., NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) CATHERINE CLARKE Aft. 1698 in Nansemond, VA., daughter of JOHN CLARK and MARY FALKE. She was born 1650 in Nansemond, VA., and died 25 March 1725 in Chowan, CO., NC.
