2 CONT Children of Robert Flake Jr and Margaret Marriott: 
2 CONT * 1. Alice Flake married William Gwaltney see https://www.geni.com/people/Alice-Gwaltney/6000000005601442295?through=6000000005601684050
2 CONT * 2. Katherine Flake  married by 21 July 1718 William Braddy
2 CONT * 3. Elizabeth Flake
2 CONT * 4. Thomas Flake
2 CONT * ?5. William Flake died 1731 Surry Co, VA
2 CONT * ?6. Robert Flake m. Rebecca Dews Dec. 26, 1789 (by Rev. William Hubard) Chapman Book pg. 89
