1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L228-ZD8/elizabeth-warsham-1602-1642
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Warsham was born in 1602, in Oxford, Oxfordshire, England, her father, William Warsham, was 24 and her mother, Lady Sarah Sidney Gerard, was 48. She married Richard Kennon in 1634, in Oxford, Oxfordshire, England, U
2 CONC nited Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons. She died in 1642, in Northumberland, Virginia, British Colonial America, at the age of 40.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT  Richard Kennon        1600–1696
2 CONT  Elizabeth Warsham   1602–1642
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT 1634 Oxford, Oxfordshire, England, United Kingdom
2 CONT
2 CONT Children (3)
2 CONT Capt Richard Francis Kenner II   1625–1691
2 CONT John Kenner                             1628–1650
2 CONT John Swanson                          1637–Deceased
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT
2 CONT William Warsham                1578–Deceased
2 CONT Lady Sarah Sidney Gerard   1554–1632
