2 CONT >Richard Bushrod and Apphia, his wife, Glouc r, had—3. John. 3. '''Thomas''', b.—; d. Cir. 1709; will dat. Sep. 1,1697; had Richard, pro. Capt. R., 1740, and Anne, m. John Bushrod.
