1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Margaret Hannah Payne''' was born in 1615 in Old Rappahannock County, VA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-70688626 William R. Robinson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-70688656 Mary Robinson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-9685793 John Payne] circa 1634 in Frittenden, Kent, England. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-9685778 Richard Payne, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-7540546 Margaret Edrington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-43966760 John Payne, Jr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-43966667 William Payne, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748847407 Robert Payne];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748847403 Elizabeth Payne];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-52461370 George Payne]. 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 15, 1684, in Cedar Hill, Montross, VA, United States, and was buried in Payne Family Cemetery, Flint Hill, Rappahannock, Virginia, United States. [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GScid=2147606
2 CONC &GRid=11294413&]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Gravesite
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GScid=2147606&GRid=11294413&]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Margaret's surname may be "Robinson."
2 CONT ==========
