2 CONT * http://www.kykinfolk.com/gallatin/Familyreports/Paynes-Caves-Johnsons2.pdf
2 CONT * http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/PAYNE/2007-11/1196118399
2 CONT * http://www.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~molcgdrg/sur/1p/payne-108916.htm
2 CONT * http://personal.linkline.com/xymox/roh/payne.htm
2 CONT * http://www.familysearch.org/eng/search/AF/individual_record.asp?recid=6873226&lds=0&frompage=99
2 CONT * http://hiddenancestors.com/clarkky/family/fr061-payne.ht
2 CONT * https://books.google.com/books?id=PnHX29oDlA0C&pg=PA60&lpg=PA60&dq=john+payne+captain+john+and+dorothy&source=bl&ots=wSlYLCstQr&sig=_V3Tab1oZxkXPUlLjdJM45QGq9s&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiPtvvPwubKAhVCGD4KHaotDS0Q6AEIHTAA#v=onepage&q
2 CONC =john%20and%20dorothy&f=false
2 CONT * http://mv.ancestry.com/viewer/710680d0-bc65-4716-b646-37c5d0ddf414/46285016/24113403294
2 CONT * http://www.disnorge.no/slektsforum/viewtopic.php?t=7868
2 CONT
