2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Payne Reference A-I-1. The immigrant.
2 CONT ==========
2 CONT From Terri's Genealogy Home Page ( http://www.ipa.net/~ksmith/#Payne )
2 CONT "Payne John Payne married Margaret Robinson about 1634. John and Margaret appear to have emigrated from England to the United States before 1652, as they are mentioned in the records of Lancaster County, Virginia, in that year. Th
2 CONC ey left descendants in Rappahannock, Richmond, and Westmoreland County in Virginia. I descend from their daughter Margrett, who married John Jennings." [My note: It is not proven that John Payne's spouses surname was ROBINSON.]
2 CONT ==========
2 CONT Find-A-Grave:
