1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Boyles was the 1st wife of John Walker and mother of 4 of his 6 daughters: Anne, Frances, Jane and Elizabeth.  She died before 1662 when he married Sarah, widow of Henry Fleete, with whom Col Walker had d
2 CONC aughters Hester and Sarah.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Col John WALKER was born in England. He married Elizabeth BOYES aft. 1649. He died bef. 28 January 1669. Elizabeth BOYES, daughter of Francis BOYES , was born bef. 1634. She died bef. 23 October 1661.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Col John WALKER and Elizabeth BOYES are: 
2 CONT * 1. Anne WALKER, b. bet. 1650 and 1652	See John PAYNE & Anne WALKER
2 CONT * 2. Frances WALKER, b. bet. 1650 and 23 October 1661	
2 CONT * 3. Jane WALKER, b. bet. 1650 and 23 October 1661	
2 CONT * 4. Elizabeth WALKER, b. bet. 1650 and 23 October 1661
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1665 Will of Col John Walker
2 CONT * Wife: Sarah exr
2 CONT * Daughter: Anne Payne and her husband John Payne
2 CONT * Daughter: Frances Walker
2 CONT * Daughter: Jane Walker
2 CONT * Daughter: Elizabeth Walker
2 CONT * Daugher: Sarah Walker
2 CONT * Daughter: Hester Walker
2 CONT * Wit: Richard Fox, Abraham Warner
2 CONT * Virginia Will Records Abstracts from Records of Richmond County, Virginia
2 CONT * ....
2 CONT
