2 CONT [He married about 1652, Elizabeth Jessop, daughter of Simon Jessop of Edial, Staffordshire - '''NO'''.  https://www.geni.com/people/John-Rodes-of-Sturton/6000000196532020840?through=6000000196533446829 Married Elizabeth Jessop or 
2 CONC Jason, daughter of Simon of Edial.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Per WikiTree John Rhodes I was a part of William Penn's Pennsylvania Settlers community.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rhodes (Rodes, Rhoads) of Winegreaves, Derbyshire, England, and Elizabeth his wife, had children, Adam, b. 1660, Mary, John, Elizabeth, Jacob, Abraham, Sarah, Hannah and Joseph. Of these Adam and John came to Pennsylvania in 
2 CONC 1684, and the father, with Jacob and Joseph, some years later (about 1665).
2 CONT
2 CONT per Smedley: John Rodes, senior, died in Darby Twp. 8-27-1701.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT A record of the children is found in Chesterfield Monthly Meeting minutes.[6]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Adam - 30th day 6 mo 1660 (30 Aug 1660).  Married Katherine Blunston.
2 CONT * Mary - 30th day 11 mo 1662 (30 Jan 1663).  Married 1) William Maltby 2) David Rhys Williams 
2 CONT * John - 13th day of 6 mo 1664 (13 Aug 1664 - note that 1664 is written over a different year). Married Hannah Wilcox. 
2 CONT * Elizabeth - 7th day of 11 mo 1667 (7 Jan 1668).  Married Edward Dawes.
2 CONT * Jacob - 16th day of 12 mo 1670 (16 Feb 1671).  Married Margaret Warner.
2 CONT * Abraham - 11th day 10 mo 1772 (11 Dec 1772).  
2 CONT * Sarah - 5th of 3 mo 1675 (5 May 1675)
2 CONT * Hannah - 15th day of 12 mo 1677 (15 Feb 1778)
2 CONT * Joseph - 5th day of 2 mo 1680 (5 Apr 1680). Married Abigail Bonsall.
2 CONT
2 CONT
