2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Jessop-10
2 CONT
2 CONT >Quaker historian Gilbert Cope …gives no maiden name for the wife of John Rhodes though states the family was of Derbyshire. The births of the children are recorded Chesterfield Monthly meeting. …  It is unknown if Elizabeth came 
