2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Wilcox (Rhodes) Custer, she was the widow of George Custer who was killed by the Indians in the  "The Durham Gap" in Bucks Co., PA. George left also a daughter Martha who went to live with a relative in Philadelphia, Thomas P
2 CONC aschall.
