2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Custer was born on 1 May 1751, in Germantown, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, his father, George Custard, was 26 and his mother, Mary Custard, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Amelia Foulke on 20 October 1786, in Richland Township, Bucks, Pennsylvania, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT Ann Custard 1787–1877
2 CONT George Custard 1789–1854
2 CONT Mary C Spencer 1789–
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 12 January 1807, in Richland Township, Bucks, Pennsylvania, United States, at the age of 55.
