2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:Augustus Lutheran_Church_Cemetery,_Trappe,_Pennsylvania]]
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT '''Nicholas Kuster''' was born 06 Dec 1706, in Germantown, Pennsylvania.  He is a son of [[Kuster-43 | Arnold Kuster]] and [[Conrad-1060 | Gertrut Rebecca Conrad]].  <ref name="White"> White, Jean M., Editor; [[Space:The_Descendan
2 CONC ts_Of_Paulus_And_Gertrude_Kusters | The Descendants of Paulus and Gertrude Kusters of Kaldenkirchen, Germany and Germantown, Pennsylvania the first four generations]];  Castor Association ofAmerica, Mennonite Press, Newton, Kansas
2 CONC , 1991; 303 Pages, Indexed;  Pages 22, 124-128. </ref> <ref name="KY Roots"> "KY Roots", a GEDCOM import of "Our Roots.ged" by [[Arnold-1235 | Larry Arnold]]. </ref>
2 CONT He was a Blacksmith.  Living and working in Manatwwny, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.  <ref name="White"/> He married [[Hoppins-7 | Susannah Margaretta Hoppins]], 1732 in Germantown, Pennsylvania.  <ref name="White"/> <ref name=
2 CONC "KY Roots"/>   They moved to Limerick, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.  Nicholas andSusannah became members of the Augustus Lutheran Church, in Trappe, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.  Nicholas was baptized as an adult, inthe Lu
2 CONC theran Church on 12 Feb 1745 by Reverend Henry Melchoir Muhlenberg.  <ref name="White"/> Nicholas passed away 10 Dec 1784, in his home, in Montgomery County, Pennsylvania. <ref name="White"/> <ref name="KY Roots"/> He is buried in
2 CONC  the Augustus Lutheran Church Cemetery, Trappe, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania.  <ref name="White"/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas was born in 1706. He passed away in 1784. 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT <references />
2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==* Kuster-42 created through a GEDCOM import of "Our Roots.ged" on 23 Jul 2011 by [[Arnold-1235 | Larry Arnold]].
2 CONT * Find a Grave <br>
2 CONT The German-speaking Mennonite Clemmer/Clymer family settled in Bucks County, PA in the early 1700s.<br>
2 CONT Note: The maiden name of the mother appears as the middle name of her children. The spelling of surnames has been changed for uniformity.
2 CONT
2 CONT Custer, Arnold (1669 - 1739)
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendant Register, Generation No. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.ARNOLD DOORS CUSTER (PAULUS* VON HAREN CUSTER5, Arnold* (Arret Kustors) Walburgin Custer4, Johannes* Custer3, Reiner (Kuster)* Custer2, Ololus* Custer1) was born BEF 9 JUN 1669 in Kaldenkirchen, Germany, and died 1739 in Hanover
2 CONC  Township, Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania. He married Elizabeth Rebecca (Sellen) Sell ABT 1686 in Probably Krefeld, Germany. She was born ABT 1666 in Near Kaldenkirchen, Germany. He marriedGertrude (Conrad) Conrad\Kunders 24 JU
2 CONC N 1691 in Krefeld, Germany. Shewas born ABT 1671 in Krefeld, and died ABT 1698 in Germany. He married Rebecca (Nuzom)??? Nuysom ABT 1699 in Germantown, Pennsylvania. She was born ABT 1670, and died BEF 1739. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ARNOLD DOORS CUSTER and Rebecca (Nuzom)??? Nuysom are::+2  i.  Conrad (VA) Custer was born ABT 1695, and died 1 FEB 1772 in Rockingham County, Virginia. :3  ii.  Katherine Custer was born ABT 1700. She married John Jen
2 CONC kins. :+4  iii.  George Custer was born 1705, and died 1 NOV 1755 in Northampton/Carbon County, Pennsylvania (Killed by Indians while traveling through the Gap). :+5  iv.  Nicholas Custer was born 4 DEC 1706 in Germantown, Pennsyl
2 CONC vania, and died 9 DEC 1784 in Limerick Township, Montgomery County, Pennsylvnaia. :+6  v.  Paul Custer was born 1710, and died 10 NOV 1783 in MontgomeryCounty, Pennsylvnia.
2 CONT
2 CONT :7  vi.  Arnold Jr. Custer was born ABT 1720.
2 CONT
2 CONT :8  vii.  Dorothy Custer was born 1724. She married Daniel Tool. Nicolaus Koster mentioned in the record of Susannah Koster  Name: Nicolaus Koster Sex: Male Wife: Susannah Margretha Daughter: Susannah Koster Other information in t
2 CONC he record of Susannah Koster from Pennsylvania Births and Christenings
2 CONT
2 CONT Name:  Susannah Koster  Gender:  Female  Event Type:  Christening  Event Date:  04 Feb 1750  Event Place:  AUGUSTUS EVANGELICAL LUTHERAN CHURCH,TRAPPE,MONTGOMERY,PENNSYLVANIA  Birth Date:  02 Dec 1749  Father's Name:  Nicolaus Kos
2 CONC ter  Mother's Name:  Susannah Margretha
