1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Custer, son of George Custer and Susannah Long and gggrandson of Paulus Kuster and Gertrude Doors.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Data from the CAOA Archives:<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born 30 July 1776 in Maryland. George's mother died 17 October 1784 in Hagerstown, Maryland when George was but eight years old.  His father married 28 November 1784 Catharine Leatherman, and they moved to Chester County, P
2 CONC ennsylvania and in 1788 to Fayette County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT When grown, George Jr moved to Washington County, Pennsylvania and married Mary Wise on 14 May 1799.  She was born on 18 February 1777. Her parents were Andrew and Zerulah "Sarah" (Hartman) Wise.  Mary was of German ancestry, and 
2 CONC was a member of the Church of Brethren.
2 CONT
2 CONT George owned 212 acres of land in West Bethlehem Township of Washington County, Pennsylvania.  Frederick Zollars sold to him 11 January 1805 the land known as "Frederick's Hope".  Donald M Custer believes this land was located adj
2 CONC acent to that of Peter Wise, Mary's uncle.  George also purchased land from his father-in-law, Andrew Wise, in Washington County, Pennsylvania.
2 CONT
2 CONT George died 15 October 1833 while on a visit to near Dayton, Ohio to see his daughter, Susannah. He was buried in Preble County, Ohio.  The farm was sold to John and Hannah (Custer) Horn and they agreed to take care of Andrew Wise
2 CONC  (Mary's father) who died in 1840.  About 1840, Mary moved to Cass County, Indiana to be with her daughter, Susannah (Custer) Krider.  Mary died 19 July 1856 in Cass County, Indiana. She was buried in Spring Creek Cemetery, Cass C
2 CONC ounty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George and Mary:
2 CONT * John Custer+ b. 6 Jun 1800, d. 15 Jul 1849
2 CONT * Susannah Custer+ b. 23 Mar 1802, d. 12 Apr 1887
2 CONT * Hannah Custer+ b. 20 Mar 1804, d. 14 Sep 1878
2 CONT * Mary Ann Custer+ b. Feb 1806, d. 20 Oct 1846
2 CONT * Sarah Custer+ b. 9 Jun 1808, d. 3 Feb 1895
2 CONT * George Ball Custer+ b. 16 Aug 1810, d. 27 Jan 1890
2 CONT * Andrew William Custer+ b. 10 Dec 1812, d. 24 Aug 1851
2 CONT * Elizabeth Custer+ b. 27 Feb 1817, d. 12 Nov 1858
2 CONT * Samuel Aughey Custer+ b. 31 Oct 1818, d. 9 Jan 1901
2 CONT * William G. Custer b. 24 Aug 1822, d. 23 Jun 1838 [http://www.caoa-genes.org/ccweb/ccv05-o/p1.htm Source]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
