1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=214281871-1-4604&action=showRecord MyHeritage Family Trees] via son [http://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000035401452
