2 NICK Philip
2 NICK Philip Pendelton SMITH Sr
2 NICK Phillip SMITH
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Madison, Tennessee, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 SEP 1767
