2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Foster (abt. 1590 - bef. 1641) was the son of Peter Foster, fuller, named in his will.  He married Ann Juson, daughter of Henry, about 1610. Their son John emigrated to Salem Massachusetts in 1635.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Family 
