2 CONT
2 CONT '''Baptism:''' 21 Feb 1580 • Wing, Buckinghamshire, England
2 CONT "England, Buckinghamshire, Church Records, 1217-1994", [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:685S-78RS FamilySearch]; (Fri Nov 17 02:52:28 UTC 2023) – '''Affiliate Name:''' [http://www.buckscc.gov.uk/services/culture-and-le
2 CONC isure/centre-for-buckinghamshire-studies/ Centre for Buckinghamshire Studies].
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT RALPH married (1) KATHERINE FOSTER, [daughter of PETER FOSTER and
2 CONT ELLEN]  on 6 Nov 1608 in Wendover, Buckinghamshire, England.11 Katherine was born about 1577 in England  per ship’s passenger list. She was living on 3 Apr 1642 when she was admitted to the First Church of Salem, MA.12
2 CONT
2 CONT RALPH and KATHERINE had the following children:13 
2 CONT
2 CONT # +	2	M	i.   JOHN Sr. TOMPKINS was born about 1610 and died on 23 Jun 1681.
2 CONT # 	3	M	ii.  SAMUEL TOMPKINS was born about 1613. He died in 1676 in Bridgewater, MA. Will dated 1673 - age 63, his land went to Francis Cary brought up and lived with Samuel.  will mentions brother John Tompkins, cousins Mary Fost
2 CONC er, Elizabeth White, Hannah Doggett.14 SAMUEL married LETTICE FOSTER on 11 Oct 1639.15
2 CONT # 	4	F	iii.  ELIZABETH TOMPKINS was born about 1617.
2 CONT # 	5	M	iv.    MICAH?? TOMKINS was born about 1615.
2 CONT # 	6	F	v.     MARIE TOMPKINS was bapt 17 Apr 1620
2 CONT
2 CONT After her death, Ralph Tompkins married Hannah Aborne and had a daughter Martha.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Foster-16198
2 CONT
2 CONT >Peter Foster, a fuller of Wendover, dated April 20 1609, and proved July 13, 1609. Peter died between these two dates. The will mentions wife, Ellen, son Richard, daughter, Margery Cooke, daughter Elizabeth Foster, daughter Isabe
2 CONC lle Foster, son Thomas Foster, daughter Katheren Tompkins, and Ales (Alice) Skinner, "my daughter's child".
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources 
2 CONT *https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LVS1-WYQ Helene in entry for Katherine Foster, "England Births and Christening, 1538-1975"
