2 CONT Joseph’s will probated 28 May 1733, best cow best bed & furniture and 1/3 personal estate, half of  dwelling house etc to wife; son Samuel received 5 shillings, on top of what he had already received,  son Joseph received land not
2 CONC  already deeded. Joseph was to take care of his mother's livestock and was to provide for her.  Daughters Elizabeth Colburn and Jemima Wheeler each rec'd three pounds  and son Jonathan received 5 pounds in addition to what he had 
2 CONC previously received by deed. 149   
