2 CONT Re: James Murray & Lydia Hughes-Pr. Wm County By Lynn Murray March 27, 2002 at 12:30:04 In reply to: James Murray & Lydia Hughes-Pr. Wm County Kim Murray 3/26/02 The will for James (wife Lydia) Murray is found in the Fauquier Coun
2 CONC ty Will Book #1, p477.That will list three sons, Ralph, Rueben, and John, and a son-in-law John Seaton. I have seen other documentation that states that John Seaton's wife was named Alice.The will also refers to "other children" b
2 CONC ut does not name them.I decend from an Enoch Murray, b.Sept 29 1755 in Fauquier County VA and although I have never been able to document it I feel very confident that Enoch is one of the "other children". I have never seen the na
2 CONC mes you mention but would be interested in the documentation source that names them as issue from the marriage of James and Lydia.
