2 CONT Zebulon HOLLINGSWORTH I was born 16 Nov 1761 in Six Runs Creek, Duplin, North Carolina. He passed away 22 Apr 1836 in Sampson, North Carolina, United States. Zebulon was a soldier of the American Revolution, serving in the NC Mili
2 CONC tia under Col. James Kenan. He was approved a pension for Revolutionary War services in 1834. Children:
2 CONT  Edith Hollingsworth Carroll (1786 - 1856)* Zebulon Hollingsworth II (1789 - 1860)* Stephen Hollingsworth (1797 - 1870)*
