1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Morrow''' was born in 1749 in Augusta, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-24199132 William Frame] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-128572081 Susanna 'Ann' Frame (Erwin)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737354605 James Morrow] on January 1, 1772. Together they had the following children: 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737354986 William Morrow];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355053 James Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355075 Thomas Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34633168501 Jane Browning]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355202 Christopher Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355167 John Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355175 Thomas F. Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34640821717 Robert Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355180 Mary Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355199 Elizabeth Morrow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737355222 Colonel Christopher Morrow]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on October 10, 1814, in Clark, Kentucky, United States, and was buried in October 1814 there. 
2 CONT ----
