2 CONC ate: 1647; Parents: Bartholomew Partridge, Parnell Green; Children: William Partridge.
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=LMAearlyparish&h=7037189&indiv=try London, England, Baptisms, Marriages and Burials, 1538-1812]; Name: John Partridge; Marriage Date: 11 May 1619; Parish: St Gregory by St Paul; Cou
2 CONC nty: London; Borough: City of London; Spouse: Jane Hogge; Record Type: Marriage; Register Type: Parish Register.
