1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Date of birth might be 1668.
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1689 at East Hartford, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Conflicting Accounts of Sarah Olcott's Husband==
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Account #1===
2 CONT
2 CONT See '''Descendants of Thomas Olcott'''.  She married William Williams.  They both died in their 90s.  He predeceased her.  Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT # William
2 CONT # Jonathan, went abroad and was never heard of again
2 CONT # Daniel
2 CONT # Sarah, married James Forbes, Jun. of East Hartford
2 CONT # Rachel, married Mr. Burnham
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Account #2===
2 CONT
2 CONT See William Morton of Windsor who says that Jane Williams who married John Morton was the daughter of Sarah Olcott Williams and John Williams and the granddaughter of William Williams, a large landowner and early settler of East H
2 CONC artford, CT.
