1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Children of John & Elizabeth (Harbert) Blackleach:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Mary born about Nov 1665 apparently at Hartford, married 1st to Thomas WELLES, [born about 1657 died 16 Mar 1695 was son of Thomas]; married 2nd in 1695 to John OLCOTT, [bap 3 Feb 1649/50 died in 1712 was son of Thomas]; marr 3
2 CONC rd by 1723 to Capt Joseph WADSWORTH, [born 1684 died 1729 was son of William]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Welles Olcott BLACKLEACH and Thomas WELLES III are:
2 CONT *   27   i. Jonathan WELLES.
2 CONT *   28   ii. Thomas WELLES was born 16 OCT 1690.
2 CONT *   29   iii. John WELLES was born 15 DEC 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Welles Olcott BLACKLEACH and OLCOTT are:
2 CONT *   30   i. Samuel OLCOTT was born 16 AUG 1696.
2 CONT *   31   ii. Mary OLCOTT was born 1 AUG 1698.
2 CONT *   32   iii. Rachel OLCOTT was born 28 OCT 1701.
2 CONT *   33   iv. Abigail OLCOTT was born 15 FEB 1702/03.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===supporting data===
2 CONT
2 CONT *The descendants of William and Elizabeth Tuttle, who came from old to New England in 1635, and settled in New Haven in 1639, with numerous biographical notes and sketches : also, some account of the descendants of John Tuttle, of
2 CONC  Ipswich; and Henry Tuthill, of Hingham, Mass. (1883)
2 CONT *http://www.archive.org/stream/descendantsofwil01tutt#page/n375/mode/2up
2 CONT *25. ''''''THOMAS WELLES, b. Oct., 1657; d. March 16, 1695; m. 1689, MARY BLACKLEACH. She m. (2) 1695, JOHN OLCOTT of Hartf., and had 4 chil.; (3) Capt. JOSEPH WADSWORTH of Charter Oak Memory, who d. 1731, a. 81. Her 2d and 3d hus
2 CONC bands were appraisers of her 1st husband's estate, and doubtless in mental reservation included the widow in the inventory.
2 CONT *I. Thomas, b. Oct. 16, 1690; m. Aug. 25, 1716, Abigail __, sup. d. Aug. 25, 1750. 1. Thomas, bap. Sept. 14, 1718; d. bef. his f.'s est. was dist., leaving chil; 1. Thomas. 2. Hannah. 2. Daniel, bap. Aug. 25, 1722. 3. John, bap. A
