2 CONT ! (1) "A Digest of the Early Connecticut Probate Records," Vol. II, Hartford District 1700-1729, ed. by Charles W. Manwaring (Hartford, CT, 1904) p.267-268. Cites: (a) Vol. VIII, p.177; Court Record p.65. (b) Vol. IX, p.102,170.
