1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/p/o/l/Billy-F-Polk/FILE/0052text.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT MARGARET2 POLK, DAU ROBERT POLK/MAGDALEN TASKER  (ROBERT (BRUCE??)1) was born Abt. 1670 in Northern Ireland, probably, and died Aft. 04 Sep 1734 in Somerset Co., MD., probably, (See notes).  She married (1) THOMAS POLLETT 27 Dec 1
2 CONC 687 in Somerset Co., MD., (See notes under Thomas Pollitt).  He was born 1640 in England, (See notes), and died Sep 1708 in MD.,   probably Somerset Co., (See notes).  She married (2) RICHARD TULL Bet. 1708 -   1710 in MD..  He wa
2 CONC s born Abt. 1679, and died Aft. 1710.  She married (3)   CHARLES WILLIAMS Bef. 1730.  He was born Abt. 1650, and died Bet. 10 Jun -   04 Sep 1734 in Somerset Co., MD., (See notes).  
2 CONT * More About MARGARET POLK, DAU ROBERT POLK/MAGDALEN TASKER:   Date born 2: 1679, Northern Ireland; possibly Somerset Co., MD. (see notes)
2 CONT * More About THOMAS POLLETT:  Burial: Unknown, Allen, Somerset Co., MD., Pollitt Cemetery, (See notes)
2 CONT * More About THOMAS POLLETT and MARGARET POLK:  Marriage: 27 Dec 1687, Somerset Co., MD., (See notes under Thomas Pollitt)
2 CONT * More About RICHARD TULL and MARGARET POLK:  Marriage: Bet. 1708 - 1710, MD.
2 CONT * More About CHARLES WILLIAMS and MARGARET POLK:   Marriage: Bef. 1730
2 CONT
2 CONT   Children of MARGARET POLK and THOMAS POLLETT are:
2 CONT *  i. MARY POLLETT (POSS DAU THOMAS3 POLLITT), b. Aft. 1687; d.
2 CONT *   Unknown.
2 CONT *                 ii. MAGDALEN POLLETT, (POSS DAU THOMAS POLLITT), b. Aft. 1687; d.
2 CONT *   Unknown.
2 CONT *                iii. JOHN POLLETT, b. 18 Jan 1688/89, Somerset Co., MD., probably, (See
2 CONT *   notes); d. 15 Aug 1749, (See notes).
2 CONT *                 iv. THOMAS POLLETT, b. 28 Sep 1690, Somerset Co., MD., (See notes,
2 CONT *   also); d. Jan 1743/44, Somerset Co., MD., (See notes); m. SARAH MILES; b. Aft. 1689,
2 CONT *   (See notes under Thomas Pollitt); d. Abt. 1771, (See notes under Thomas Pollitt).
2 CONT *                  v. WILLIAM POLLETT, b. Abt. 1691; d. Unknown.
2 CONT *                 vi. RICHARD POLLETT, b. 17 Jun 1694, Somerset Co., MD., probably, (See
2 CONT *   notes, also); d. Unknown.
2 CONT *                vii. MARGARET POLLETT, b. 31 Mar 1700, (See notes under her father
2 CONT *   Thomas Pollitt); d. Unknown.
2 CONT *               viii. ISABEL POLLETT, b. 15 Apr 1702, Somerset Co., MD., probably, (See
2 CONT *   notes under her father Thomas Pollitt); d. Unknown.
