1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://bradboydston.blogspot.com/p/boydston-clan.html
2 CONT
2 CONT This genealogy appeared on the Chattanoogan.com website, without attribution, August 2000. A version of it appears in an article on the Hamilton County Tennessee Genealogical Society site and can be found here. It is attributed to
2 CONC  John Wilson, 14 February 1993.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Thomas Boydston (or Boylston) had gone from Renfrewshire, Scotland, to Maryland in 1656. He was born about 1634 and was a carpenter. He married Elizabeth Vaulx, daughter of Robert and Elizabeth Burwell Vaulx. Their eldest son, Th
2 CONC omas Boydston Jr., was born at Calvert County, Maryland., in 1657. He married Mahulda Box in 1677.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Their son, William Boydston, was born in 1680 at Eastern Shore, Maryland. He married Sabra Polke in 1705.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Their son, David Boydston, was born in 1710 and married Mahala Snow, then Sarah Pruitt.
2 CONT
