1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=37604288  Capt. Isaac Phelps b. 20 Aug. 1638, Windsor, m. Ann Gaylord, 11 Mar. 1665 (1645-1689), dau. of William Gaylord, Jr. & Ann Porter (Gaylord 2.1). She d.
2 CONC  27 Sept. 1690. He d. 2 June 1725, Westfield. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He moved from Windsor to Westfield where he was town clerk, assessor, surveyor, town treasurer and Schoolmaster. It is said that the Westfield church records contain a long relation to the religious experiences of Isaac Phelps. At
2 CONC  the age of 76 he was given the title of Captain, and in 1724, when he was 86, he was chosen Town Treasurer. It appears that Isaac may have been the only one of the family to be able to write, while his father, George, his uncle, 
2 CONC William Phelps and his younger brothers used primitive "marks".
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Isaac Phelps & Ann Gaylord (Phelps and Servin, p 1269):
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Phelps, Jr., b. 10 Sept. 1666, Windsor. m. Mary Moseley, 3,7 Dec. 1690 (b. 1673), dau.. of Lt. John Moseley & Mary Newburry of Westfield. She m. (2) Eleazer Weller, 7 Nov, 1704. Isaac d. 14 June 1698, Westfield, (Windsor-508
2 CONC )
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.phelpsfamilyhistory.com/research/george/george_descendants.asp  *https://archive.org/details/phelpsfamilyofam01phel   *https://archive.org/details/phelpsfamilyofam02phel *http://www.phelpsfamilyhistory.com/resources/phe
2 CONC lps/New-Phelps-Index.pdf  * The Phelps Family of America-1899 Vol. I & Vol. II 1865 pages  & New Phelps PDF Index, 254 pages and 11 page appendix.  These files are interactive copies of the original Phelps Family History and Genea
2 CONC logy, and may be read here as actual books.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/37604288/isaac-phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt Isaac Phelps BIRTH	1638 DEATH	2 Jun 1725 (aged 86–87) Westfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	 Old Burying Ground Westfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA  Show Map PLOT	Block A MEMORIAL ID	37604288 · View S
2 CONC ource
2 CONT
