2 CONC d,  Hannah  Gaylord,  b.  30 Jan.  1647;  d.  3  Aug.  1678.  After  the  death  of  Eld.  John  his  widow  married,  second,  John  Cottrell,  Jr.  Hannah  Gaylord  was  the  dau.  of  William  (William,  John, Nicholas)  and  A
2 CONC nn  (Porter)  Gaylord. 
