2 CONT
2 CONT ===Eber Crandall	===
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birth:''' 1676 Newport, Newport County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT * '''Death:''' 1727 Westerly, Washington County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT * Eber was the '''son of''' Elder John & Hannah (Gaylord) Crandall. 
2 CONT * He '''married Patience Lanphere'''.
2 CONT **  They were the '''parents of''' John, Eber, Samuel & Joseph. 
2 CONT * After her death, he '''married Mary Cottrell'''. 
2 CONT ** They were the '''parents of''' Mary B., Nathaniel, Jonathan, Ebenezer & Jeremiah. (bio by: Linda Crandall) 
2 CONT * '''Family links: '''
2 CONT **  '''Parents:'''
2 CONT ***  John Crandall (1617 - 1676)
2 CONT ***   Hannah Gaylord Crandall (1646 - 1678) 
2 CONT ** '''Spouses:'''
2 CONT ***  Patience Lanphere Crandall (1675 - 1710)*
2 CONT ***  May Cottrell Crandall (1685 - 1735)* 
2 CONT ** '''Children:'''
2 CONT ***    Eber Crandall (1705 - 1741)*
2 CONT ***    Samuel Crandall (1707 - 1762)*
2 CONT ***    Joseph Crandall (1709 - 1778)*
2 CONT ***    Jeremiah Crandall (1718 - ____)*
2 CONT **  '''Siblings:''' (**Half-sibling)
2 CONT ***    John Crandall (1649 - 1704)**
2 CONT ***    Sarah Crandall Button (1654 - 1696)**
2 CONT ***    Joseph Crandall (1661 - 1737)**
2 CONT ***    Samuel Crandall (1662 - 1736)**
2 CONT ***    Jeremiah Crandall (1673 - 1718)*
2 CONT ***    Eber Crandall (1676 - 1727) 
2 CONT * '''Burial:'''  Old Crandall Cemetery Westerly, Washington County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT
