2 CONT 19.  '''EBER18 CRANDALL''' (HANNAH17GAYLORD, ANN16PORTER, ANNA (ROSANNA)15WHITE, ROBERT W.14, ROBERT13, RICHARD12, THOMAS11, ROBERT10, ROBERT9, ALICE (ELEANOR)8HUNGERFORD, ROBERT7, ROBERT6, SIR WALTER5, THOMAS4, SIR WALTER3DE HUNG
2 CONC ERFORD, WALTER2HUNGERFORD, WALTER1DE HUNGERFORD) 
2 CONT * was born 1676 in Westerly, Washington Co., Rhode Island5,6, and 
2 CONT * died 1727.
2 CONT * He married (1) MARY ???.
2 CONT * He married (2) PATIENCE LANPHERE 1702 in Westerly, Washington Co., Rhode Island6, daughter of GEORGE LANPHERE.She was born 7, and died Abt. 1709 in WesterlyWashington Co.,Rhode Island8.
2 CONT * He married (3) MAY COTTRELL. '''Notes for EBER CRANDALL:'''
2 CONT * Eber Crandall made his will August 22, 1727 and it was proved September 15 1727 ... he bequeathed to his wife May and to children John, Eber, Samuel and Joseph, children of his second wife, and MAry Nathaniel, Jonathan, Ebenezer
2 CONC , and Jeremiah, children of third wife, and provided that his executors may sell his land and put out his children to apprenticeships.The inventory of his estate was: 1,736 pounds 5 shillings and 6 d., viz; Lands, &c. 850 pounds, 
2 CONC carpenter tools, beds, gun 69 sheep, 30 lambs, 40 swine, 11 calves, 3 heifers, 6 steers, 8 yearlings, 7 cows, 4 oxen, 1 bull, 10 horsekind, mare &c.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source is'''  "A Genealogical Hisotry," by Buckingham and Earl, page 51, specific source for this information is: John Osborne Austin, THE GENEALOGICAL DICTIONARY OF RHODE ISLAND.Oub by Joel Munsell's Sons, Albany, N.Y., 1887 (
2 CONC updated 1969), Library of Congress, F 78 A 935.      
2 CONT * '''Children of EBER CRANDALL and MARY ??? are:'''
2 CONT ** i.  SAMUEL19 CRANDALL, b. 1707, Westerly, Rhode Island; d. 1762. 
2 CONT ** ii.  JOHN CRANDALL, b. 17039; m. MARY.
2 CONT ** iii.  EBER CRANDALL, b. 17059; m. MARY LONG. 
2 CONT ** iv.  JOSEPH CRANDALL, b. 17099; m. EDITH HISCOX.     
2 CONT * '''Children of EBER CRANDALL and MAY COTTRELL are:'''
2 CONT ** v.  MARY19 CRANDALL, b. 17109; m. JOHN CRANDALL, JR..
2 CONT ** vi.  NATHANIEL CRANDALL, b. 17119; m. JEMIMA (CARTEE) WILSOX.
2 CONT ** vii.  JONATHAN CRANDALL, b. 17159; m. HANNAH DONNING. 
2 CONT ** viii.  EBENEZER CRANDALL, b. 17179; m. THANKFUL CURTIS. 
2 CONT ** ix.  JEREMIAH CRANDALL, b. 17189; m. KEZIAH.
