2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary estimated year of birth 1688-9, daughter of John and Mary (Clark) Gaylord of Windsor, Conn. Mary Gaylord married in Jan 1707 to Ebenezer Bliss, son of Samuel and Mary (Leonard) Bliss.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ebenezer Bliss and Mary Gaylord:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jedediah b 7 Feb 1709 died 30 Nov 1777 marr Rachel, daug of Joseph & Mary SHELDON
2 CONT Ebenezer b 17 Aug 1710 died 11 Mar 1776 marr Ann, daug of John GAYLORD & Hannah GRANT
2 CONT Anne b 27 July 1712 marr 24 Mar 1777 to Charles Brewer
2 CONT Moses b 9 Aug 1714 died single 13 May 1834
2 CONT Mary b 14 Mar 1716 marr 22 Apr 1736 to Isaac Brewer
2 CONT Martha b 27 Dec 1717, 2 months after her father's death, she died 20 Dec 1719.
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ "Genealogy of the Bliss family in America, from about the year 1550-1880" by John Homer Bliss, publ 1881 ? p 37, 42 https://archive.org/stream/genealogyofbliss00blis#page/42/mode/1up
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT
