2 CONT
2 CONT Johanna Gaylord was the daughter of Walter and Mary (Stebbins) Gaylord.  She was born 5 FEB 1652/53 Windsor, Hartford Ct.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=sanford%2Dshulsen&id=I63336
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna GAYLORD (Walter GAYLORD2, William GAYLORD1) was born 5 FEB 1653, and died 4 JAN 1699. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John PORTER 16 DEC 1669, son of John PORTER and Mary STANLEY. He was born 3 JAN 1651, and died 4 JAN 1699.
2 CONT  	  Children of Joanna GAYLORD and John PORTER are:
2 CONT *  	2	  i.	Joanna PORTER was born 7 FEB 1670. She married Peter MILLS 21 JUL 1692.
2 CONT *  	3	  ii.	Mary PORTER was born 20 NOV 1672. She married Hezekiah LOOMIS 30 APR 1690.
2 CONT *  	4	  iii.	John PORTER was born 17 JAN 1674, and died 2 JUL 1713. He married Mary DRAKE 23 SEP 1697, daughter of Job DRAKE and Elizabeth CLARK. She was born 29 APR 1680 in Windsor, Hartford County, CT, and died 12 SEP 1717.
2 CONT *  	5	  iv.	Sarah PORTER was born 1 JUN 1677 in Windsor, Hartford County, CT, was christened 3 JUN 1677.
2 CONT *  	6	  v.	Anna PORTER was born 26 AUG 1679.
2 CONT *  	7	  vi.	Daniel PORTER was born 13 NOV 1681, and died 17 APR 1724. He married Mindwell ALEXANDER 19 FEB 1706/1707.
2 CONT *  	8	  vii.	Martha PORTER was born 16 SEP 1683.
2 CONT *  	9	  viii.	David PORTER was born 3 OCT 1685. He married Anna PHELPS 13 JAN 1706/1707.
2 CONT *  	10	  ix.	Isaac PORTER was born 23 SEP 1687, and died 10 OCT 1689.
2 CONT *  	11	  x.	Martha PORTER was born 23 SEP 1687. She married Moses ROWLEY.
2 CONT *  	12	  xi.	Lydia PORTER was born 28 NOV 1689, and died 5 FEB 1690.
2 CONT *  	13	  xii.	Esther PORTER was born 28 NOV 1689.
2 CONT * +	14	  xiii.	Lydia PORTER was born ABT 1691, and died 12 NOV 1747 in Fairfield, Fairfield County, CT
2 CONT
