2 CONT The Sarah Skinner who died at Norton, Mass., in 1748 was not the wife of John Skinner of Windsor and Colchester. Her husband was John Skinner, son of Thomas and Mary (Platt) Skinner of Malden, Mass. See Page 21 of "The Skinner Kin
2 CONC sman" https://books.google.com/books?id=r4tRAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Natalie+Fernald&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjAk-vX1b_kAhUrSN8KHTGjDhkQ6AEwAXoECAEQAg#v=onepage&q&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the wife of John Skinner, and the daughter of John Porter III and Joanna Gaylord Porter. Death date supplied by FINDaGRAVE contributor pe986.
2 CONT
