1 OCCU Captain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.holcombegenealogy.com/data/p93.htm#i4605
2 CONT =Capt. Joseph Phelps1=
2 CONT *b. 24 June 1647, d. 1695
2 CONT *Capt. Joseph Phelps was born on 24 June 1647 at Windsor, Hartford Co., CT. 
2 CONT *He was the son of '''George Phelps''' and '''Phillury Randall'''. 
2 CONT *Capt. Joseph Phelps married '''Mary Porter''', daughter of John Porter II and Mary Stanley, on 26 June 1673. 
2 CONT *Capt. Joseph Phelps married '''Hester Hosford''' circa 1688. 
2 CONT *Capt. Joseph Phelps died in 1695. 
2 CONT *Moved with his father to Westfield, Mass., and after the birth of his first child, or about 1676, he, with his father-in-law, John Porter, Jr., Samuel Grant, Samuel Rockwell, and Thomas Bissell, removed to the East side of the Gr
2 CONC eat River and were the first settlers of East Windsor, or what is now south Windsor.
2 CONT * Married second Esther Hosford after the death of Mary Porter in 1682.  All but his last child (Hester) were from his first wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Joseph Phelps and Mary Porter
