2 CONT Hannah (Drake) Sheldon (1695 - abt. 1758)
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Sheldon formerly Drake
2 CONT Born 6 Oct 1695 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of Enoch Drake Sr. and Sarah (Porter) Drake
2 CONT Sister of Sarah Porter (Drake) Trumbull, Enoch Drake Jr, Nathaniel Drake Sr. and Samuel Drake
2 CONT Wife of Remembrance Sheldon — married 19 Feb 1719 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Remembrance Sheldon
2 CONT Died about 31 Mar 1758 at about age 62 in Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticutmap [uncertain]
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Kate Little private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 25 Jul 2020 | Created 28 Nov 2010
2 CONT This page has been accessed 361 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Sheldon and Hannah Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah, the wife of Remembrance Sheldon, died on 31 March 1758 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is buried at Palisado Cemetery, Windsor, Hartford, CT
