2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disambiguation
2 CONT
2 CONT Do not confuse this Thomas Loomis with the Thomas Loomis born in 1653.  The Thomas Loomis born in 1653 was a son of John Loomis and Elizabeth Scott and was married to Sarah White. The Thomas Loomis born in 1687-8 was a son of Thom
2 CONC as Loomis and Hannah Porter and was married to Sarah unknown last name. After she died in 1728 he married Mary Darte.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
