1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Notes
2 CONT * There's '''''no''''' primary source that '''''this''''' Sarah Loomis ever married twice.
2 CONT * There's no primary-source marriage record in the American Ancestors or FamilySearch repositories for this Sarah Loomis having married once in Connecticut or Massachusetts
2 CONT * The book ''Descendants of Joseph Loomis'' ([https://archive.org/details/descendantsofjos00loom/page/135/mode/1up?q=Jan.+8%2C+1693 Archive.org]) purports that she married only Cornelius Birge:—
2 CONT ** "21. DEAC. JOHN LOOMIS, b. Windsor. Conn., Nov. 9, 1649; m. 1st, m. 2nd, Dec. 30, 1696, Sarah (Boll wood) Warner, d. July 14, 1726, widow of Isaac Warner... 9 ch'n. [ — ]...
2 CONT *** "120. SARAH, b. Jan. 8, 1693-4; m. Feb. 28, 1721-2, Cornelius Birge, b. July 30, 1694, d. June 23, 1763. She d. Oct. 2, 1776. Ch'n: 1. Sarah, 2. Irene, 3. Hannah, 4. Abigail, 5. Capt. Jonathan, 6. Esther.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Birth in Windsor, CT
2 CONT * "Connecticut, Births and Christenings, 1649-1906", [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F771-L2L database, FamilySearch] (7 January 2020), Sarah Loomis, 8 January 1693.
2 CONT * "Sarah LOOMIS, LOOMYS, LOOMAS, LOMAS, LOOMYES d. Thomas, b. Jan. 22, 1694" – ''Connecticut: Vital Records (The Barbour Collection), 1630-1870'' at [https://www.americanancestors.org/databases/connecticut-vital-records-the-barbou
2 CONC r-collection-1630-1870/RecordDisplay?volumeId=12316&pageName=181&rId=138418580 AmericanAncestor$.org].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''<nowiki>———————————————————————————————————————</nowiki>'''
2 CONT
2 CONT (f/g) Sarah Loomis Birge 
2 CONT Birth: Jan. 8, 1692 Windsor Hartford County Connecticut 
2 CONT Death: 	Oct. 2, 1776 Bolton Tolland County Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born January 8, 1692/3 in Windsor, CT and died Oct. 2, 1776, age 81. She was the wife of Cornelius Birge and the daughter of Thomas and Hannah (Porter) Loomis. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT Thomas Loomis (1656 - 1746)
2 CONT Hannah Porter Loomis (1622 - 1738) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Cornelius Birge (1694 - 1763)
2 CONT Children: Jonathan Birge (1734 - 1776)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Bolton Center Cemetery Bolton Tolland County Connecticut, USA  Created by: KC Record added: Sep 17, 2010 [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/58826538/sarah-birge Find A Grave Memorial# 58826538]
