2 CONT 18912. Samuel Prudden. Born on 10 Aug 1673 in Milford, CT.78 Samuel was baptized in First Congregational Society, Milford, on 14 or 17 Aug 1673.69 Samuel died in Milford, CT, on 17 Oct 1742; he was 69.69
2 CONT
2 CONT On 20 Dec 1705 when Samuel was 32, he married Hannah Clark, daughter of Thomas Clark (ca 1638-23 Oct 1719) & Hannah Gibbard (ca 1641-4 Nov 1703), in Milford, CT.78 Born on 20 Mar 1679/80 in Milford, CT.78 Hannah was baptized in Fi
2 CONC rst Congregational Society, Milford, on 11 Apr 1680.69 Hannah died in 1752.69
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Samuel and Hannah (Clark) Prudden, born at Milford:
2 CONT # Samuel, b. 26 Oct 1707, d. Aug 1774 at milford, m. there 25 Feb 1741/2 Sarah Beard (b. 10 Sep 1708, d. 27 Jul 1788 at Milford, dau. of Joseph & Sarah (Smith) Beard);
2 CONT # Peter, d. 13 Feb 1777 æ. 68 at Milford, unmarried;
2 CONT # David, d. ca. 1775, unmarried;
2 CONT # Hannah, d. 28 Nov 1786 at Milford, m. there 13 Mar 1742 Samuel Platt (b. 6 Nov 1720 at Milford, bp. 17 Mar 1722/3, son of Richard & Esther (Buckingham) Platt);
2 CONT # Sarah, b. ca. 1719; and
2 CONT # Grace, b. 20 Oct 1730, d. 18 Nov 1742 at Milford.69
