1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas CLARK [1][2] was born [3] calculated 1638 in Milford, New Haven, Connecticut. He died [3] 23 Oct 1719 in Milford, New Haven, Connecticut. Thomas married [3] Hannah GIBBARD on 20 May 1663 in New Haven, Connec
2 CONC ticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT One of the twenty-five designated early Connecticut, Clark families;--of Guilford;--was earlier at New Haven and Milford;--errors have been made in identifying Thomas of Egg Harbor, New Jersey who was actually Thomas Jr. from Hadd
2 CONC am, via East Haddam and Lyme;--of New Haven;--lived in Milford before his marriage;--resided in Guilford the latter years of his life;-may have been a brother of James Clark of New Haven;
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  Sarah (Clark) Fenn, Samuel Clark, Thomas Clark, John Clark, George Clark, Thomas Clark, Joseph Clark and Hannah (Clark) Prudden
2 CONT
