1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''James Curtiss''' was born on May 4, 1686 in Stratford, Fairfield, Colony of Connecticut, British Colonial America. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-20147421 Benjamin Curtis] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-20147
2 CONC 523 Esther Curtis (Judson)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-30592346 Hannah (Coe) Curtiss] on September 16, 1709 in Stratford, Fairfield County, Connecticut, United States. Together they had the following eleven children: [https://www.geni.com/pr
2 CONC ofile-30592698 James Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-6453590 Ruth Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-33311260 Sarah Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34734932507 Esther Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-347349
2 CONC 32503 Mary Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-30592951 Phebe Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34734932497 John Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34685067814 David Curtiss, Sr.]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-1120853
2 CONC 02 Hannah Curtis]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34684714074 Abigail Curtiss]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-30592960 Eunice Curtis]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 1, 1765 in Stratford, Fairfield, Connecticut, United States and was buried in Durham, Middlesex, Connecticut. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Ref: https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/9179485
