1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 80. Samuel WILLARD Capt. (Josiah , Simon , Richard , Symon , Richard , William ) was born on Sep 1 1658 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut. He died about 1714. He was buried about 1714. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married Sarah CLARK in 1683 in Hartford, CT. Sarah was born in 1660. She died in 1722/1723. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT   167 F i Sarah WILLARD died in 1689.  
2 CONT
2 CONT + 168 M ii Samuel WILLARD Col. 
2 CONT
2 CONT + 169 M iii Rev. Joseph WILLARD 
2 CONT
2 CONT   170 F iv Mehitable WILLARD was born in 1700. She died in 1702.  
