2 CONT "Hon. Joseph Edward Willard, of Washington, D.C....He was of New England ancestry on his father's side, a descendant of Maj. Simon1 Willard of Concord, Mass., through Josiah2 of Hartford and Wethersfield, Conn., schoolmaster, who 
2 CONC married Hannah Hosmer, daughter of Thomas Hosmer of Hartford, and died in 1674, Samuel, 3 who married Sarah Clark and was commander of the fort at Saybrook, Conn., in 1696, Rev. Joseph, 4 B.A. (Yale 1714), M.A. (ib.,1717), honorar
2 CONC y A.M. (Harvard, 1723), who was born at Saybrook 23 July 1696, married Susanna Lynde..."
