1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mayflower Descendant'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca SNOW was born 23 Jul 1676 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Massachusetts, and died 31 Aug 1753 in Salisbury, Litchfield Co., Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She and her 1st husband moved from Eastham to Truro in 1711/12. They moved to Lebanon, Conn before 1714. After her 2nd husband died, she moved to Salisbury, Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=barbara54187&id=I18116
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of John SNOW and Mary SMALLEY. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Benjamin SMALLEY ca. 1694 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Massachusetts, son of Francis SMALL and Elizabeth ---. He was born between 1664 and 1670 in Maine, and died BEF 4 Jun 1721 in Lebanon, New London Co., Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John PORTER 26 Dec 1728, son of Samuel PORTER and Hannah STANLEY. He was born 12 Dec 1666 in Hadley, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts, and died 4 Jan 1747 in Hebron, Tolland Co., Connecticut.
2 CONT  	  Marriage: #1 Benjamin SMALL b: between 1664 and 1670 in Maine Married: ca. 1694 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Their 10 Children
2 CONT
2 CONT *Hannah SMALL b: 25 Nov 1695 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., MA
2 CONT *Rebecca SMALL b: 27 Apr 1697 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Ma 
2 CONT *Benjamin SMALL b: 23 Jan 1701 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Ma
2 CONT *Benjamin SMALL b: 15 Oct 1702 in Truro, Barnstable Co., Mass 
2 CONT *Mary SMALL b: 15 Mar 1705 in Truro, Barnstable Co., Mass 
2 CONT *James SMALL b: 28 Oct 1707 in Truro, Barnstable Co., Mass 
2 CONT *Phebe SMALL b: 13 Dec 1709 in Eastham, Barnstable Co., Mass 
2 CONT *Joseph SMALL b: ca. 1712 in Lebanon, New London Co., CT
2 CONT *Francis SMALL b: ca. 1714 in Lebanon, New London Co., Connecticut
2 CONT *Elizabeth SMALL b: ca. 1716 in Lebanon, New London Co., Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage # 2 - John PORTER b: 12 Dec 1666 in Hadley, Hampshire Co., Massachusetts Married: 26 Dec 1728
