2 CONT
2 CONT The son of Nathaniel & Mehitable (Porter) Goodwin, he was baptized on Nov. 10, 1695 and died at age 71 in West Hartford, Conn. He married (1) Hannah Morgan, daughter of Thomas & Rachel (Merry) Morgan and (2) Ruth Gaylord. Children
2 CONC  by first marriage: 1. Mehitabel bpt. March 30, 1723, m. Lamrock Flowers 2. Anne bpt. May 16, 1725, m. Ebenezer Mix as 2nd wife 3. Morgan bpt. Feb. 4, 1728, m. Mary Hawley 4. Isaac bpt. April 1733, m. (1) Mercy Merrill (2) Deborah
2 CONC  Francis 5. Uriah bpt. May 11, 1735, m. Mabel Francis 6. Ebenezer bpt. Oct. 30, 1737, died young 7. Ebenezer bpt. May 29, 1743, m. Anne Webster 8. Sarah b. Jan. 29, 1721, m. Elizur Wright 9. Deliverance m. Zenas Brace Ref: Familie
2 CONC s of Early Hartford, Conn., p. 273
