1 CONT Elizabeth first married and was widowed by Captain Francis Slaughter. When her second husband John Catlett died she married Reverend Armory Butler, but soon died.
1 CONT abt 1654 she was judged not married to dr james taylor  march 07 1672/73 will probated in va help to raise her nephew capt thomas hawkins[Our Family.FTW]
