1 CONT Virkus says:  Jared Spencer came with his brother, William, and Reverand Thomas Hooker to Newtown, Mass., in 1633.  He was a founder of Hartford, Ct. in 1636, and at Haddams by 1675.
1 CONT      He was a representative to the General Court in 1673 and served in King Philip's War.
1 CONT       Sarah Smith (daughter of Jared Smith, born 1644, married Stephen Backus
1 CONT ), and Sarah Smith (daughter of William Smith, married John Case) are both ancestors of William F. Lee.
1 CONT        In Hartford Time of Nov 7, 1959, Sarah Spencer is not listed as a daughter of Jared Spencer and his wife, Hannah Pratt.  Therefore, there seems to be a problem.
