0 @N6000000006348603256@ NOTE ...came with his older brothers, William, Thomas, and Michael, and other relatives, to New England, about 1632.  They settled first in Cambridge, Mass., and Michael and Gerard removed by 1637 to Lynn....About 1660 he [Gerard] remo
1 CONC ved to Hartford, Conn., where his brothers William and Thomas had long been settled.  Here he was prominent and well-to-do....He married Hannah ---, who died before Sept. 1683 (quite probably earlier), and he died about June 1685.
1 CONT
1 CONT Jacobus, Donald Lines,The ancestry of Lorenzo Ackley & his wife Emma Arabella Bosworth
1 CONT Woodstock, Vt.: N.G. Parke, 1960, 361  pgs.
