0 @N6000000003051227841@ NOTE [From "Descendants of George Heale (Hale)", http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/s/n/e/Herman-W-Snell/FILE/0007page.html]
1 CONT Born in England. Immigated to Elizabeth County, VA 1645. James River Plantation in York County 1648-9. Large holding in Lancaster County, VA 1651. He moved there in 1654. Nicholas settled in Baltimore County, Maryland where most o
1 CONC f his children were born.
1 CONT
1 CONT He died 9/8/1669 or 1671.
1 CONT
1 CONT His will was probated Feb 18, 1730 and named his wife and all children except John and Joseph as heirs to his extensive land holdings. His sons, George and John paid for laying out the town of Lancaster in 1682. Other sons, Franci
1 CONC s, Joseph, Richard, and Nicholas spread from Tidewater, VA on Chespeake Bay to Maryland.
