1 CONT : William Lee Leigh 1 Sex: M Birth: ABT 1588 in England Death: 1653 in , James, VirginiaMarriage 1 Mary Dawkes  b: ABT 1578 in < , Charles City County, Virginia>
1 CONT Marriage 2 Catherine  b: ABT 1592
