1 CONT <cheryl@loganctygenealogy.org> on Dec 22, 2004 wrote:
1 CONT
1 CONT Source:   HARDING-L@rootsweb.com
1 CONT Subject:  George Harding Line
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Is anyone researching the line of George Harding of London whose son Thomas
1 CONT came to Virginia, America in 1650. He and wife Anne Moseley had six children
1 CONT including Henry. Henry married Jane Arledge and had at least four children
1 CONT including William. William's wife is unknown. He had at least four children
1 CONT including Charles who married Rachel Lunsford. They had eight children
1 CONT including William who married Clarissa Million. William and Clarissa had at
1 CONT least 10 children including John Bennett Harding who shows up in Knox
1 CONT County, Ohio, as John Bennett Hardin in 1820. John, whose wife is unknown,
1 CONT had at least 10 children. The first 9 seem to have been named Hardin and the
1 CONT last one, Daniel, was named Harding.
1 CONT
1 CONT This line is discussed in Hardin and Harding of Virginia and Kentucky by
1 CONT Dorothy Ford Wulfeck, 1963.
1 CONT
