1 CONT 11. Charles M3 Rector (Daniel2, John "Johannes"1) was born Mar 26, 1761 in Faquier Co,
1 CONT Rectortown, VA, and died Jan 01, 1852 in Miami Co, Eire, IN (Source: Ancestral File-Church of Jesus
