1 CONT On 20 May 1663 Thomas first married Hannah Gibbard, daughter of William Gibbard & Ann Tapp (-1701).10 Born ca 1641 in New Haven, CT. Hannah was baptized in New Haven, CT on 31 Oct 1641.10 Hannah died on 4 Nov 1703 in Milford, CT.1
