1 CONT 1721 iv. John (1671-1704)
1 CONT 1722 v. George (1673-1726)
1 CONT 1723 vi. Joseph (1677-1758)
1 CONT 1724 vii. Hannah (1680-1752)
1 CONT Thomas second married Grace Judson, daughter of Lieut. Joseph Judson & Sarah Porter. Born on 19 Feb 1651 in Stratford, CT.10 Grace died in Jan 1723/4 in Milford, CT.10
